<p. 1a> <1> oṃ namaḥ śrīgurave namaḥ || 
[tataḥ śrīsiddhilakṣmīkramathaṇḍilārcanaṃ] ||
marjātātheṃvasaye || thaṇḍilihṅavane hnasakanatayāvacchāyāsanānayāya ||

tritatvenācamanaṃ ||
khphreṁ hrāṁ ātmatatvāya svāhā || khphraṁ hrīṁ vidyātatvāya svāhā ||
khphreṁ hrūṁ śivatatvāya svāhā ||
thaṇḍilisa guru namaskāra ||

aiṁ <5> akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ |
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ ||

gurubrahmā guruviṣṇu gurudeva maheśvaraṃ |
gurudeva jagatsarva tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ ||

aiṁ <5> paramagurubhyo namaḥ || aiṁ <5> parameṣṭhigurubhyo namaḥ ||
aiṁ <5> paramācārya gurubhyo namaḥ ||
thaṇḍilayāhṅavanetayā hmasakanasa || 

aiṁ <5> akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ |
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ ||

aiṁ <5> gururbrahmā guruviṣṇu gu (*) deva maheśvaraṃ |
<p. 1b> gurudeva jagatsarvaṃ tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ ||

aiṁ <5> paramagurubhyo namaḥ || aiṁ <5> parameṣṭhigurubhyo namaḥ ||
aiṁ <5> paramācārya gurubhyo namaḥ ||
balisa padmāsnāya namaḥ || thavake kūrmāsnāya namaḥ ||
pārśve akṣata vikaraṇaṃ ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya phaṭ pādukāṃ ||
vajramudrayā mukhaveṣṭanaṃ || 
khphreṁ hūṁ phaṭ vajrapaṃjare svāhā ||
daśadvārasparśanaṃ ||
khphreṁ calamakule kulamacale hrīṁ hrūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

nyāsa || 
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya phaṭ ||

karaśodhanaṃ || <4> ||

khphreṁ paramahaṃsini sarvajñātāśaktidhāmne aṅguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
khphreṁ nirvāṇamārgade tṛptiśaktidhāmne tarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ ||
khphreṁ viṣamopaplava praśamani anādibodhaśaktidhāmne madhyamābhyāṃ 
namaḥ ||
khphreṁ sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani svatantraśaktidhāmne anāmikābhyāṃ 
namaḥ ||

<p. 2a> khphreṁ sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi aluptaśaktidhāmne kaniṣṭhābhyā namaḥ 
||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya karatalapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ 
namaḥ ||
karanyāsaḥ ||

khphreṁ namaḥ sarvasiddhiyoginībhyaḥ pūrvavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ namaḥ sarvasiddhi mātṛbhyo dakṣiṇavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ namo nityoditānanda nanditāyai uttaravaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ sakalakulacakranāyikāyai paścimavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ bhagavatyai caṇḍakāpālinyai ūrddhavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
vaktranyāsaḥ ||

khphreṁ paramahaṃsini sarvajñatāśaktidhāmne hṛdayāya namaḥ ||
khphreṁ nirvāṇamārgade tṛptiśaktidhāmne śire svāhā ||
khphreṁ viṣamopaplava praśamani anādibodhaśaktidhāmne śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani svatantraśaktidhāmne kavacāya hūṃ ||

<p. 2b> khphreṁ sarvāpadāmbho taraṇi aluptaśaktidhāmne netratrayāya vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya phaṭ ||
ityaṃganyāsaḥ ||

jalapātrapūjā ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ jalapātrāsnāya pādukāṃ || khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ 
jalapātrabhaṭṭārakāya pādukāṃ ||

ṣaḍaṃga || 
khphreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || khphreṁ śirase svāhā || khphreṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ kavacāya hūṃ || khphreṁ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || khphreṁ astrāya phaṭ ||
āvāhanādi || dhenumudrāṃ darśayet || 

gāyatrī ||
khphreṁ siddhilakṣmī vidmahe navatyadhika dhīmahi tanno lakṣmīḥ pracodayāt ||
abhiṣiñcanaṃ ||

arghapātrapūjā ||
aiṁ <5> khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ arghapātrāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ ānandabhairavāya vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ śvāṁ saḥ saḥ saḥ parādevi amṛtaṃ vama <2> svāhā ||
dravyaśodhanaṃ ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ||

<p. 3a> ṣaḍaṃga || 
khphreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || khphreṁ śirase svāhā || khphreṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ kavacāya hūṃ || khphreṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || khphreṁ astrāya phaṭ ||
āvāhana sthāpana candanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||
kacchapamudrayā bhūtaśuddhiḥ || 
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hsauṁḥ hsauḥ hsphreṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ aiṁ ||

ātmapūjā || 
khphreṁ ātmane candanaṃ pādukāṃ || khphreṁ akṣataṃ pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ vīrabhasma pādukāṃ || khphreṁ sarvajanamohanī pādukāṃ ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ātmane puṣpaṃ pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani astrāya phaṭ || 
anena mantreṇa ātmaśiraśi siñcayet || <3> || 
hnasakanasa || āvāhanayāya || 
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ yā sā parāparā devī khagasthā khasvarūpiṇī | 
suralokagatā saumyā āyātu iha maṇḍale ||
idaṃ āvāhiṣye āvāhayāmi ||
triyāñjali || navātmā || 

<p. 3b> aiṁ <5> hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandaśakti bhairavānandavirādhipataye 
śkṣmlvryīṁ śrīnavātmā gurumaṇḍalabhaṭṭārakāya pādukāṃ ||

karma || 
aiṁ <5> hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandaśaktibhairavānandavīrādhipataye 
śkṣmlvryīṁ aṣṭāviṃśati karmabhaṭṭārikāyai pādukāṃ ||

mūlasthāna ||
aiṁ <5> hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandaśaktibhairavānandavīrādhipataye 
śkṣmlvryīṁ śrīpaścimamūlasthānabhaṭṭārikāyai pādukāṃ ||

tumbuleśvarī ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hdrkṣmlvryūṁ sdrkṣmlvryīṁ śrījayatumbureśvarī devyāyai 
pādukāṃ ||

śikhā ||
aiṁ <5> hsphrāṁ hsphrīṁ hsphrūṁ śrīśikhāsvacchandamahābhairavāya pādukāṃ ||

mahākāra ||
aiṁ <5> hūṁ mahākāla mahābhairavāya sarvaśatrupramathaniya pādukāṃ ||

ugracaṇḍā ||
oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍaripumardanī hūṁ phreṁ sadā rakṣa <2> tvāṃ 
māṃ juṃ saḥ mṛtyuhare pādukāṃ ||

ugracaṇḍi ||
oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade 

<p. 4a> hskhphreṁ ugracaṇḍi ripumardanī hūṁ phreṁ sadā rakṣa <2> tvāṃ māṃ juṃ 
saḥ mṛtyuhare pādukāṃ ||

siddhilakṣmī ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ||

kāli ||
oṃ phreṁ siddhikalāli hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ strīṁ phreṁ namaḥ ||

tripura ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ klvrhrhmkhlhrklhrīṁ brahmacakre oḍiyānamahāpīṭhe 
caryāsanāthātmike śrīmahātripurasundarī devī parabrahmātmaśakti pādukāṃ 
||
thvate mantrena pūjā ||
āvāhana sthāpana candanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||
yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||
taṃhālayvasapūjāyāya ||
oṃ gaṃgāyai namaḥ || oṃ jamunāyai namaḥ || oṃ narmadāyai namaḥ ||
oṃ kāveryai namaḥ || oṃ kauśikyai namaḥ || oṃ gaṇḍakai namaḥ ||
oṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ || oṃ saṃpūrṇakalasāya namaḥ || 
aiṁ <5> hskṣmlvryūṁ kulavṛkṣa mahāsena saṃmohana sakalatīrtha mantradevatā 
kalātatva tatvādhipataye brahmaviṣṇurudrātmane ātmavidyāśivatatvāya 
hskṣmlvryūṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ saṃpūrṇakalasamūrtaye pādukāṃ ||

<p. 4b> āvāhana sthāpa candanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||
dhenumudrāṃ darśayet ||
āmnāya vākyakāyāvahnasakanasa || snānaṃ || jalaṃ || 
ūkāraṃ vāyubījaṃ tadupali varuṇaṃ vajrapāṇintadūrddhaṃ 
kālaṃ varṇāntayuktaṃ tadupariparamaṃ vahnibījaṃ sahaṃsaṃ |
indubinduṃ layāntaṃ sitakamalabalaṃ kṣīradhārāśravantaṃ 
dṛṣṭvākūṭaṃtu nityaṃ dahati kulamalaṃ merutulyaṃ hi pāpaṃ ||

duduyā ||
payasāṃ paya bhūmaiva pṛthivyāṃ pūta meva ca |
kāmadhenu śravaṃ nityaṃ snāpayāmi śivājñayā ||

dhariyā ||
dadhi comāpatiṃ deva devānaṃ priyavallabhaṃ |
snāpayāmi sadā nityaṃ suprītā devatāḥ sadā ||

gherayā ||
ghṛtapūtapinākinaṃ liṅgapūtapinākinaṃ |
agnisarpasvarūpeṇa trilokaṃ janakaṃ śivaṃ ||

kastiyā ||
gomukhī śaktinodbhūtaṃ devānāṃ priya vallabhaṃ |
<p. 5a> vāṃcchā kalpatarusthena yena snānena labhyate ||

sāṣarayā ||
khaṇḍametatmahāsvādu manasā śītalaṃ tathā |
khaṇḍendu snāpitā devī akhaṇḍitavarapradā ||

tathā pañcādi payasaṃ pañcabrahmādi vāsanaṃ |
pañcadravyasamāyuktaṃ pañcāmṛtāiḥ snāpayāmyahaṃ ||

hnasakanasalaṃkhadhārahāyeke ||

aiṁ <5> śrīsamvartāmaṇḍalānte kramapadanihitānandaśaktiḥ subhī mā 
sṛṣṭaṃ nyāya catuṣkaṃ tvakulakulagataṃ pañcakañcānyaṣaṭkaṃ |
catvāraḥ paṃcakonyaḥ punarapi caturastatvato maṇḍaledaṃ
sasṛṣṭaṃ yena tasmai namata gu (*) varaṃ bhairavaṃ śrīkujeśaṃ ||

thanāthaṇḍilasalaṃkhanahāya ||

ūkāraṃ vāyubījaṃ tadupari varuṇaṃ varjapāṇintadūrddhaṃ 
kālaṃ varṇāntayuktaṃ tadupari paramaṃ vahnibījaṃ sahaṃsaṃ |
indubinduṃ layāntaṃ sitakamalavaraṃ kṣīradhārā śravantaṃ 
<p. 5b> dṛṣṭvā kūṭaṃtu nityaṃ dahati kulamalaṃ merutulyaṃ hi pāpaṃ ||

alisnāna || śkṣmlvryīṁ || ceta ||
śrīkhaṇḍacaṇḍanaṃ divyaṃ gaṃdhāḍhyaṃ sumanoharaṃ |
ābhūṣitaṃ lalātākhyaṃ candanaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||

candanairlepitaṃ puṇyaṃ pavitraṃ pāpanāsanaṃ |
āpatāharate nityaṃ lakṣmīrājya sukhapradaṃ ||

sindūra ||
vīreśvarī mahāvīra bhasmavibhūṣitaṃ |
trailokyākarṣaṇī devī sindūrāruṇamuttamaṃ ||

aduvāra ||
vastraṃ pavitra paramaṃ sukhasaubhāgyadāyakaṃ |
kārpāsikaṃ jagatmātarvastraṃ gṛhna namostute ||

dṛṣṭi ||
svargamartyaika pātāle caturdaśa pradarśakaṃ |
divyacakṣu phalāptyarthaṃ dṛṣṭikaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||

karṇapatākā ||
śurddhasiṃdūravarṇābhāṃ patākāṃ karṇasaṃjñakāṃ |
gṛhāna parameśāni catuḥkoṇāṃ suśobhanāṃ ||

paṃcapatākā ||
karṇārthayugalaṃ devi patākāṃ pañcavarṇikā |
<p. 6a> pañcasiddhi phalāptyarthaṃ gṛhāna dhvajamuttamaṃ ||

akṣata ||
akṣataṃ akṣayaṃ kāmaṃ dharmakāmārtha siddhidaṃ |
ipsitaṃ me varaṃ dehi paratre ca parāṃgatiṃ ||

jajamakā ||
yajñopavītaṃ paramaṃ pavitraṃ prajāpate yat sahajaṃ pustāt |
āyuṣyamagryaṃ pratimañca śubhraṃ yajñopavītaṃ balamastu tejaḥ ||

caṃphumāḍhe ||
chatraṃ ciṃtāmaṇindivyaṃ pūrṇacandra nibhaṃsitaṃ |
tena dattena deveśi dehi me cintitaṃ phalaṃ ||

svāna ||
nānāpuṣpasugaṃdhāḍhyaṃ mālatī kusumodayaṃ |
saubhāgyasiddhidaṃ bhadre puṣpārohanamuttamaṃ ||

hnasakanakāyāvathaṇḍilakene ||
pūrṇacandranibhaṃ śubhraṃ darpaṇaṃ śatru darpahaṃ |
ātmabimbadharaṃ yasya saṃpradāya jayāya ca ||

thamaṃ yajamānaṃ snānaṃ laṃkhanahāya || vācakalacchoya ||

[iti chāyāsnānavidhi samāptaḥ] ||

<p. 6b> atha thaṇḍilārcanaṃ || 
tritatvenācamyat ||
khphreṁ hrāṁ ātmatatvāya svāhā || khphreṁ hrīṁ vidyātatvāya svāhā ||
khphreṁ hrūṁ śivatatvāya svāhā || khphreṁ hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ sarvatatvāya svāhā ||

sūryārgha || adyādi || vākya || 
varṇāntaṃ bījamuddhṛtya tasyopari śivaṃ nyaset |
ādimadhyāvaśāne tu agnitraya vibhūṣitaṃ ||

varmaṇā dīpitaṃ kṛtvā sāvitryā cainamurddharet |
eṣa kūṭavaraḥ śreṣṭo mahāmārtaṇḍabhairavaḥ || 

arghaṃ namaḥ || puṣpaṃ namaḥ || 
hrāṁ hrīṁ hūṁ hraiṁ hrauṁ hraḥ hrīṁ saḥ śrīkulamārtaṇḍamahābhairavāya 
prakāśaśakti sahitāya namaḥ ||

rhrkṣrū(-)īṁ śrīmahāmārtaṇḍabhairavāya namaḥ ||
guru namaskāra || 
aiṁ <5> akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ |
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ ||

gururbrahmā guruviṣṇu gūrdeva maheśvaraḥ |
gurudeva jagatsarvaṃ tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ ||

aiṁ <5> paramagurubhyo namaḥ || 

