balisa padmāsnāya pādukāṃ || thavake kūrmāsanāya pādukāṃ || pārśve 
akṣata vikaraṇaṃ ||
khphreṁ saka śatrupramathanī anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya phaṭ ||
vajramudrāyā mukhaveṣṭanaṃ ||
khphreṁ hūṁ phaṭ vajrapañjale svāhā ||
daśadvārasparśanaṃ || khphreṁ calamakule kulamacale hrīṁ hrūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

nyāsa || 
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya phaṭ ||
kalaśodhanaṃ || <4> ||
khphreṁ paramahaṃsini sarvajñātāśaktidhāmne aṅguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
khphreṁ nirvāṇamārgade tṛptiśaktidhāmne tarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ ||
khphreṁ viṣamopapla praśamaṇi anādibodhaśaktidhāmne madhyamābhyāṃ 
namaḥ ||
khphreṁ sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani svatantraśaktidhāmne anāmikābhyāṃ 
namaḥ ||
khphreṁ sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi aluptaśaktidhāmne kaniṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ ||

<p. 7b> khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya 
karatalapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || iti karanyāsaḥ ||

khphreṁ namaḥ sarvasiddhiyoginībhyaḥ pūrvavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ namaḥ sarvasiddhi mātṛbhyo dakṣiṇavaktranātha pādukaṃ ||
khphreṁ namo nityoditānanda nanditāyai uttaravaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ sakalakulacakranāyikāyai paścimavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ bhagavatyai caṇḍakāpālinyai ūrddhavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
iti vaktranyāsaḥ ||

khphreṁ paramahaṃsini sarvajñatāśaktidhāmne hṛdayāya namaḥ ||
khphreṁ nirvānamārgade tṛptiśaktidhāmne śirase svāhā ||
khphreṁ viṣamopaplava praśamani anādibodhaśaktidhāmne śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani svataṃtraśaktidhāmne kavacāya hūṃ ||
khphreṁ sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi aluptaśaktidhāmne netratrayāya vaṣaṭ ||

<p. 8a> khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani aptaśaktidhāmne astrāya phaṭ ||
ityaṃganyāsaḥ ||

taṁ bhrūmadhye || dyaṁ hṛdi || thāṁ nābhau || oṃ mukhe || 
hrīṁ vāmanāśāṃ puṭe || hūṁ dakṣanāśāṃ puṭe ||
hāṁ vāmanetre || phreṁ dakṣanetre || kṣoṁ vāmakarṇe || kroṁ dakṣarṇe ||
na liṅge || maḥ guḍe || iti navadvāranyāsaḥ ||

jalapātrapūjā ||
