āvāhanādi || dhenumudrāṃ darśayet || 

gāyatrī ||
khphreṁ siddhilakṣmyai vidmahe navatyadhika dhīmahi tanno lakṣmī pracodayāt ||
abhiṣiñcanaṃ ||

arghapātrapūjā ||
