ṣaḍaṃga || 
hrāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śirase svāhā || hūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ ||
hraiṁ kavacāya hūṃ || hrauṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || hra astrāya phaṭ ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || dhenumudrāṃ (*) rśayet ||

gāyatrī ||
hrīṁ ugraṇḍāyai vidmahe durgādevī dhīmahī tanno caṇḍe pracodayāt ||

<p. 31a> arghapātrapūjā ||
aiṁ <5> arghapātrāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> aghore hrīṁ paramaghore hrīṁ ghorarūpe haḥ ghorāmukhī bhīmabhīṣaṇī vama 
<2> piva <2> ruru <2> rara <2> phaṭ hsauṁ hūṁ phaṭ ||
aiṁ <5> aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ arghapātrabhaṭṭārikāyai pādukāṃ ||

ṣaḍaṃga || 
hrāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śirase svāhā || hrūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ ||
