keśarāsanāya namaḥ || karṇikāsanāya namaḥ || padmāsnāya namaḥ ||
siṃhāsanāya namaḥ ||

atha dhyānaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> aṣṭādaśabhujāṃ devī pīnavakṣastano ruhāṃ |
kapālakheṭakaṃ ghaṇṭāṃ darpanaṃ tarjanīṃ dhanu || <1> ||

dhvajaṃ ḍamaru pāśañca vāmahastena vibhratīṃ |
khaḍgaśaktiṃ śaraṃ caiva cāṃkuśaṃ vajrabhīṣaṇaṃ || <2> ||

gadāṃ śalākayāṃ cakraṃ dadhānāṃ dakṣiṇe kare |
sūryakoṭi pratikāśāṃ nānābharanabhūtāṃ || <3> ||

siṃha mṛtyugramārūḍhāṃ sarvakarma phaladaṃ |
hārakeyūrakaṭakāṃ kirīṭa mukuṭojvalāṃ || <4> ||

sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktāṃ sarvadeva namaskṛtāṃ |
evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevīṃmipsitārtha phalapradāṃ || <5> ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

triyāṃjaliḥ ||
aiṁ <5> aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hdrkṣmlvryūṁ sdrkṣmlvryīṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ aiṁ jayatumbureśvarī 
devyāyai pādukāṃ || <3> || baliḥ ṣaḍaṃga ||

<p. 33a> hrāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śirase svāhā || hūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ ||
