āvāhanasthāpacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||

namaḥ śrīnāthāya || namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya namo namaḥ || 

[iti jayatumbeśvarī deguli samāptaṃ] ||

atha śikhāmahākāla deguliyāya ||
pūjana thaṇḍilisa || khaṭvāṅgacihna kalasa || thaṇḍilikhavalālithupāṭa balisa ||
tritatvenācamya ||
