||

guru namaskāraḥ ||
aiṁ <5> akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākālaṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ |
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ ||
aiṁ <5> gurubrahmā guruviṣṇu gurudeva maheśvaraṃ |
