vakranyāsaḥ ||

hrāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śirase svāhā || hrūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ ||
hraiṁ kavacāya hūṃ || hrauṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || hraḥ astrāya phaṭ ||
ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ ||

jalapātrapūjā ||
