arghapātrabhaṭṭārikāyai pādukāṃ ||

ṣaḍaṃga ||
hrāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śirase svāhā || hrūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ ||
hraṁ kavacāya hūṃ || hrauṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || hraḥ astrāya phaṭ ||
āvāhanādi || yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||

