hsauṁ nānāchatrālaṃkāla puṣpaṃ pādukāṃ ||

<p. 34b> aiṁ <5> aiṁ ku sauṁ pādukāṃ || <3> ||

āvāhana ||
aiṁ <5> śrīsamvartāmaṇḍalānte kramapadanihitānandaśaktiḥ subhīmā
sṛṣṭa nyāya catuṣkaṃ akulakulagataṃ pañcakañcānya ṣaṭkaṃ |
catvāro pañcakonyaṃ punarapi caturaṃ tattato maṇḍaledaṃ
saṃsṛṣṭaṃ yena tasmai namatu guravaraṃ bhairavaṃ śrīkujeśaḥ ||
idaṃ āvāhiṣye āvāhayāmiḥ ||
alūṁ anantamaṇḍala śrī ādideva pādukāṃ ||

trideva ||
aiṁ <5> narāsanāya pādukāṃ || aiṁ <5> mayūrāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> mūṣāsanāya pādukāṃ || 
aiṁ <5> thrauṁ prastaradvīpa dambhakī devī mahādhvāṃkṣa kṣetrapālāya 
pādukāṃ || baliḥ ||
aiṁ <5> śrīṁ hrīṁ kulaputravaṭukanāthāya pādukāṃ || baliḥ ||
aiṁ <5> gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaḥ glauṁ śrīkulagaṇeśvarāya pādukāṃ ||

thvatenaṃ baliḥ || āvāhanādi || tarjanī daṇḍagajamudrāṃ darśayet ||
