baliḥ || 
aiṁ <5> aiṁ hūṁ maṁ mahākālāya sarvaśatrupramardanāya mahābhairavāya 
pādukāṃ || <3> || baliḥ ||
aiṁ <5> aghore hrāṁ thaghore hrīṁ ghoraghorantare hrūṁ phreṁ sarvataḥ sarvasarve hreṁ juṁ 
saḥ hrauṁ rudrarūpe hraḥ pādukāṃ || baliḥ || ṣaḍaṃga || hrāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || 
hrīṁ śirase svāhā || hrūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ | hreṁ kavacāya hūṃ || hrauṁ 
netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || hraḥ astrāya phaṭ ||

baliviya || chāṁ chīṁ astrāya phaṭ svāhā ||
ahariti namaḥ || saṃkhakaṭe namaḥ || śānti baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā || 
vu ṛ rī namaḥ || raktākṣī namaḥ || smaśānavāsinī namaḥ ||
iṣṭayogni namaḥ || khecarī namaḥ || aiṁ <5> masānavā iṣṭayogni namaḥ ||
iṣṭabhairavāya namaḥ || vikaṭodarī namaḥ || laṃvakarṣaṇī namaḥ ||
hehekāra hrīṁ sa phreṁ phreṁ sarvayoginībhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||

