nyāsaḥ || aiṁ mṛtyuhare astrāya phaṭ || <4> ||
karaśodhanaṃ ||
oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade kaniṣṭhāya namaḥ || hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍe anāmikāya svāhā ||
ripumardani madhyamāya vauṣaṭ || hūṁ phreṁ sadā rakṣa <2> tarjanyāya hūṃ ||
tvāṃ māṃ juṃ saḥ aṅguṣṭhāya vaṣaṭ || aiṁ <5> mṛtyuhare astrāya phaṭ ||
karanyāsaḥ ||

oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hṛdayāya namaḥ || hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍe śirase svāhā ||
ripumardanī śikhāyai vauṣaṭ || hūṁ phreṁ sadārakṣa <2> kavacāya hūṃ ||
tvāṃ māṃ juṃ saḥ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || aiṁ <5> mṛtyuhare astrāya phaṭ ||
aṃganyāsaḥ ||

jalapātrapūjā ||
aiṁ <5> jalapātrāsanāya pādukāṃ || aiṁ <5> oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍe 
ripumardani hūṁ phreṁ sadārakṣa <2> tvāṃ māṃ juṃ saḥ mṛtyuhare 
jalapātrabhaṭṭārakāya pādukāṃ ||

<p. 37b> ṣaḍaṃga || 
oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hṛdayāya namaḥ || hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍe śirase svāhā || 
ripumardanī śikhāyai vauṣaṭ || hūṁ phreṁ sadārakṣa <2> kavacāya hūṃ ||
tvāṃ māṃ juṃ saḥ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || aiṁ mū mṛtyuhare astrāya phaṭ ||
āvāhanādi || dhenumudrāṃ darśayet ||

gāyatrī ||
hrīṁ ugracaṇḍāyai vidmahe durgā devi dhīmahi tanno caṇḍī pracodayāt ||

arghapātrapūjā || 
aiṁ <5> arghapātrāsanāya pādukāṃ || thorikāstra ||
aiṁ <5> aghore hrīṁ paramaghore hūṁ ghorarūpe haḥ ghorāmukhī bhīmabhīṣaṇī 
vama <2> piba <2> ruru <2> rara <2> phaṭ hsauṁ hūṁ phaṭ ||
aiṁ <5> oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍe ripumardani hūṁ phreṁ sadārakṣa <2> tvāṃ 
māṃ juṃ saḥ mṛtyure arghapātrabhaṭṭārikāyai pādukāṃ || ṣaḍaṃga ||
oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hṛdayāya namaḥ || hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍe śirase svāhā ||
ripumardanī śikhāyai vauṣaṭ || hūṁ phreṁ sadārakṣa <2> 

<PāṅE ṇO 38 īṣ ṃīṣṣīṇṅ> 

<p. 39a> vicitraiśca hāramālāvalaṃbitai || <2> ||

aṣṭādaśabhujākrāntāṃ pīnavakṣastano ruhāṃ |
sarvālaṃkārasaṃyuktāṃ taḍitkoṭisamaprabhāṃ || <3> ||

khaḍgaṃ śarastathā cakraṃ vajrāṃkuśadharāṃ śubhāṃ |
varadaṃ ḍamarūstā ca śūlapātrasuśobhitāṃ || <4> ||

dakṣiṇena karā etā yathā śobhā tathā paraṃ |
pheṭakaṃ dhanu hastāñca gadāghaṇṭā suśobhitāṃ || <5> ||

pāśañca tarjanīhastāṃ khaṭvāṅga keśa pāśakaṃ |
bindumudrā tathā siṃdhu siṃhāsanoparisthitāṃ || <6> ||

adha sthitvā siraśchinna mahiṣañca mahāsuraṃ |
taṅgrīvānnito daitya mahābalaparākramaṃ || <7> ||

bhedayitvā triśūlena vidhṛtā sā śiroruhā |
evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevīṃ sarvakāmaphalapradāṃ || <8> ||

śekhā ṣoḍaśahastā ca khaṭvāṅgamaruṃ vinā |
rudracaṇḍā pracaṇḍā ca caṇḍogrā caṇḍanāyikā || <9> ||

caṇḍācaṇḍavatī caiva caṇḍarūpāti caṇḍikā |
rocanābhānuṇā kṛṣṇā nīlā śuklā ca dhūmrikā || <10> ||

<p. 39b> pītā ca pāṇḍarājñeyā ālīḍhasthā bharisthitvā |
svaparivārasamāyuktā āyāntu iha maṇḍale || <11> ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

aiṁ <5> namaḥ śrīṁ hrīṁ caṇḍa cogrāyai namaḥ śrīṁ hrīṁ pādukāṃ || baliḥ ||

triyāṃjaliḥ ||
aiṁ <5> oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍe ripumardanī hūṁ phreṁ sadārakṣa <2> tvāṃ 
māṃ juṃ saḥ mṛtyuhare pādukāṃ || <3> ||

ṣaḍaṅga ||
oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hṛdayāya namaḥ || hsphreṁ uṁ caṇḍe śirase svāhā ||
ripumardanī śikhāyai vauṣaṭ || hūṁ phreṁ sadārakṣa <2> kavacāya hūṃ ||
tvāṃ māṃ juṃ saḥ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || mṛtyuhare astrāya phaṭ || baliḥ ||

indrādipūjā ||
aiṁ <5> lmlvryūṁ luṁ indrāya vajrahastāya surādhipataye pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> rmlvryūṁ rūṁ agnaye śaktihastāya tejādhipataye pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> mmlvryūṁ mūṁ yamāya daṇḍahastāya pretādhipataye pādukāṃ ||
kṣmlvryūṁ kṣūṁ nai(-)ṛtyāya khaḍgahastāya rākṣasādhipataye pādukāṃ ||

<p. 40a> aiṁ <5> vmlvryūṁ vaṁ varuṇāya pāśahastāya jalādhipataye pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> mmlvryūṁ yuṁ vāyūve dhvajahastāya pavanādhipataye pādukāṃ || 
<5> smlvryūṁ suṁ kuberāya gadāhastāya dhanādhipataye pādukāṃ ||
<5> hmlvryūṁ hūṁ īśānāya trilahastāya bhūtādhipataye pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> aṁ anantāya cakrahastāya nāgādhipataye pādukāṃ ||
<5> oṃ oṃ brahmaṇe padmahastāye svargādhipataye pādukāṃ || thavatenaṃ baliḥ ||

jayādipūjā ||
aiṁ <5> hmryūṁ jayādevī pādukāṃ || <5> rmryūṁ vijayāyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> mmryūṁ ajitāyai pādukāṃ || <5> hmryaṁ aparājitāyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> rmryūṁ jambhanyai pādukāṃ || <5> mmryūṁ stambhanyai pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> kṣmryūṁ mohanyai pādukāṃ || <5> ymryūṁ ākarṣaṇyai pādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ baliḥ ||

brahmaṇyādipūjā ||
haṃsāsanāya pādukāṃ || vṛṣāsanāya pādukāṃ || 
mayūrāsanāya pādukāṃ || garuḍāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
mahiṣāsanāya pādukāṃ ||

<p. 40b> gajāsanāya pādukāṃ || pretāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
narāsanāya pādukāṃ || 
aiṁ <5> aṁ āṁ rudracaṇḍā brahmāyaṇyai pādukāṃ ||
iṁ īṁ pracaṇḍā māheśvaryai pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> ūṁ caṇḍogrā komāryai pādukāṃ ||
<5> ṛṁ ṝṁ caṇḍanāyikāyai vaiṣṇavyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> ḷṁ ḹṁ caṇḍā vārāhyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> eṁ aiṁ caṇḍavatyai indrāṇyai pādukāṃ |
<5> oṁ auṁ caṇḍarūpā cāmuṇḍāyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> aṁ aḥ aticaṇḍikā mahālakṣmyai pādukāṃ || 
thvatenaṃ baliḥ ||

ṣaṭḍākinīpūjā ||
aiṁ <5> ḍāṁ ḍīṁ ḍūṁ ḍmlvryūṁ ḍākinyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> rāṁ rīṁ rūṁ rmlvryūṁ rākinyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> lāṁ līṁ lūṁ lmlvryūṁ lākinyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> kāṁ kīṁ kūṁ kmlvryūṁ kāvinyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> sāṁ sīṁ sūṁ smlvryūṁ sākinyai pādukāṃ ||
<5> hāṁ hīṁ hūṁ hmlvryūṁ hākinyai pādukāṃ || 
thvatenaṃ baliḥ ||

hrīṁ pūrṇagiripīṭhāya pādukāṃ || aiṁ <5> hrīṁ jalaṃdharapīṭhāya pādukāṃ ||
<5> hrīṁ kāmarūpapīṭhāya pādukāṃ || <5> hrīṁ oḍiyāyapīṭhāya pādukāṃ ||

<p. 41a> thvatenaṃ baliḥ ||
bali mantra ||
aiṁ <5> hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hraiṁ hrauṁ phaṭ yakṣarākṣasabhūtāśca vetālā 
kṣetrapālakāḥ |
ḍākinyaśca tathā mātā pūtanākaṭapūtanāḥ |
pīṭhajā kṣetrajāścaiva kulajā viśeṣataḥ || 

nānārūpadharāścānya yogninyo balavantārāḥ |
nānādeśanivāsiṃnyo asmiñcakre samāgatāḥ ||

samayā sthāna ye cānya tathā ca balikāṃkṣinaḥ |
tṛpyaṃ tu cāśavairdevyairgandhapuṣpādi phalguṣaiḥ ||

tṛptā dadantu me kāmāṃ vācchitārthandadaṃtu me ||
hrūṁ <2> phaṭ svāhā || 
āvāhanasthāpanacaṇḍanākṣaṭapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yonibindumudrāṃ darśayet ||

tarpana ||
aiṁ <5> namaḥ śrīnāthāya || aiṁ <5> namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya ||
aiṁ <5> namaḥ śrīkujeśanāthāya namo namaḥ || 
[iti ugracaṇḍā ugracaṇḍi deguli samāptaḥ] ||

oṃ namaḥ śrīsiddhilakṣmī devyai namaḥ ||
atha śrīśrīśrīsiddhilakṣmī deguliyāya ||
thaṇḍilisa pūjana || thaṇḍilihṅavenedathupāṭavalisa thvateyāṃ ||

<p. 41b> tritatvenācamya ||

ātmatatvayā dhyāna ||
ātmatatvaparāṃ devīṃ raktavarṇāñcaturbhujāṃ |
kamaṇḍaluṃ daṇḍamāle padmañca dadhatīmbhaje ||

khphreṁ hrāṁ ātmatatvāya svāhā || 
vidyātatva dhyānaṃ ||
vidyātatvaparāṃ dhyāya chyāmavarṇāṃ caturbhujāṃ |
śaṃkhañcakraṅgadāndānaṃ pītāmbara vibhuṣitāṃ ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ vidyātatvāya svāhā ||

śivatatvadhyānaṃ ||
śivatatvaparāṃ dhyāye chvetavarṇāñcaturbhujāṃ |
triśūlaṃ kadyahastañca varadābhaya pāṇinīṃ ||
khphreṁ hrūṁ śivatatvāya svāhā ||

sarvatatvadhyānaṃ ||
sarvarūpadharāṃ śvetāṃ viśvarūpāṃ maholvaṇāṃ |
padmapretāsanāṃ dhyāyedvaradābhaya pāṇinīṃ ||
khphreṁ hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ sarvatatvāye svāhā ||

sūryārgha || adyādi || vākya ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ hrīṁ saḥ mahāmārtaṇḍabhairavāya prakāśaśaktiyuktāya 
graharāśitithiyoganakṣatrakaraṇamuhurtavāra sahitāya saparivārāya sāyudhāya 
savāhanāya arghaṃ namaḥ ||

<p. 42a> dhyāna ||
hemābhojapravālapratimaṇijaruciṃ cārukhaṭvāṅga padme 
cakraṃ śaktiṃ sapāsaṃ śṛṇimati rucirāmakṣalāṃ kapālaṃ |
hastāṃbhojairddadhānaṃ trinayana visadvedavaktrābhirāmaṃ 
mārtaṇḍaṃ vallabhārddhaṃ maṇimayamuṭairhāradīptaṃ bhajāmaḥ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

triyāṃjali ||
aiṁ hrāṁ hrīṁ saḥ mahāmārtaṇḍabhairavamūrtaye śaktiyuktāya namaḥ ||

pūjana ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ ādityādi navagrahebhyo namaḥ ||

ṣaḍaṅgena pūjā ||
hrāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śirase svāhā || hrūṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
hreṁ kavacāya hūṁ || hroṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || hraḥ astrāya phaṭ ||

japa ||
ṭhriṁ hrauṁ ṭhriṁ svāhā <10> ||

stotra ||
āśiṣakalpanāvyādhi dhvāṃtasaṃhāraghasmaraṃ |
mahāśaktidharaṃ vīraṃ vande bhaktyā divākaraṃ ||
atra gandhādi || iti sūryārgha ||

guru namaskāraḥ || dhyānaṃ ||
sahasrāra padme sthitaṃ śvetavarṇaṃ 
gurujñānamudrādharaṃ pustakañca |
varābhīti hastaṃ mudrā saṃdadhānaṃ 
dvinetraṃ bhaje śetabhūṣābhirāmaṃ ||

<p. 42b> sphurallohitāyāḥ svavāme priyāyāḥ 
karaikena nūnaṃ samāliṃgitāṅgaṃ |
sunīlotpalaṃ sandadhatyāḥ smitāsyaṃ 
vibhuṃ bhargarūpaṃ sadā cāpareṇa ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

aiṁ <5> akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ |
tatpadaṃ (*) rśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ ||

gurubrahmā guruviṣṇu gurudeva maheśvaraṃ |
gurudeva jagatsarvaṃ tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ ||
aiṁ <5> paramagurubhyo namaḥ || aiṁ <5> parameṣṭhigurubhyo namaḥ ||
aiṁ <5> paramācārya gurubhyo namaḥ ||
<5> padmāsanāya pādukāṃ || balisaḥ ||
<5> kūrmāsanāya pādukāṃ || thavake āsanataya || pārśve akṣata vikaraṇaṃ ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya phaṭ pādukāṃ ||
vajramudrayā mukhaveṣṭanaṃ || khphreṁ hrūṁ phaṭ vajrapañjare svāhā ||
daśadvārasparśanaṃ || khphreṁ calamakule kulamacale hrīṁ hrūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
mūlamantreṇa prāṇāyāmaṃ kuryāt ||

<p. 43a> atha ṛṣyādi nyāsaḥ ||
oṃ asya śrīsiddhilakṣmī mālāmantrasyā īśvara ṛṣiḥ anuṣṭupchandaḥ 
śrīsiddhilakṣmīdevatā hskhphreṁ bījaṃ svāhā śaktiḥ sarvakāryasiddhyarthe 
viniyogaḥ ||

śirasi || īśvara ṛṣaye namaḥ || mukhe || anuṣṭupchandase namaḥ ||
hṛdi śrīsiddhilakṣmī devatāyai namaḥ || mūlādhāre || hskhphreṁ bījāya namaḥ ||
pādayoḥ svāhā śaktaye namaḥ || sarvakāryārthasiddhaye viniyogaḥ ||

atha karaṃ nyāsaḥ ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya phaṭ ||
karaśodhanaṃ || 
khphreṁ paramahaṃsini sarvajñatāśaktidhāmne aṅguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
khphreṁ nirvānamārgade tṛptiśaktidhāmne tarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ ||
khphreṁ viṣamopaplava praśamani anādibodhaśakti dhāmne madhyamābhyāṃ 
namaḥ ||
khphreṁ sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadarani svatantraśaktidhāmne anāmikābhyāṃ 
namaḥ ||
khphreṁ sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi aluptaśaktidhāmne kaniṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ ||

<p. 43b> khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya 
kalatalapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || iti karaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

khphreṁ namaḥ sarvasiddhiyoginībhyaḥ pūrvavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ namaḥ sarvasiddhimātṛbhyo dakṣiṇavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ namo nityoditānanda nanditāyai uttaravaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ sakalakulacakranāyikāyai paścimavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ bhagavatyai candakāpālinyai ūrdhavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
iti vaktranyāsaḥ ||

aṅganyāsaḥ hṛdayā dhyānaṃ ||
hṛddevīṃ śvetasarvāgīṃ pāśāṃkuśadharā parāṃ |
kapālaśūlāvabhayaṃ varaṃ cādadhatīṃ nyaset ||
khphreṁ paramahaṃsini sarvajñatāśaktidhāmne hṛdayāya namaḥ ||

śirayā dhyānaṃ ||
śirodevīṃ pītavarṇā pūrvoktāyudhamaṇḍitāṃ |
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktāṃ nyasecchirasi siddhidāṃ ||
khphreṁ nirvāṇamārgade tṛptiśaktidhāmne śirase svāhā ||

<p. 44a> śikhāyā dhyānaṃ ||
śikhāyāñca śikhādevīṃ raktā pūrvāyudhaivṛtā |
mīnākṣīṃ śamadāṃ nityāṃ nyasedvīrendravanditāṃ ||
khphreṁ viṣamopaplava praśamaṇi anādibodhaśaktidhāmne śikhāyai vaṣat ||

kavacayā dhyānaṃ || 
haridvarṇāṃ varmadevīṃ pūrvavachrastramaṇḍitāṃ |
raktavastrāṃ nyaset tanvīṃ vīravṛndaika vanditāṃ ||
khphreṁ sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani svatantraśaktidhāmne kavacāya hūṃ ||

netrayā dhyānaṃ ||
netradevīṃ kṛṣṇavarṇā proktāyudhasamanvitāṃ |
netreṣu vinyasennityāṃ sarvāvayavasundarīṃ ||
khphreṁ sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi aluptaśaktidhāmne netratrayāya vauṣaṭ ||

astrayā dhyānaṃ ||
sphaṭikābhā mantradevīmāyudhaiḥ pūrvavadvṛtāṃ |
aṅge pravinyasennityamabhīṣṭārthapradāyinīṃ ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśaktidhāmne astrāya phaṭ ||
ityaṅganyāsaḥ ||

atha navadvāranyāsaḥ ||
tato dhyānaṃ ||

<p. 44b> devīhāṭakamaṃjuvarṇa sahitā mūlaṃ mukhaṃ lohitaṃ 
vāmaṃ dakṣiṇavavaktrayugalaṃ pītaṃsitaṃ sundaraṃ |
ūrddhantuṇḍamudīritaṃ tadasitaṃ pārśve mahāmañjulaṃ 
vandyaṃ vaktrayugaṃ supātalamidaṃ śrībhairavenoditaṃ ||

tasyorddhaṃ gaditaṃ manoharataraṃ cāsyaṃ vicitraṃ śubhaṃ 
tatpārśve vadanadvayaṃ hi viditaṃ dhūmraṃ mahābhīṣaṇaṃ |
nāgaṃ ghaṇṭamidaṃ triśūlamaparaṃ khaḍgaṃ kapālaṃ tathā 
khaṭvāṅgaṃ varabhītināśayugalaṃ ramyaṃ girivibhratī ||

citrañcāruśarāsanaṃ śaramahovṛkṣaṅgadātomare 
pīnaṃ caiva halaṃ tathā ca muśalaṃ raṃkuṃśitañcāmaraṃ | 
hastābjairdadhadṛgambujacayairnityaṃ manohāriṇī 
pretasthā gajakṛrtivaddhavasanātanvīnavāsyodbhavā ||
iti dhyānaṃ puṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

taṁ bhrūṁ madhye || dyaṁ hṛdaye || thāṁ nābhau || uṁ mukhe || hrīṁ vāmanāśāpuṭe ||
hūṁ dakṣanāśāṃpuṭe || hāṁ vāmanetre || phreṁ dakṣanetre || kṣoṁ vāmakarṇe ||
kroṁ dakṣakarṇe ||

<p. 45a> na liṅge || maḥ guḍe || 
iti navadvāranyāsaḥ ||

atha prāṇāyāmaḥ ||
haṃ saḥ hsauṁ iti iḍayājīvapuruṣaṃ brahmaraṃdhre nivedayet ||

tato vāmakakṣataṭe sakalakalukhaṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ vibhāvya dagdhaṃ bhāvayat ||

puna || khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gaṇapataye namaḥ || dakṣabhuje || 
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ vaṭukāya namaḥ || vāmabhuje || 
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ durgāyai namaḥ || dakṣorau ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kṣāṁ kṣetrapālāya namaḥ || vāmorau ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ paṁ paramātmane namaḥ || hṛdi ||
ślīṁ paśuṁ hūṁ phaṭ karaśodhanaṃ kṛtvā |
vighnopasāranārthaṃ saśabdatālatrayaṃ kṛtvā hūṁ phaṭ iti digbandhaṃ kṛtvā |
dīrgha dvādaśena praṇaveṇa mūlādhārādārabhya brahmaraṃdhraparyantaṃ 
nāḍiśodhanaṃ kṛtvā |
hṛdistha jīvacaitanya saguṇyatenamārgena ||
haṃ saṃ iti urccārya saṃghaṭamudrayā dvādaśāntaṃ tvā paratejasi saṃyojya 
astreṇa tadrakṣāṃ kṛtvā ||

pādādi jānuparyantaṃ pṛthivīsthāhlā pṛthvībījaṃ ṣaṣṭhivāramāvartayet ||

<p. 45b> jale vilinaṃ saṃbhāvya jānvādyā dhāraparyantaṃ aṃbutatvaṃ hrīṁ 
aṣṭacatvāriṃśa <48> dvāramāvartyate ||
tejasi vilīnaṃ saṃbhāvya mūlādi hṛdayāntaṃ tejastatvaṃ hūṁ 
bījaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśativāra <26> vāramāvartyavāyai vilīnaṃ saṃbhāvya ||
hṛdayādi kaṇṭhāntaṃ jyo iti vāyubījaṃ <24> āvartya ākāśe vilīnaṃ 
saṃbhāvya ||

kaṇṭhādi soḍaśāntaṃ hauṁ iti bījadvādaśavāramāvartya 
svakāraṇacaitanyaṃ vilīnaṃ saṃbhāvya ||

svadehe kilviṣayaṃ <16> vāyubījena saṃśoṣya raṃ <24> agnibījena saṃdahya vaṃ <16> 
amṛtabījena plāvya hamiti punarvyomādi tatvāni svasvabījayuktāni 
dvādaśasaṃkhyā dviṣaṣṭhisaṃkhyānta varddhayan pratilomena 
svasvakāraṇādutpannāni bhāvayitvā
pṛthvi bījena koṭilya vyomabījenābhyamavakāśañca smṛtvā

<p. 46a> svadehamanogalitapāpaṃ puṇyena punaḥ sṛṣṭaṃ vibhāvya śivātmakaṃ 
jīvacaitanya sohamityuccaran jīvahaṃsamiti mantreṇa svasthānahṛtpadmaṃ nītvā 
praṇapratiṣṭhāṃ kuryā || 

mantra || <3> āṁ hrīṁ kroṁ yaṁ raṁ laṁ vaṁ śaṁ ṣaṁ saṁ haṁ haṁ saḥ paraśivasya 
vāṅmanaścakṣuśrotrajihvāghrāṇaprāṇāpāṇa ihāgatya gatya sukhaṃ 
cirantiṣṭhantu svāhā ||
prāṇapratiṣṭhā japa <12> hṛdayamudrayā ||

tato mātṛkānyāsaḥ || asya śrīmātṛkānyāsaḥ ||
asya śrīmātṛkānyāsamantrasya brahmā(-)ṛṣirgāyatrīchaṃda mātṛkāsarasvatī 
devatāhalo bījaṃ svarasaṃgrahaśakti dehaśuddhau viniyogaḥ ||
oṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ || oṃ gāyatryai namaḥ || jihvāyāṃ ||
oṃ mātṛkāsarasvatyai namaḥ || hṛdi ||
oṃ aṁ khaṁ gaṁ ghaṁ ṅaṁ āṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || aṃguṣṭhayoḥ || 
oṃ iṁ caṁ chaṁ jaṁ jhaṁ ñaṁ īṁ śirase svāhā || tarjanyoḥ ||

<p. 46b> oṃ uṁ ṭaṁ ṭhaṁ ḍaṁ ḍhaṁ ṇaṁ ūṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || madhyamāyoḥ ||
oṃ eṁ taṁ thaṁ daṁ dhaṁ naṁ aiṁ kavacāya hūṁ || anāmikāyoḥ ||
oṃ oṁ paṁ phaṁ baṁ bhaṁ maṁ auṁ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || kaniṣṭhayoḥ ||
oṃ aṁ yaṁ raṁ laṁ vaṁ śaṁ ṣaṁ saṁ haṁ laṁ kṣaṁ aḥ astrāya phaṭ || karatalapṛṣṭhayoḥ ||
oṃ aṁ kaṁ khaṁ gaṁ ghaṁ ṅaṁ āṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ ||
oṃ i caṁ chaṁ jaṁ jhaṁ ñaṁ īṁ śirase svāhā ||
oṃ uṁ ṭaṁ ṭhaṁ ḍaṁ ḍhaṁ ṇaṁ ūṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ ||
oṃ eṁ taṁ thaṁ daṁ dhaṁ naṁ aiṁ kavacāya hūṃ ||

oṃ oṁ paṁ phaṁ baṁ bhaṁ maṁ auṁ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ ||
oṃ aṁ yaṁ raṁ laṁ vaṁ śaṁ ṣaṁ saṁ haṁ laṁ kṣaṁ aḥ astrāya phaṭ || 
evaṃ ṣaḍaṃganyastvā ||
aṣṭarmātṛkādhyānaṃ ||
ādhāre liṅga nābhau hṛdayasarasije tālumūle lalāṭe 
dvīpatre ṣoḍaśāre dvidaśadaśadale dvādaśārddhacatuṣke |
vāsānte vālamadhye ḍa phakaṭha sahite kaṇṭhadeśe svarānāṃ 
haṃkṣantvārthayuktaṃ sakaladalagataṃ varṇarūpaṃ namāmi || evaṃ dhyātvā ||

tato bahirmātṛkādhyānaṃ ||

<p. 47a> pañcāśadvarṇabhedairvihivadanadoḥ pādayukkukṣivakṣo 
dehāṃ bhāsvatkapardīkalita śaśikalāmindukundāvadātām ||
akṣasrakuṃ kumbhabhittāliṣitapalikalā trikṣaṇāṃ padmasaṃ(-)
sthāmakṣākalpāmatuchastanabharamitāṃ bhāratīntāṃ namāmi || evaṃ 
dhyātvā ||

aṁ lalāṭe || āṁ mukhe || iṁ īṁ netre || uṁ ūṁ  śrotrayo || ṛṁ ṝṁ nāsāṃpuṭe ||
ḷṁ ḹṁ gaṇḍayoḥ || eṁ aiṁ oṣṭhayoḥ || oṁ auṁ urddhādhodantapaktau ||
aṁ śirasi || aḥ mukhe || kaṁ khaṁ gaṁ ghaṁ ṅaṁ dakṣabāhau ||
caṁ chaṁ jaṁ jhaṁ ña vāmabāhau || ṭaṁ ṭhaṁ ḍaṁ ḍhaṁ ṇaṁ dakṣorau ||
taṁ thaṁ daṁ dhaṁ naṁ vāmarauṁ || paṁ phaṁ pārśveyo || vaṁ pṛṣṭhe ||
bhaṁ nābhau || maṁ udale || yaṁ hṛdi || raṁ dakṣāṃśe || laṁ kakudi || 
vaṁ vāmāṃśe || śaṁ hṛdādi dakṣabāhau || ṣaṁ hṛdādi dakṣabāhau ||
saṁ hṛdādi kṣapāde || haṁ hṛdādi vāmapāde || laṁ jaṭhale || kṣaṃ mukhe || iti 
mātṛkānyāsaḥ || 

vinā nyāsena deveśi yo mantraṃ japate sadā |
<p. 47b> sarvantu niḥphalaṃ tasya vadhire karṇa jāpayet ||

tato nyāsamārabhet ||
prathamaṣaddutīnyāsaḥ ||
hṛdayadutī dhyānaṃ ||
nīlavarṇā mahāraudrāṃ arddhaparyaṅkanāṭyagā |
varvaro kacā netratrayā śavahṛdi sthitā ||
vāme kapālakaṃ dhatte khaṭvāṅgañca nṛmuṇḍakaṃ |
dakṣiṇe lāṅgalaṃ dhatte dvibhujā vyāghra kṛntinī ||
aiṁ <5> hskhphreṁ kālikāli mahākalī hrīṁ māṃsaśoṇitabhojinī hūṁ 
raktakṛṣṇamukhī devī hrauṁ māṃ māṃ paśyaṃtu śatravaḥ śrīhṛdayadūtī 
kālikā devī śrīpādukāṃ ||

śirodūtī dhyānaṃ ||
uditārkkanibhā kharvā laṃbodarā trivaktrikā |
ratnasarpāsthi bhūṣāṅgā daṃṣṭrākarāla bhāsurā ||
sadrakta muṇḍamālā ca vyāghra carmāṃśukāvṛtā |
kṛṣṇaṃ śuklaṃ mukhaṃ raktaṃ hīnaṃ dvitīkaṃ punaḥ ||
vāme dhanuśca khaṭvāṅgaṃ dvābhyāṃ mudrāñca yogajāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> aiṁ namo bhagavatī duṣṭacāṇḍālinī śatrurudhiramāṃsa bhakṣaṇī

<p. 48a> kapālakhaṭvāṅgadhariṇī hana <2> daha <2> vama <2> paca <2> hūṁ <3> amukaṃ 
māraya <2> graha <2> hrāṁ hrīṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā śrīduṣṭacāṇḍālinī śirasthāne 
śrīpādukāṃ ||

śikhādūtidhyānaṃ ||
mūttiṃ kṛṣṇāṃ khaḍgatajjāṃ trinetrāṃ śavapaṃkaje |
śikhādūtī śikhāyāñca vinyaset sādhakottamaḥ ||

aiṁ <5> aghore hrauṁ aghore hsphreṁ ghoraṃ <2> tare hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ sarvataḥ sarvasarve 
hskhphreṁ namaste rudrarūpe hsauṁ śikhāsthāne śrīśikhāsvanda śrīpādukāṃ ||

kavacadūtīdhyānaṃ ||
pītāpañcamukhā raudrā kharvalaṃbodarāśave |
khaḍgaṃśarāṃkuśaṃ kartṛ varañca vibhratī rave |
phalaṃ cāpaṃ pāśakādyā bhayaṃ vāmena vibhratī ||
aiṁ <5> hrīṁ uttoliyāsimadiyā hrīṁ savapūhaviyavaṭiyā hrīṁ diliyāsi ulekhiyā hrīṁ 
sarvadulikhiyā śrībherakhikā kavacasthāne śrīpādukāṃ ||

netradūtidhyānaṃ ||
netradūtīmatovakṣe raktālalitavigrahā |

<p. 48b> dhanuḥ śaraśūlaghaṃṭhā vāmadakṣiṇavibhratī ||
aiṁ <5> hūṁ guhyakubjike hūṁ phaṭ hrīṁ rakte mahāraktacāmuṇḍeśvarī 
aiṁ haṁ svāhā raktacāmuṇḍā netrasthāne śrīpādukāṃ ||

astradūtī dhyānaṃ ||
suraktā vajrakhaṭvāṃgaṃ vāmakareṇa vibhratī |
ullolayantī vajrañca dakṣiṇe muktakeśinī ||
jinādigambarā krāntā padāgni paṭasaṃvṛtā |
asthyābharaṇabhūṣāṅgī draṣṭrākarāla bhāsurā ||
trinetrā sarvadā caiṣā guhyapratyaṅgirā matā ||
aiṁ <5> hskhphreṁ śkhphreṁ hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ sarvopadravāna yantramantracūrṇa 
prayogādikaṃ yena kṛtaṃ kāritaṃ kariṣyanti tān sarvān hana <2> draṣṭrākarālī 
hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hlauṁ hlaiṁ ślīṁ guhyakubjike astradūtī guhyakubjike śrīpādukāṃ ||
iti ugraṣaṅkaṃ ||

tataḥ ṣaḍḍākinīnyāsaḥ ||
ḍākinīdhyānaṃ || 
grīvākūpe viśuddhau nṛpadalakamale raktavarṇā trinetrāṃ 

<p. 49a> śrīkhaṭvāṅgaṃ kapālaṃ triśiṣamapi mahācarma saṃdharayantīṃ |  
vakreṇaikena yuktāṃ paśujanabhayadāṃ pāyasāṃ na prasaktāṃ tvaksthyāṃ 
vande mṛtādyaiḥ parivṛtavapuṣāṃ ḍākinīṃ bījavandyāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> ḍāṁ ḍīṁ ḍūṁ ḍmlvryūṁ ḍākinī māṃ rakṣa <2> mama tvagdhābhūṃ rakṣa <2> 
sarvasatvavaśaṃkali śrīpādukāṃ || śrīvāyāṃ || <1> ||

rākinī dhyānaṃ ||
hṛtpadme bhānupatre dvivadanavilasad daṃṣṭrinīṃ śyāmavarṇā(-)
makṣaṃ śūlaṃ kapālaṃ ḍamarumapi bhujai dhārayantīṃ trinetrāṃ |
raktasthāṃ kālarātri prabhṛti parivṛtāṃ śuddhabhaktāpraśaktāṃ 
śrīmadvīrendravaṃdyāmabhimata phaladāṃ bhāvaya drākinīntāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> rāṁ rīṁ rūṁ rmlvryūṁ rākinī māṃ rakṣa <2> mama raktadhā bhūṃ rakṣa <2> 
sarvasatvasaṃkari śrīpādukāṃ || hṛdi || <2> ||

lākinī dhyānaṃ ||
nābhau dikpakrapadme trivanavisantrikṣaṇāṃ kṛṣṇavarṇāṃ 
śaktiṃ dambhoridaṃ ḍāvabhayamapi karairdvārayantīṃ mahogrāṃ |
<p. 49b> ḍāmaryādyaiḥ parītāṃ paśujanabhayadāṃ śuddhi dhātvaika nāthāṃ 
gauḍānte saktacittāṃ sakalasukhakarīṃ sasmarellākinīṃ tāṃ ||

aiṁ <5> lāṁ līṁ lūṁ lmlvryūṁ lākinī māṃ rakṣa <2> mama māṃsadhābhūna rakṣa <2> 
sarvasatvavaśaṃkarī śrīpādukāṃ || nābhau || <3> ||

kākinī dhyānaṃ ||
svādhisthānākhya padme rasadalalasite vedavaktrāṃ trinetrāṃ 
pītābhāṃ dhārayantīṃ triśikhaguṇamatho kādyamābhīti hastāṃ |
medo dhātu pratiṣṭhāmarimadamuditāṃ vaṃdhinī pūrvasantī 
pītāndadhvannasaktāmabhimataphaladāṃ kākinīṃ bhāvayattāṃ ||

aiṁ <5> kāṁ kīṁ kūṁ kmlvryūṁ kākinī māṃ rakṣa <2> mama medo dhātuṃ rakṣa <2> 
sarvasatvavaśaṃkarī śrīpādukāṃ || liṅge || <4> ||

sākinīdhyānaṃ ||
mūlādhārastha padme śrutidalalasite pañcavaktrāṃ trinetrāṃ 
svarṇābhāmasthisaṃsthāṃ śṛṇimapi kamalaṃ pustakaṃ jñānamudrāṃ |
vibhrāṇāṃ vāhudaṇḍaiḥ sulalitavaradāñcāpyabhītīṃ manojñāṃ 
mudrānne saktacittāṃ madhumadamuditāṃ sākinīṃ bhāvayet tāṃ ||

<p. 50a> aiṁ <5> sāṁ sīṁ sūṁ smlvyūṁ sākinī māṃ rakṣa <2> mama asthidhātuṃ rakṣa <2> 
sarvasatvavaśaṃkari śrīpādukaṃ || ādhāre || <5> ||

hākinīdhyānaṃ 
bhrūmadhye bindupadme dvidalasurasite śuklavarṇāṃ kalābjai 
rvibhrāṇāṃ jñānamudrāṃ ḍamaruka kamalaṃ cākṣamālāṃ kapālaṃ |
ṣaṭvaktrāṃ majjasaṃsthā trinayanalasitāṃ haṃsavatyādi yuktāṃ 
hāridrānne prasaktā sakalasuranutāṃ hākinīṃ bhāvayattāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> hāṁ hīṁ hūṁ hmlvryūṁ hākinī māṃ rakṣa <2> mama majjā dhātuṃ rakṣa <2> 
sarvasatvavaśaṃkarī śrīpādukāṃ || bhrūmadhye || <6> ||

yākinī dhyānaṃ ||
muṇḍavyomasthapadme sakaladalayute yākinīṃ bhairavīntāṃ 
yakṣiṇyādyāḥ samastāyudhalasitakalāṃ sarvavarṇāgayaṣṭiṃ |
ḍādīnāṃ sarvavaktrāṃ sakalasukhakarī sarvadhātu svarūpāṃ 
sarvānne saktacittāṃ paraśivaraśikāṃ bhāvayet sarvarūpāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> yāṁ yīṁ yūṁ ymlvryūṁ yākinī māṃ rakṣa <2> mama śukladhātuṃ rakṣa <2> 
sarvasatvavaśaṃkarī śrīpādukāṃ || 

<p. 50b> sahasradale brahmaraṃdhrasa ||
iti ṣaḍḍākinī nyāsaḥ ||

tato aṣṭamātṛkānyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
daṇḍaṃ kamaṇḍaluṃ paścādakṣasūtramathābhayaṃ |
vibhratīṅkanakachāyāṃ brāhmīṃ kṛṣṇājinottarāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> prayāgakṣetre aṁ aśitāṅgabhairava āṁ brahmāyaṇī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
śirasi ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śūlaṃ paraśvadhaṃ kṣudra dundubhiṃ nṛroṭikāṃ |
vahantī himasaṃkāśā dhyeyā māheśvarī śubhā ||
aiṁ <5> vārāṇasīkṣetre kaṁ ru ru bhairava kāṁ māheśvarī ambā pādukāṃ || vadane 
||

dhyānaṃ ||
aṃkuśandaṇḍakhaṭvāgau pāśañca dadhatī karaiḥ |
dhyeyā baṃdhukasaṃkāśā kaumārī kāmadāyinī ||
aiṁ <5> kolāgirikṣetre caṁ caṇḍabhairava caṁ kaumārī ambā pādukāṃ || karṇaṃ ||

dhyānaṃ || 
cakraṃ ghaṃṭhāṃ kapālañca śaṃkhañca dadhatīkaraiḥ |
tamālaśyāmalā dhyeyā vaiṣṇavī vibhramojvalā ||
aiṁ <5> aṭṭahāsakṣetre ṭaṁ krodhabhairava ṭāṁ nārāyanī ambā pādukāṃ || hṛdi ||

<p. 51a> dhyānaṃ || 
mūśalaṃ kalavārañca kheṭakaṃ dadhatīhalaṃ |
karaiścaturbhirvārāhī dhyeyā kālaghanacchuviḥ ||
aiṁ <5> jayantī kṣetre taṁ unmattabhairava tāṁ vārāhī ambā pādukāṃ || nābhau ||

dhyānaṃ ||
aṃkuśantomalaṃ vidyāṃ kuliśaṃ vibhratīkaraiḥ |
indranīlanibhendrāṇī dhyeyā sarvasamṛddhidā ||
ai <5> caritrakṣetre paṁ kapālīśabhairava pāṁ śakrārī ambā pādukāṃ || 
svādhisthāne ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śūlaṃ kṛpāṇaṃ nṛśiraḥ kapālaṃ dadhatīkaraiḥ |
mūṇḍaśrakmaṇḍitā dhyeyā cāmuṇḍā raktavigrahā ||
aiṁ <5> ekāmrakakṣetre yaṁ bhīṣaṇabhairava yāṁ cāmuṇḍā ambā pādukāṃ || 
ādhāre ||

dhyānaṃ || 
akṣasrajaṃ bījarūpaṃ kapālaṃ paṅkajaṃ karaiḥ |
vahantī himasaṃkāśā mahālakṣmī samīritā ||
aiṁ <5> devīkoṭakṣetre śaṁ saṃhārabhairava śāṁ mahālakṣmī ambā pādukāṃ || 
pāde || iti aṣṭamātṛkāṃ nyāsaḥ ||

khphreṁ <27> niruchvāsena smṛtvā || 
āmūladevyārūpeṇa brahmabhāvaṃ śūkṣmeṇa viṣṇubhāvaṃ 

<p. 51b> pareṇa rudrabhāvaṃ parikalpayet |
ityātmanā mūrtirutpādya tasyāṃ paramānandamātmānaṃ purakeṇānīya 
kumbhakena hṛdi niyojye ṣoḍhānyāsaṃ kuryāt || tatrādau ||

prathamavāmakramanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
ichārūpadharāṃ devīṃ cintayecca catubhujāṃ |
saumyarūpadharāṃ devīṃ sarvarūpadharāntathā ||
padmaśaṃkhadharāṃ pītāṃ pustakākṣa sraganvitāṃ |
sarvāstra dhāriṇīn devīṃ sarvayantra prabhañjanīṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ nāthapāda || brahmaraṃdhre || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ mahālakṣmī ambā pāda || bindudeśe ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ vyomavāmeśvarī ambā pāda || vāmanetre ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kṣacarī ambā pāda || vāmanāśāṃ puṭe ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ dikcarī ambā pāda || vaktre ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ gocarī ambā pāda || dakṣanāśe ||
hrīṁ bhūcarī ambā pāda || dakṣanetre ||
iti prathamo vāmakramaḥ ||

atha sthūlanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
nādarūpā tu sā devī piṅgalorddhānugāminī |
<p. 52a> nirdhūmārasadṛśā śāntā cārddhapratiṣṭhitā ||
sūkṣmā dīpaśikhākārā cecchārūpā nirañjanā |
khaḍgakheṭadharā devī varābhayakarāmbujā ||
saccidānandarūpā sā dhyeyā sarvasamṛddhidā |
suṣumleḍāntamadhyasthā śivateja samudbhavā ||
nādayantasamārūḍhā śivavaktrānugā parā |
anāmā nāmakoṭībhirvyākhyātaṃ tu varānane ||
yogantu īdṛśaṃ jñātvā paścādvāhye prapūjayet ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khaṁ hṛdi || hrīṁ śrīṁ phreṁ kaṃthe || hrīṁ śrīṁ raṁ tālu || hrīṁ śrīṁ eṁ 
bhrūvau || hrīṁ śrīṁ maṁ tvak śeṣe || iti vāmapañcakaṃ ||

atha granthidvādaśakanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ koṭipūrṇendubhāṃ devīṃ pañcavaktrāṃ kiriṭinīṃ |
pūrva kundendu saṃkāśaṃ kṣīrapuṃjasamaprabhaṃ ||
dakṣeśo nāsyakāṃ devīṃ vāme aśitasaṃnibhāṃ |
paścime lohitā jñeyaṃ śurddhasphaṭikasaṃnibhaṃ ||
tripañcanayanai yuktaṃ sūryamaṇḍalasaṃnibhaṃ |
jaṭāmakuṭasaṃbaddhāṃ khaṃḍendu kṛtaseṣarāṃ ||

<p. 52b> nānāratna svahemāsthi kuṃḍalāhāra naupurāṃ |
ghargharī caraṇauśobhā daityakandala mālanīṃ || 
īṣaddhāsya lalajihvāṃ draṣṭrā śobhi mukho jvalāṃ |
kiṃkinī jālasadvastrī kṣudraghaṇṭā sunādinī ||
vyāghracarmaparīdhānāṃ bhūṣitāṃ parameśvarīṃ ||
dahasta maheśāni vāmadakṣiṇadhāriṇī ||
varāśī triśikhāṃ karṣa muṇḍaṃ dakṣakare śubhāṃ |
abhiṣaṭvāṅga satpātraṃ pāśaghaṇṭāśca sottare ||
kālarudrāsanāṃ raudraṃ ekāsyaṃ ca caturbhujaṃ |
trinetraṃ raktaghorākṣaṃ vīrāsana susaṃsthitaṃ ||
kattikapālaḍamaruṃ triśūlaṃ karaśobhite |
evaṃ rudrāsanārūḍhaṃ siddhilakṣmī mahojvalāṃ ||
jvālāmālākulaṃ dhyātvā mātṛmaṇḍalamadhyagāṃ |
siddhilakṣmī mahādevīṃ sarvasiddhārtha dāyanīṃ ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

khphreṁ bhrūmadhye || oṃ namaḥ sarvasiddhiyoginībhyaḥ kaṃṭhe ||
namaḥ sarvasiddhimātṛbhyo || hṛdaye || namo nityoditānanda nanditāyai || nābhau ||
sakalakulacakranāyikāyai ||

<p. 53a> guhye || bhagavatyaiścaṇḍakāpālinyai || guḍe ||
taṁ nābhau || dyaṁ hṛdi || thāṁ dvādaśānte || prathamo mātṛkhaṇḍaḥ ||
khphreṁ brahmasthāne || hrīṁ vāmanetre || hūṁ dakṣanetre || hāṁ vāmaśotre ||
phreṁ dakṣaśotre || kṣāṁ vāmanāśāpuṭe || navaktre || maḥ śikhāyāṃ ||
ārśayo dvitīya khaṇḍaḥ || 
khphreṁ parahaṃsinī || brahmaraṃdhre || nirvāṇamārgade || nāśāgre || 
viṣamopaplava prasamani || tālu || sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani ||
hanau || sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi || kaṃṭhe || sakalaśatrupramathani || vakṣasī ||
devī āgacha <2> || hṛdaye || hasa <2> || nābhau || valna(?) <2> hṛdaye || 
nararudhirāntra vaśābhakṣaṇī || kaṃde || mama svaśatrunmarda <2> || tripaṭhe || 
khāhi <2> || jaṃghayoḥ || chindi <2> || guhyayoḥ || khaḍgaṇa tāḍaya <2> || pādayoḥ ||
chedaye <2> || pādāṃguṣṭhayoḥ || ityādhāraṣodaśake || tāvadyāvat mama 
sakalamanorathāt sādhaya <2> || pādayoḥ || paramakāriṇī || jānvoḥ || 
bhaigavati mahābhairavarūpadhāriṇi || urvoḥ || tridaśavaranamite ||

<p. 53b> guhya || sakalamantramātaḥ || nābhau || praṇatajanavatsale || hṛdi ||
devi mahākāli || kaṃṭhakūpe || kālanāsini || vaktre || hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ 
prasīdamadanāturāṃ || śrotrau || kuru <2> || netre || surāsurakanyakāṃ || śiro || 
iti granthi dvādaśake ||

atha daṇḍakrameṇa navākṣaranyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
candrakoṭyāyutaṃ prakhyāṃ himakuṇḍendusannibhāṃ |
sitavastraparīdhānāṃ navavaktrān trilocanāṃ ||
aṣṭādaśabhujāṃ devīṃ nīlakuñcitamurddhajāṃ |
svarūpāṃ cārutatvagīṃ pīnonnata payodharāṃ ||
trivalataraṅgarucirāṃ dīrghalolitalocanāṃ |
kambugrīvāñca bimboṣṭhīṃ yuvatīñcāruhāsinīṃ ||
sarvāṅgaparipūrṇāñca lakṣalakṣaṇalakṣitāṃ |
śobhitā śvetapuṣpantu sitakarpura lepitāṃ ||
kandarpaśarasaṃyuktā caṃdramuṇḍalamadhyagāṃ |
nānābharanasaṃyuktāṃ nāgayajñopavītinīṃ ||
tāmbulaparipūrṇāsyāmvidyudyotābhahāsinīṃ |
varadā bhayadāṃ devī karasāmṛtapūritāṃ ||
karadvayena saṃgṛhya rucirāṃ bhavanodbhavāṃ |
<p. 54a> khaḍgantu dakṣiṇe haste kapālaṃ vāmakekare ||
triśūlaṃ dakṣiṇe haste aṃkuśañcāpare tathā |
candraṃ vāmakare caiva bhāskaraṃ dakṣiṇekare ||
dakṣiṇantu śaraṃ devyā vāme dhanuḥ pratiṣṭhitaṃ |
śaṃkhantu dakṣiṇe haste vāme muṇḍaṃ pralaṃbitaṃ ||
darpaṇaṃ vāmahaste tu daṇḍaṃ caiva tu dakṣiṇe |
vajrantu dakṣiṇe haste vāme ghaṇṭhāṃ mahāsvanāṃ ||
etanmudrāsamāyuktāṃ saumyarūpāṃ vicintayet |
evaṃ rūpadharāṃ devimpadmāsana susaṃsthitāṃ ||
padmañca susitaṃ caiva dalāṣṭakavibhūṣitaṃ |
pretaṃ sadāśivākāraṃ trinetrañca caturbhujaṃ ||
nṛtyabhujadvayaṃ caiva dvaupāṇīpādapaṃkaje |
dvaupāṇīdhṛtaśūlākṣa sarvālaṃkālabhūṣitaṃ ||
padmapṛṣṭhe pretarājan devī varṇaṃ vicintayet |
eṣā sā paramā devī siddhilakṣmīḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

hrīṁ brahmaraṃdhre || śrīṁ bindau || hūṁ vaktre || phaṭ hṛdi || phaṭ ṣaḍādhāre ||
phaṭ nābhau || svāliṅge ||

<p. 54b> hā guḍe || 
iti daṇḍakrameṇa navākṣaranyāsaḥ ||

atha pañcavaktranyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
pretañca karṇikāntasthaṃ devīn tasyoparisthitaṃ |
viṃśatyarddhabhujopetāṃ viṃśārddharddhamukhāni vai ||
ṣaṣṭherarddhārddhanetrāṇi surddhasphaṭikasannibhāṃ |
kundendu sadṛśaṃ rūpaṃ hārakeyūramaṇḍitaṃ ||
triśūlavaradaṃ ghaṃṇṭhāṃ parśukhaṭvāṅgameva ca |
vāmabāhuṣusaṃproktā vāyudhāni varānane ||
aṃkuśañcābhayaṃ muṇḍaṃ khaḍgaṃ ca pātrameva ca |
dakṣeṣu dhṛtaśastrāṇi danujāṇāṃ vadhārthataḥ ||
dhyāye tadrupamānmasthaṃ karṇikānte pratiṣṭhayet ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

khphreṁ namaḥ sarvasiddhi yoginībhya ūrddhavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ namaḥ sarvasiddhi mātṛbhyaḥ pūrvavaktranātha pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ namo nityoditānanda nanditāyai dakṣiṇavaktranātha śrīpādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ sakalakulacakranāyikāyai uttaravaktranātha śrīpādukāṃ ||
kphreṁ bhagavatyaiścaṇḍakāpālinyai paścimavaktranātha śrīpādukāṃ ||

<p. 55a> iti pañcavaktranyāsaḥ ||

atha ṣaḍaṅganyāsa ||

hṛdayādhyānaṃ ||
ḍādimī kusumaprakhyā hṛddevī suravanditā |
daṇḍapāśau tathā bindu kapālaṃ dadhatī śivā ||
khphreṁ paramahaṃsinī sarvajñātāśakti hṛdayanātha pādukāṃ ||

śirayā dhyānaṃ ||
candravarṇā śiro devī varābhaya karā śubhā |
khaḍgakheṭadharā tadvanmuṇḍaśūlavidhāriṇī ||
khphreṁ nirvāṇamārgade nitya tṛptitā śaktiśiro nātha śrīpādukāṃ ||

śikhāyā dhyānaṃ || 
tamālanīlasarvāṅgī śikhā devī varānanā |
muśaraṃ ca tathā ghaṃṭhā vibhratī vīravanditā ||
khphreṁ viṣamopaplavaprasamani anādibodhaśikhānātha śrīpādukāṃ ||

kavacayā dhyānaṃ ||
varmadevī mahābhāgā sitaraktanibhāṅgakā |
nāgapāśaṃ halaṃ vajraṃ mūśalaṃ caiva vibhratī ||
khphreṁ sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani svatantratāśaśikavacanātha śrīpādukāṃ 
||

netrayā dhyānaṃ ||
netradevī cidānandā dhūmravarṇasamanvitā |
<p. 55b> dvibhujā pītavasanā kartṛkhanparadhāriṇī ||
khphpreṁ sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi aluptatāśakti netranātha śrīpādukāṃ ||

astrayā dhyānaṃ ||
astra devīmbhaje nityaṃ sitakṛṣṇasvarūpiṇīṃ |
kādyaṃ binduntathā ghaṇṭhāṃ triśūlaṃ dadhatīṃ punaḥ ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantaśakti astranātha śrīpādukāṃ ||
iti ṣaḍaṅganyāsaḥ ||

atha dvitīya sthūlanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
devīṃ paṃkajalocanāṃ śaśimukhīṃ hastāmbujairvibhratīṃ 
cābhītiṃ varadaṃ supāśamuśalau kumbhaṃ japābhāṃ parāṃ | 
khaṭvāṅgaṃ kamalaṃ gadāṃ japavatīṃ pātraṃ sarojāsanāṃ 
vande nirjaravanditāṃ muninutāṃ netratrayodbhāsitāṃ ||
devī āgacha <2> varadanāthaśrī || hasa <2> abhayanāthaśrī || manivaṃdhye || 
vanma <2> kalasanāthaśrī || vāmasaṃdhau || nararudhirāntavasābhakṣaṇī ||
kapālanātha pādukāṃ || vāmabāhau || mama svaśatrunmarda <2> || 
khaṭvāṅganātha pādasthāne || khāhi khāhi muṇḍanātha pāda ||

<p. 56a> dakṣaskaṃdhe || triśūlena bhiṇḍi <2> triśūlanātha pādukāṃ ||
chindi <2> aṃkuśanātha pāda || dakṣasaṃdhau || khaḍgena tāḍaya <2> khaḍganātha 
pāda || dakṣamaṇibaṃdhe || chedaya <2> pāśanātha pāda dakṣakaratale ||
evaṃ sthulanyāsa dvitīyaṃ ||

atha tṛtīya sūkṣmanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
māyārūpadharā devī nānāstrakaraśobhitā |
sarvāyudhadharā devī sarvābharaṇaśobhitā ||
bahuvaktrā bahubhujā bahupādā mahābalā |
viśvarūpā maheśāni nīlakuñcitamurddhajā ||
yathābhimatarūpāṃ vā mahālakṣmī nibhāṃ smaret ||

lalātādi vāmakramena ||
khphreṁ lalāṭe || hrīṁ netre || hūṁ gaṇḍe || hāṁ skaṃdhe || kṣauṁ bāhau ||
kroṁ kalāṃguriṣu || namaḥ pārśve || pratyaṃgire uru || mahārāve jaṃghāyāṃ ||
mahāśaṃkhe pādau || vivipāne pādāṃgulau || haḍḍa maḍḍa 
dakṣapādāṃgulau || macālinī pādayoḥ || mahākālijaṃghāyāṃ || 
kāme rāji urau || vivi ādipārśve || anthihanthikalāṃguliṣu ||

<p. 56b> paramanthikarau || soyahanthi bāhau || 
yau hi bhairikaṃdhe manovakarmani kaṇṭhe || tāhi pratyaṃgire mukhagaṇḍe | 
nivajrasarjanetre || khphreṁ pṛṣṭhavaṃśe || hrīṁ kaṭyāṃ || hūṁ ādhāre || 
hāṁ svādhisthāne || khphreṁ maṇipūrake || kṣoṁ anāhate || kroṁ viśuddhau ||
na ājñāsthāne || maḥ nāśāgre || iti tṛtīya sūkṣmanyāsaḥ ||

anantaraṃ parabhedanyāsaḥ ||

dhyāna ||
dṛkṣvātāmekavaktrāñca trinetrāñca caturbhujāṃ |
himakundendu dhavalāṃ pretasyoparisaṃsthitāṃ ||
pāśakhaḍgadharāṃ padmaṃ tīkṣṇakāṇḍakarodyatāṃ |
pūjanīyā mahādevī bindusthāne yathākramaṃ ||
khphreṁ ādhāre || sphaṁṭ anāhate || maṁ tārūṇi || hāṁ bindau || caṁ arddhacandre ||
ḍaṁ nāde || yoṁ nirodhikāyāṃ || geṁ vyāpinyāṃ || śvaṁ samanāyāṃ ||
rikulakure || sphaṭ manonmanyāṃ || vrīṁ unmanyāṃ || sphaṭ śāṃbhavānte ||
ḍīṁ hrīṁ ṣoḍaśānte || sphaṭ śūkṣmānte || vrīṁ parānte || phaṭ kule ||
iti krameṇaparanyāsaḥ ||

<p. 57a> atha muṇḍakrameṇaparanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
dhyāyedghorāṃ parāṃ bhīmāṃ raktakṛṣṇa bhayānakāṃ |
pretārūḍhāṃgīñca digvasāṃ vikṛnanāṃ ||
kapāloṣṇīṣa saṃbaddhāṃ vabhrūvarṇāṃ śiroruhāṃ |
aṣṭādaśabhujāṃ bhīmāṃ pañcavaktrāṃ kṛśodarīṃ ||
nānārūpadharāṃ devīṃ nānāstra karaśobhitāṃ |
raktapadmasamārūḍhāṃ hṛdiyugmasamanvitāṃ ||
madhye kṛśedarīndevīṃ dhyāyate sarvasiddhidāṃ |
dvau hastau cātra sannaddhau śavakarṇāvalaṃbinīṃ ||
vāme kapālaṃ khaṭvāṅgaṃ daṇḍaṃ ghaṇṭāntathaiva ca |
pāśaṃ caiva tathā padmaṃ kheṭakaṃ hyabhayantathā ||
dakṣiṇe khaḍgaśūlañca cāṃkuśaṃ vajrameva ca |
śaktiṃ nṛmuṇḍakañcaiva mudgaraṃ varadantathā ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktāṃ vyālayajñopavītinīṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

khphreṁ brahmaraṃdhre || sphaṭ tvak śeṣe || maṁ nāsāgre || hāṁ bindau || caṁ nābhau 
||
ḍaṁ vāmakarṇe || yāṁ dakṣakarṇe || geṁ vāmanetre || śveṁ dakṣanetre ||

<p. 57b> riṁ vāmanāśāpuṭe || sphaṭ dakṣanāśāpuṭe || vrīṁ vāmagaṇḍe ||
sphaṭ dakṣagaṇḍe || ḍvrīṁ vaktre || sphaṭ jihvāyāṃ || rvrīṁ dante ||
phaṭ śikhāyāṃ || iti muṇḍakrameṇaparaṃnyāsaścaturthaḥ ||

atha tvāgāṣṭakanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
ekavaktrāṣṭakabhujā devyā sadṛśarūpakā |
cakrārakeṣu saṃrūḍhā kapālāṃkuśadhāriṇī ||
khaḍgaṃ khaṭvāṅgaṃ hṛtpadmaṃ muṇḍaṃ śūlaṃ karodyatā |
mahāḍamaru hastañca netratrayāgni saṃnibhā ||
kiṃ vā paraṃvarṇayiṣye devī vyaktā svarūpataḥ ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ ḍambaranātha brahmāṇī ambā pādukāṃ || tvak śeṣe ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kamalodbhavanātha māheśvarī ambā pāda || rakte ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gagaṇanātha kaumārī ambā pāda || māṃse ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ śaṁbhunātha vaiṣṇavī ambā pāda || medani ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ nīlāṃbaranātha vārāhī ambā pāda || asthini ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ suranātha aiṁndrī ambā pāda || snāyai ||

<p. 58a> khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ khecaranātha cāmuṇḍā ambā pāda || 
majjāyāṃ ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ saṃdhāyugeśvarīnātha mahālakṣmī ambā pāda || keśāyāṃ 
|| iti tvaṃgāṣṭakaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

atha yāmalāṣṭaka nyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
ekavaktro rasabhujo vāmorusthā mṛtīśvarī |
kappūrakuṃdadhavalaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitaṃ ||
sevitā maṇḍalāsīnaḥ śūlābjābhayaśaṃkhakaḥ ||
kalasendu dhṛto hastaḥ śuddhahārasamaṇḍitaḥ ||
aruṇavarṇāmṛtā lakṣmīmekāsyā locanatrayaṃ |
caturbhujāṃ śaṃkhadharāmindrīvarasudhāriṇīṃ ||
devasyānanamālokya varadābhayapāṇinīṃ |
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitāṃ ||
evaṃ tau dhyāyate yena sarvāriṣṭavināsanaṃ ||

oṃ juṁ saḥ ajinanātha pāda || savyapāde || oṃ juṁ saḥ ānandāmbā pāda ||
vāmapāda || oṃ juṁ saḥ ipānātha pāda || dakṣajaṃghe || oṃ juṁ saḥ īśvarī ambā 
pāda || vāmajaṃghe ||

<p. 58b> oṃ juṁ saḥ udayanātha pāda || dakṣorau || oṃ juṁ saḥ ūrddhvagāminī ambā 
pāda || vāmārau || oṃ juṁ saḥ ṛddhinātha pāda || dakṣiṇapārśve || oṃ juṁ saḥ mṛti 
ambā pāda || vāmapārśve || oṃ juṁ saḥ ḷ luptadevanātha pādaḥ || dakṣakare ||
oṃ juṁ saḥ ḹ luṁ nātha ambā pāda || vāmakale || oṃ juṁ saḥ ekāṃganātha pāda ||
dakṣabāhau || oṃ juṁ saḥ airāvatī ambā pāda || vāmabāhau || oṃ juṁ saḥ 
oghanānandanātha pāda || dakṣaskaṃdhe || oṃ juṁ saḥ au kalālī ambā pāda ||
vāmaskaṃdhe || oṃ juṁ saḥ aṃ amuranātha pāda || kukudi || oṃ juṁ saḥ aḥ kṛśānu 
ambā pāda || hṛti || [iti ṣoḍhānyāsaḥ samāptaḥ] ||

asya mantrasya prajāpati ṛṣiḥ anuṣṭupchanda śrīsiddhilakṣmī devatā 
sarvārthasiddhaye japed viniyogaḥ ||
oṃ aṁ aṁ aṅguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || hrīṁ taṁ taṁ tarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ ||
hūṁ maṁ maṁ madhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ || hāṁ naṁ naṁ naṁ anāmikābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
phreṁ kaṁ kaṁ kaniṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || kṣoṁ kaṁ kaṁ karatarapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ 
|| kroṁ vāmamanibaṃdhebhyo namaḥ ||

<p. 59a> namaḥ dakṣiṇamaṇi vaṃdhyebhyo vauṣaṭ || dakṣamaṇibaṃdhye ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ || karasphālayet || iti karaṃnyāsaḥ ||

atha navadvāranyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
sphurjatkuṃkumavigrahāṃ vidhumukhīndevīṃ navāsyodbhavāṃ 
tasyostu prathamaṃ mukhaṃ vijayate pīnañca pārśve yugaṃ |
ekaṃ kundanibhaṃ hi dhūmramaparaṃ nīlaṃ ca tasyorddhagañcānyat
kokaṇadachaviṃ hime ca karuciṃ dhyāyat sadā sādhakaḥ ||
ekantu kapiśaṃ vaktramaparaṃ pātalaṃ prabhaṃ |
haridvarṇañca lalitaṃ tṛtīyaṃ vaktramīritaṃ ||
dorbhistomara parvatau sulalitāṃ ghaṇṭhāntathā darpaṇaṃ 
pāśaṃ mudgaraśakti dīrghamuśalaṃ muṇḍaṃ tathā śūlakaṃ |
dīpyatkhaḍgasu pheṭakaṃ sulalitaṃ kādyantathā cāmaraṃ 
sānandaṃ dadhatīṃ varābhayakarāṃ ṭaṃkaṃ bhaje tarjanī ||
nityāpretaśarīragā smitamukhī nānāsubhūṣojvalā 
tatvaṅgī vikacārabindanayanā devī nṛcarmāmbarā |
sphurjaddānavavṛndamardana parā dikpālavṛndairnutā
viśaṃ pātu parāri gṛhiṇī vivādharā sarvadā ||

<p. 59b> iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

oṃ brahmaraṃdhre || hrīṁ vaktramaṇḍale || hūṁ dakṣakarṇe || hāṁ vāmakarṇe ||
phreṁ jihvāmūle || kṣoṁ hṛdaye || kroṁ meḍhre namaḥ guhyamaṇḍale || 
iti navadvāraṃ nyāsaḥ ||

atha vaktrādayanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
pītagaureśvarīndevīṃ mahākāya vinoditaṃ |
navaktrodbhavāntāñca viśvasaṃtāracotkaṭāṃ ||
saptāviti netrāṇi varttulāni tu vibhratīṃ |
mūlavaktraṃ tu nāmnāya pītāruṇa samaprabhaṃ ||
siddhisarvodbhavaṃ vaktraṃ prathamaṃ divyarūpakaṃ |
pārśve yugme paratrāsaṃrāvaṇaṃ daitya duḥsahaṃ ||
dvitīyaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ vaktraṃ paramādbhutarūpakaṃ |
saṃkāśaṃ vimalākāśe mākāśaṃ tārakodgaṇaṃ ||
kṣayaṃ daitya gaṇānāñca karālaṃ viṣamaṃ paraṃ |
bhāvayet parabhāvādyaṃ samelana mahotkaṭaṃ ||
parabhāva samāsena cottaraṃ vaktrasonnataṃ |
karālaṃ gahanaṃ caiva māhāsura nipātanaṃ ||
trāsayet sarvavighnāni cottaraṃ vikarālakaṃ |
<p. 60a> kaulācāra mahāśaktaṃ madirānandavihvalaṃ ||
saṃharecca daśāntañca dakṣaṃ kauttaraṃ mukhaṃ |
mahocchuṣmaṃ paraṃ vaktraṃ saṃharet kāraṇodayaṃ ||
mahotkaṭaṃ nadatyuccairuttaraṃ vaktramudbhaṭaṃ |
rāvayedadha ūrddhvantu śabdāśabdalayaṃ mataṃ ||
phetkāraṃ ravate nityaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ vaktraṃ dullabhaṃ |
āviśet sarvakāmebhyo makaradhvaja vatsalaṃ ||
sarvakāmapradaṃ nityamuttaraṃ vaktra divyagaṃ |
divyābharaṇasaṃyuktāṃ nānālaṃkārabhūṣitāṃ ||
aṣṭādaśabhujairyuktāṃ nānābharaṇabhūṣitāṃ |
gadāvṛkṣasamāyuktāṃ tomaraṃ parvatantathā ||
ghaṇṭhādarpaṇasaṃyuktāṃ śarasāraṅgadhāriṇī |
pāśaṃ muśalasaṃyuktāṃ triśūlaṃ dakṣiṇe kale ||
khaṭvāṅgaṃ vāmasaṃyuktāṃ khaḍgakheṭaka dhāriṇīṃ |
kādyatarpaṇasaṃyuktāṃ muṇḍābhayaṃ tu kīrtitāṃ ||
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktāṃ nānāśragdāmabhūṣitāṃ |
vyāghracarmakaṭauvaddhāṃ pretāsanasamanvitāṃ |
siddhiriddhikarīndevīṃ mahācakrasamanvitāṃ ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

<p. 60b> oṃ mama svaśatrun marda <2> khāhi <2> || mūlavaktrebhyo namaḥ ||
hrīṁ triśūlena bhindi <2> chindi <2> || dakṣiṇavaktrebhyo namaḥ ||
hūṁ khaḍgena tādaya <2> chedaya <2> || karavaktra dakṣiṇebhyo namaḥ ||
hāṁ tavadyāvat mama sakalamanorathāt sādhaya <2> bhāvanāvaktra uttarebhyo 
namaḥ || phreṁ paramakāruṇike bhagavati mahābhairavarūpadhāriṇi uttaravaktra 
kālānala pādukebhyo namaḥ || 
kṣoṁ tṛdaśavaranamite sakaramantramātakaulottara vaktra dakṣiṇebhyo namaḥ ||
kroṁ praṇatajanavacchale devi mahotkaṭavaktra uttarebhyo namaḥ ||
namaḥ mahākālikālanāśani phatkāra vaktra dakṣiṇebhyo namaḥ ||
oṃ hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ prasīdamadanāturāṃ kuru <2> surāsurakarṇikāṃ makaraṃda 
vaktrebhyo namaḥ || iti vaktrodayaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

atha ṣaḍaṃganyāsaḥ || 

hṛdaya dhyānaṃ ||
hṛddevīṃ kuṃkuma prakhyāṃ khelatkhañjana locanī |
<p. 61a> śṛṇipāśadharāṃ devīṃ varābhayakarāṃbhaje ||
oṃ paramahaṃsinī nirvāṇamārgade hṛdayāya namaḥ ||

śiro dhyānaṃ ||
sphuradbaṃdhukasaṃkāśāṃ śiro devīṃ sadābhaje |
khaḍgakheṭadharāṃ nityāṃ varābhaya karodyatāṃ ||
hrīṁ viṣamopaplavapraśamani śirase svāhā ||

śikhā dhyānaṃ ||
indranīlamaṇi prakṣau śikhādevīmbhaje mudā |
kapālaśūlau dadhatīṃ varābhayakarāṃ parāṃ ||
hūṁ sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||

kavacayā dhyānaṃ ||
śukacha visamānāṅgīṃ varmadevī mṛgekṣaṇāṃ |
khaḍgakheṭakarāṃ bhavyāṃ dhanurvāṇa dharāṃ bhaje ||
hāṁ sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi kavacāya hūṃ ||

netrayā dhyānaṃ ||
karpurakuṇḍadhavalāṃ netradevīṃ śuci smitāṃ |
ṭaṃkaśūlohalaṃ vajraṃ mudā cā dadhatīmbhaje ||
phreṁ sarvaśatrupraśamani netratrayāya vaṣaṭ ||

astrayā dhyānaṃ ||
astradevīṃ dhūmravarṇāṃ phullarā jīvalocanāṃ ||

<p. 61b> varābhayakarāṃ nityāṃ śūladaṇḍadharāṃ bhaje ||
kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ āgaccha <2> hasa <2> valga <2> nararudhirāntravasābhakṣaṇi astrāya 
phaṭ || iti ṣaḍaṅganyāsaḥ ||

athāṅgajāti nyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
karālakokilādīnāṃ nibhakāntiṃ subhairavāṃ |
catubhujāmekavaktrāṃ netratritaya bhāsurāṃ ||
mahāpretasamārūḍhāṃ pātrakhaṭvāṅgadhāriṇīṃ |
pāśamudgalahastāntāṃ vasārudhiralaṃpaṭāṃ ||
mahodagrāṃ mahābhīmāṃ kṣayamādruta niḥsvarāṃ |
evaṃ vidhāṃ yantranāśe kṛtyā khārkhoda mardane ||
cintayet parameśāni cābhicāla pramardane |
śāntike śuddhahārendu tu hinācalasaṃnibhāṃ ||
pauṣṭike sitaraktābhāṃ śuṣkāṃ śuṣkānanāṃ parāṃ |
vaśe dāḍima puṣpābhāṃ kuṃkumodaka saṃnibhāṃ ||
jāti hiṃgulaka prakhyāṃ karṣaṇe cintayet sadā |
stambhanedrāyudhaprakhyāṃ stambhe macakatopamāṃ ||
jṛṃbhane hema sadṛśāṃ dāhe jvālā kulopamāṃ |
<p. 62a> uccāṭe dhūmra sadṛśāṃ māraṇe kṛṣṇapiṅgalāṃ ||
vyādhyutthoṭe karburitāṃ mohane śuka picchavat |
kākakokilavarṇābhāṃ melāpārthaṃ vicintayet ||
vipakṣakṣobhane raudra pāvakārbudasaṃnibhāṃ |
khagantapūrvarūpābhā mokṣe śuddhendu rūpiṇīṃ ||
icchārūpadharāṃ dhyāyedyathā cintāmaṇīṃ śivām ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

oṃ namaḥ sarvasiddhayoginībhyo || brahmaraṃdhre || 
namaḥ sarvasiddhimātṛbhyo vaktramaṇḍale || namo nityoditānandananditāyai || 
ghaṃṭikā sthāne || sakalakulacakranāyikāyai || kaṇṭhapūpe ||
bhagavati caṇḍakāpālinyai tadyathā || dakṣiṇabhuje ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ || vāmabhujadaṇḍe ||
khphreṁ paramahaṃsini nirvāṇamārgade || hṛdaye ||
viṣamopaplava praśamaṇi || dakṣapārśve || saladuritāriṣṭakleśadalani ||
vāmapārśve || 

<p. 62b> sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani || vāmapārśve || 
sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi || nābhimadhye || sarvaśatrupramathani || medhre ||
devi āgaccha <2> hasa <2> || guhyamaṇḍale || valga <2> nararudhirāntravasābhakṣaṇi ||
ādhāramaṇḍale || mama svaśatrunmarda <2> khāhi <2> || dakṣiṇa ūru ||
triśūlena bhindi <2> chindi <2> khaḍgena tādaya <2> chedaya <2> || vāma ūrū ||
tāvadyāvan mama sakalamanorathāt sādhaya <2> paramakāruṇike || 
dakṣiṇajaṃghāyāṃ || bhagavati mahābhairavarūpadhāriṇi || 
vāmajaṃghāyāṃ || tṛdaśavaranamite sakalamantramātaḥ || dakṣagulphe ||
praṇatajanavatsale devi || vāmagulphe || mahākāli kālanāśani || dakṣapāde ||
hūṁ <3> prasīdamadanāturāṃ || vāmapāde || hrīṁ kuru <2> surāsura kanyakāṃ ||
dakṣapādatale || hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || vāmapāde ||
oṃ ādhāramaṇḍalebhyo namaḥ || hrīṁ nābhimaṇḍalebhyo nābhimaṇḍalebhyo 
namaḥ ||

<p. 63a> hūṁ hṛdamaṇḍalebhyo namaḥ || hāṁ kaṇṭhakūpebhyo namaḥ || 
phreṁ laṃbikāsthānebhyo namaḥ || kṣoṁ dakṣaśāpuṭebhyo namaḥ || 
kroṁ vāmanāśāpuṭebhyo namaḥ || na nāśikāyāṃ namaḥ ||
maḥ kodaṇḍamadhyamaṇḍalebhyo namaḥ || ityaṃgajātinyāsaḥ || 

devyātmanorabhedena varṇadeha mantradeha paradehaṃ nyāsaṃ smaret ||

atha dehaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
devī paṃkti bhujāśarānanayutā kundendu śubhrā śubhā 
guñjannūpuramaṇḍitā śaśimukhī netratripañcānvitā |
śūlaṃ pātra varaṃ nṛmuṇḍamabhayaṃ ghaṇṭhaṃ tathā cāṃkuśaṃ 
khaḍgakheṭamathāli bindu mamalaṃ hastairdadhānā śivā ||
karṇakāntargata preta samārūḍhā sureśvarī |
sādhakānāṃ hitārthāya dadhānā rūpabhedakāṃn ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

oṃ namaḥ sarvasiddhiyoginībhyaḥ pūrvavaktraṃ nyāsaḥ ||
namaḥ sarvasiddhimātṛbhyo dakṣiṇavaktraṃ nyāsaḥ ||

<p. 63b> namo nityoditānandananditāyai uttaravaktraṃ nyāsaḥ || 
sakalakulacakranāyikāyai paścimavaktraṃ nyāsaḥ ||
sakalakulacakranāyai paścimavaktraṃ nyāsaḥ ||
bhagavatyai caṇḍakāpālinyai ūrddhavaktraṃ nyāsaḥ ||
taṁ bhrūmadhye || dyaṁ hṛdi || thauṁ nābhau || iti dehaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

atha dvāranyāsaḥ || 

dhyānaṃ ||
śubhrāṃ pretasamārūḍhāṃ navavaktrāṃ bhayaṃkarīṃ ||
aṣṭādaśabhujairyuktā vyāghracarmāmbarā vṛtāṃ ||
prathamaṃ śvetavaktrantu dakṣiṇe kṛṣṇavarṇakaṃ |
vāme pītaṃ samākhyātaṃ tadūrddhaṃ raktavarṇakaṃ ||
dakṣe kuṃkumasaṃkāśaṃ vāme nīlaṃ suśobhanaṃ |
tasyorddhaṃ dhūmrasaṃkāśaṃ dakṣe pāṭalavarṇakaṃ ||
haridvarṇantathā vāme svāyudhāni vicintayet ||
khaḍgaghaṇṭhāṃ tathā pāśaṃ triśūlaṃ muṇḍakaṃ tathā ||
śaraṅgadāntomarañca pātraṃ dakṣe vibhāvayet |
pheṭakaṃ darpaṇa caiva mūśalaṃ lalitaṃ tathā ||
khaṭvāṅgañcābhayaṃ cāpaṃ vṛkṣañca parvataṃ tathā |
binduṃ vāmakare devyāḥ sarvālaṃkārasaṃyutāṃ ||

<p. 64a> dvāranyāsaṃ vidhāyādau sarvakāmārthasiddhaye ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

oṃ mukhe || hrīṁ vāmanāśāpuṭe || hūṁ dakṣanāśāpuṭe || hāṁ vāmanetre ||
kṣoṁ vāmakarṇe || kroṁ dakṣakarṇe || na liṅge || maḥ guḍe || iti dvāraṃ nyāsaḥ ||

athāṅgaṣaṭkaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
hṛddevīṃ kundacandrābhāṃ varābhaya karāmbujāṃ |
sitapaṅkajamadhyasthāṃ vande tāṃ bhuvaneśvarīṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

oṃ paramahaṃsini hṛdaye ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śiro devīṃ kṛṣṇavarṇāṃ bhajāmi niyataṃ śivāṃ |
varābhayakarīṃ nityāṃ cārupadmaniṣeduṣīṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ || 

nirvāṇamārgade śirasi ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śikhā devī pītavarṇā śaradindu mukhī parā |
padmāsanā hi dadhatī varaṃ cābhayameva ca ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

viṣamo paplava praśamani śikhāyāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
kavaceśī sadāpātu sugatī pāṭalaprabhā |
kuśeśayagatā tanvī balābhaya lasatkarā ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani kavace ||

<p. 64b> dhyānaṃ ||
netra devī dhūmravarṇā karālavadanotkaṭā |
varābhaya dharā śuddhā jalajāta kṛtāsanā ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

sarvāpadāṃbhodhi taraṇi netraṣu ||

dhyānaṃ ||
astradevīṃ sadāvande sarojāsanasaṃsthitāṃ |
nīlāṃnīrajapatrākṣīṃ varābhayakarāṃ parāṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

sakalaśatrupramathani digdaśake astra || 
ityaṃgaṣaṭkaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

atha karāyudhadaśakanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
daśabhintu karāmbhojairdadhatīṃ siddhidāṃ parāṃ |
abhayaṃ varadaṃ kumbhaṃ khaṭvāṃgaṃ muṇḍameva ca ||
triśūlaṃ khaḍgapātrāṇi pāśañcāyudhakaṃ daśa |
devī śvetāṃ trinayanāṃ bhaje pretāsana sthitāṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

devī āgaccha <2> namaḥ || devyāḥ sakārāyāḥ āhvānaṃ svaśarīragata 
vādyagataṃ viciṃtya ||
hasa <2> svātmani anugraha parāviciṃtya ||
nararudhirāntravasābhakṣaṇi || kapālaṃ viciṃtya || dakṣahastaṃ || mama 
svaśatrunmarda marda khāhi khāhi khaṭvāṅga viciṃtya ||

<p. 65a> vāme || triśūlena bhiṃdhi bhidhi triśūlaṃ viciṃtya || 
chindhi chindhi khaḍgena khaḍaṃ viciṃtya || chadaye chadaye || 
aṃkuśaṃ viciṃtya || tāvadyāvan mama sakalamanorathātsādhaye <2> ||
varadahastaṃ viciṃtya || dakṣe || paramakāruṇike || abhayahastaṃ viciṃtya || vāme 
|| bhagavati mahābhairavarūpadhāriṇi || naramuṇḍaṃ viciṃtya || tridaśa 
varanamite sakalamantra mātaḥ || ghaṇṭhā viciṃtya || iti kalāyudhadaśakaṃ 
nyāsaḥ ||

athāsanaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
catubhujo mahesāni hastadvaya kṛtāṃjaliḥ |
pretāsanopaviṣṭantu raktavarṇamahoṭkaraḥ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

praṇatajanavatsale pretaṃ viciṃtayet || 
iti āsanaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

atha mantradehaṃ nyāsaḥ || 

dhyānaṃ ||
sphurjalpaṃkaja karṇikoparigata pretastadūrddhaparāṃ dīpyan 
pītakale varāṃ vidhumukhīṃ pañcānanāṃ vibhratīṃ |
vande pāśimahāśi pheṭavaradaṃ ghaṇṭhāṃ ca vāmaiḥ sadā
<p. 65b> mālāñcāṅkuśanāramuṇḍamabhayaṃ pātraṃ ca dakṣaiḥ karaiḥ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

devī mahākāli kālanāśini || amūrtāyāḥ || kuṇḍalinīrūpāyā || 
devyācintanaṃ || hūṁ janmādhārāddevī udayaṃ viciṃtayet ||
khphreṁ jvālārūpāyāḥ || devyāḥ vicintanaṃ hṛdayaparyantaṃ ||
khphreṁ hṛdayādbiṃduparyantaṃ || khphreṁ bindusthānādbrahmaraṃdhrapayentaṃ 
|| prasīdamadanāturāṃ kuru kuru surāsura kanyakāṃ ||
anena viśvavaśikāra sāmarthyamuktaṃ || hrīṁ janmādhāre || śrīṁ liṅge ||
kroṁ kaṃdasthāne || hūṁ nābhisthāne || phaṭ hṛdaye || phaṭ mukhe || 
svā bindusthāne || hāṁ brahmaraṃdhre || iti madhye nābhisthavarṇanavakanyāsaḥ ||
iti nyāsavidhiṃ kṛtvā || iti mantradehaṃ nyāsaḥ ||

tato varṇadehanyāsaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ || 
śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśāṃ pañcāspandaśabāhukāṃ |
mahāmudrasarārūḍhāṃ sudehāṃ varṇavigrahāṃ ||
nīlakucitakeśāntu jaṭāmuṭamaṇḍitāṃ |
nānāratnamahākāra kādyamaṇḍitaśeṣarāṃ ||

<p. 66a> sitaśonāsitā raktā śveta khādiramujvalāṃ |
nānāratnasamāyuktāṃ susamāsthi sukuṇḍalāṃ ||
sūryabimbāruṇākārāṃ tripañcanayanojvalāṃ |
iṣaddhāsya lalajjihvāṃ draṣṭrāsobhi mukhojvalāṃ ||
nānādaityādi sadduṣṭakaṇṭhe dalamālinīṃ ||
anenaratnanirmāṇa hāraghṛṣṭonnatastanīṃ ||
trivalītaraṃgaśobhāḍhyāṃ madhye kṣāmodarāṃ śubhāṃ |
kiṃkinī jālasadvastra vyāghraṃ śukaṭibhūṣaṇāṃ ||
varāśī ca śūlakādyaṃ muṇḍaṃ dakṣakarairdhṛtāṃ |
abhikhaṭvāṅga satpātraṃ pāśaṃ ghaṇṭhāntathottare ||
vīraghaṇṭhāṃ śukāsphāla jānuyugmasuśobhitāṃ |
ghargharī nupurārāva bhūṣitā caraṇa dvayaṃ ||
suśvetasya trinetrasya dvibhujaika mukhasya ca |
skaṃdhe rudrasya cāruḍhāṃ vīrāsana sthitasya ca ||
jvalatpāvakasaṃkāśaṃ jvālāsamūhasaṃghakaṃ |
romakūpācca niyāntaṃ gagaṇañcāruṇopamaṃ ||
mātṛkāṣṭakamadhyesthāṃ ḍākinī pariveṣṭitāṃ |
bahusirddhasamākīrṇāṃ sidhiyoginī pūjitāṃ ||

<p. 66b> iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

tataḥ padadehanyāsaḥ ||
oṃ namaḥ śirasi || sarvasiddhiyoginībhyo namaḥ || lalāṭataṭamaṇḍalaṃ ||
sarvasiddhimātṛbhyo namaḥ || nāśāgre || nityoditānandananditāyai ||
vāmanetre || sakalakulacakranāyikāyai || dakṣanetre ||
bhagavatyai || tṛtīyanetre || caṇḍakāpālinyai || vāmagaṇḍe || tadyathā || 
dakṣagaṇḍe brahmakhaṇḍa ||
oṃ vāmakarṇe || hrīṁ dakṣakarṇe || hūṁ adharoṣṭhe || hāṁ ūrddhoṣṭe ||
phreṁ adho dante || kṣoṁ ūrddhadante || kroṁ jihvāyāṃ || namaḥ mukhe || 
viṣṇukhaṇḍa ||
paramahaṃsini || kaṇṭhe || nirvāṇamārgade || vāmaskaṃdhe || 
viṣamopaplavapraśamani || vāmabāhau || sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani || 
vāmamanibaṃdhe || sarvāpadāmbhodhitaraṇi || vāmahastāṅgulau ||
sakalaśatrupramathani || vāmāṃgulinakhe || devī āgacha <2> || dakṣaskaṃdhe ||
hasa <2> dakṣabāhu || valga <2> || dakṣamanibaṃdhe ||

<p. 67a> nararudhirāntra vasābhakṣini || dakṣastāṃgulau || mama svaśatrunmarda <2> ||
dakṣāṃgulinakhe || khāhi khāhi || udalamaṇḍale || triśūlena bhiṇḍi <2> ||
vāmastane || chindi chindi || dakṣastane || khaḍgena tāḍaye <2> || 
phiṃkeca vāmadakṣe || chedaye <2> nābhimaṇḍale || 
tāvadyāvanmama sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> || kālānale ||
paramakāruṇike || yonimadhye || bhagavatī || guḍamaṇḍale ||
mahābhairavarūpadhāriṇi || vāmasphik take || tridaśavaranamite ||
dakṣasphiki || sakalamantramataḥ || vāmorau || praṇatajanavatsale || 
vāmorāvadha || devī mahākāli kālanāśani || vāmajānau ||
hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ || vāmagulpha || prasīdamadanāturāṃ || dakṣagulphau ||
kuru <2> vāmapādāṅgulau || surāsurakanyakāṃ || dakṣapādāṃgulau ||
hrīṁ dakṣoru adhodeśe || śrīṁ dakṣajānau || hrūṁ dakṣapāde || phaṭ phaṭ ||
vāmapādāṅgulau || phaṭ svāhā || pṛṣṭhe || iti padadehaṃ nyāsaḥ vidhi ||

<p. 67b> jalapātrapūjā ||
tato svakīya vāmabhāge māyāṃkitabhūbiṃbavṛtta caturasrātmakaṃ 
maṇḍalaṃ || nirmāya trikoṇamadhye aiṁ kālamāpūjya astreṇa 
prakṣālitamādhāraṃ tatra saṃsthāpyamācate ||
raṁ vahnimaṇḍalāya daśakalātmane namaḥ ||
phaṭ <3> jalapātra prakṣālya || khphreṁ tatra jalapātra pratisthāpya ||
haṃ sūryamaṇḍalāya dvādaśakalātmane namaḥ || 
jalapātrasthāpanaṃ || aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kṣlīṁ klīṁ || 
jalenā pūjye || 
gaṃge ca jamunā caiva godāvari sarasvati |
narmade siṃdhu kāveri jalesmiṃ saṃnidhiṃ kuru ||
saṁ somamaṇḍalāya ṣoḍaśakalātmane namaḥ || 
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ hsauṁ varuṇā devī hsauṁ <7> || 

dhyānaṃ ||
aṣṭādaśabhujādevī caturvaktrāṃ tu bhairavī |
kṛṣṇaraktāmbaradharā kṛṣṇa raktā ca varṇataḥ ||

<p. 67a> varadābhayahastā ca pāśāṃkuśadharā tathā |
khaḍgañca dakṣiṇe haste kapālaṃ cāparāṃ tathā ||
triśūlaṃ dakṣiṇe haste cākṣasūtrantathā pare |
pustakaṃ vāmahaste tu cakraṃ caiva tu dakṣiṇe ||
dakṣiṇe tu śaraṃ caiva dhanurvāme vicintaye |
dakṣiṇe ca gadāṃ vidyāmmūśalaṃ vāma eva ca ||
tarjanīñca tathā vāme ghaṇṭhāñcaiva tu dakṣiṇe |
dhvajaṃ vāme dadhānāsā dakṣa caiva tu vajrakaṃ ||
mahādeva priyātanvī mahāmaṇi vibhūṣitā ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

aiṁ <5> hskṣmlvryūṁ jalapātrabhaṭṭārakāya pādukāṃ ||
ṣaḍaṃga || khphreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || khphreṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ sirase svāhā || khphreṁ kavacāya hūṁ || khphreṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ astrāya phaṭ ||

mūlanavākṣarī na japa ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ||
dhenumudrā matsyamudrāyā saṃcchādya tarjalena sarvavastu cātmānaṃ sicayet 
||

gāyatrī ||

<p. 68b> khphreṁ siddhilakṣmyai vidmahe navatyadhika dhīmahi tanno lakṣmīḥ 
pracodayāt || iti jalapātrapūjā ||

atha śaṃkhasthāpanaṃ || 

namaḥ iti mantreṇa jalena pūrayet || hṛdayādi || 
khphreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || khphreṁ śirase svāhā || khphreṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ kavacāya hūṁ || khphreṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || khphreṁ astrāya phaṭ ||
āvāhanādi || śaṃkha dhenu yonimudrāṃ darśayet || prokṣaṇaṃ ||

atha arghapātrapūjā ||

devyātmano madhye || saṃsthāpya || thvacakracoya || agnau hṛdayaṃ ||
īśāne sira || nai(-)ṛtya śikhā || vāyuvya kavacaṃ || anetraṃ || 
caturdikṣu cāstraṃ || <4> || sarvamantrāsanāya namaḥ || 
aiṁ kāmarūpa pīṭhāye namaḥ || klīṁ pūrṇagiripīṭhāya namaḥ ||
sauṁ jālaṃdharapīṭhāsanāya namaḥ ||

<p. 69a> astre mantreṇa kṣālitapātrā dhāraṃ sthāpayet ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ siddhamahālakṣmī pātrādhāraṃ sādhayāmi || mācate ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ rāṁ rīṁ rūṁ rmlvryūṁ dharmapradaśakalātmane agnimaṇḍalāya 
arghapātrāsanāya namaḥ || iti ādhāraṃ pūjayitvā tadupari prādakṣiṇena ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ dhūmrāccikalāya śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ raṁ nīlaraktākalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ laṁ kapirā pādukāṃ || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ vaṁ visphuliṃginīkalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ śaṁ jvālinīkalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ ṣaṁ arciṣmatīkalāya śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ saṁ havyavāhinīkalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ laṁ raudrīkalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kṣaṁ saṃhāriṇīkalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
evaṃ saṃpūjye tadupari sauvarṇatāmrakāṃśya viśvāmitraṃ kādyaṃ 
raupyaṃ vā pātramekamādāya || astra mantreṇa prakṣālya ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani astrāya phaṭ || 
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ siddhamahālakṣmī ambā arghapātrasthāpayāmi namaḥ ||

<p. 69b> pātrate ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hāṁ hīṁ hūṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ vasuprada dvādaśakalātmane 
sūryamaṇḍalāya arghapātrāsanāya namaḥ || tadupari dakṣiṇāvartana ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kaṁ bhaṃ tapinī kalāya śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khaṃ vaṃ bhrāmarī kalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ gaṃ phaṃ kledinī kalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ ghaṃ vantāpiṇīkalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ ṅaṃ naṃ śodhinīkalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ caṃ dhaṃ bodhinīkalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ chaṃ daṃ varaṇyākalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ jaṃ thaṃ ākarṣaṇīkalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ ṛṃ taṃ suṣumnākalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ ṭaṃ ṭhaṃ jyeṣṭhākalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ vaṃ ḍaṃ hiraṇyākalā śrīpādukāṃ ||
evaṃ pūjayitvā || dhūpayet || 
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kṣlīṁ klīṁ || khphreṁ <12> saṃdhūpya ||

tataḥ kubhamānīya svavāmabhāge saṃsthāpya ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kulakumbhāsanāya namaḥ || 

dhyānaṃ ||
āraktadyuti vigrahāṃ vidhumukhīṃ kumbhākhya devīṃ parāṃ
<p. 70a> pañcāsyāṃ śaraśubhrabhānunayanāṃ hastāmbujairvibhratīṃ |
khaḍgaṃ cāṃkuśaśūlamuṇḍavaradaṃ dakṣaiśca vāmaistathā 
khaṭvāṅgaṃ pṛthupāśapātrakalasaṃ cābhīti hastāṃ bhaje ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

aiṁ <5> hskṣmlvryūṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ ānandabhairavāya vauṣaṭ ||
tato vāmena kumbhasaṃsthāpya mūlamālāmantreṇa pātrapūraye ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ brahmāṇḍe khaṇḍasaṃbhūtamaśeṣarasamāvahaṃ |
āpūrita mahāpātra pīyūṣarasamāvahaḥ ||
phreṁ khphreṁ hrīṁ dvitīyā nikṣipya amṛtamudrayā vaṁ <3> ||
tridhā saṃloḍya hrīṁ <3> tatra doṣaṃ saṃsodhya |
klīṁ sandīpya netranākṛṣya pañcāmṛtapadaṃ nītvā 
navākṣareṇa pūrṇapātraṃ vibhāvya ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ sāṁ sīṁ sūṁ smlvryūṁ saṁ kāmaprada ṣoḍaśakalātmane 
somamaṇḍalāya arghyāmṛtāya namaḥ || tadupari ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ aṁ amṛtākalā śrīpādukāṃ || hrīṁ śrīṁ āṁ mānasī ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ i tuṣṭi || hrīṁ śrīṁ ī puṣṭi

<p. 70b> hrīṁ śrīṁ uṁ prīti || hrīṁ śrīṁ ūṁ revatī || hrīṁ śrīṁ ṛṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ kalā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ ṝṁ śrīṁ kalā || hrīṁ śrīṁḷṁ kalī || hrīṁ śrīṁ ḹṁ sudhā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ eṁ jyotsnā || hrīṁ śrīṁ aiṁ hemavati || hrīṁ śrīṁ occhālā || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ auṁ saṃpūrṇā || hrīṁ śrīṁ aṃ vāmā || hrīṁ śrīṁ aḥ amā ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani hūṁ hūṁ astrāya phaṭ ||
caturdikṣu choṭikaṃ datvā mūlena amṛtamudrayā vilodya ||
cakṣurdikṣu || hrīṁ śrīṁ glūṁ gagaṇaratnāya namaḥ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ slūṁ svargaratnāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śrīṁ mlūṁ martyaratnāya namaḥ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ plūṁ pātālaratnāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śrīṁ nlūṁ nāgaratnāya namaḥ ||
tanmadhye bālārkasaṃkāsāṃ vāgbhavā kṛti kalāṃ dhyātvā amṛteśvari 
candramaṇḍalaśravantīṃ vāmānāmikayā vāmāvartena trikoṇaṃ likhya 
aṃ <15> kaṃ <25> yaṃ <10> krameṇa trikoṇaṃ vilikhya oṃ halakṣadvayaṃ vilikhya 
pāṇibhyāṃ ācchādya ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ amṛte amṛtodbhave amṛtavarṣiṇi amṛtaṃ śrāvaya <2> sāṁ jūṁ 
amṛteśvaryai namaḥ ||

<p. 71a> aiṁ hrīṁ aiṁ amṛte amṛtodbhave amṛtavarṣiṇi klīṁ amṛtaṃ śrāvaya <2> sauṃḥ 
sudhā śukraśrāpaṃ nāśaya <2> caturaṃ niyināṃ siddhisāmarthya dada <2> 
mahākhecarīmudrā prakaṭa <2> hūṁ svāhā ||
oṃ namo bhagavate rudrāya aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ oṃ īṁ glauṁ namo bhagavati rudrāya aiṁ klīṁ 
sauṁḥ oṃ ī glauṁ namo bhagavati trailokyamohanī tiraskaraṇi mahāmāheśvari 
sarvapaśujanavāgbaṃdhani sakalapaśujanaścakṣuḥ śotra jihvāghrāṇacaraṇa 
tiraskaraṇaṃ kuru <2> svāhā || iti amṛteśvarīṃ trivāraṃ japtvā || 

hrīṁ śrīṁ akhaṇḍaika rasānandakare varasudhātmani |
svacchandasphuraṇāmantranidhyehyakularūpiṇī ||
hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandabhairavāya vauṣaṭ || 
ityānandabhairavaṃ sudhādevīṃ tadbindubhireva tapyayitvā ||
akulasyāmṛtākāre siddhijñānakare vare |
amṛtatvaṃ nidhehyasminvastuni klinnarūpiṇī ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ arghapātrāsanāya pādukāṃ ||

<p. 71b> punarnavātmā mithuratyarcya || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandabhairavāya vauṣaṭ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ ānandabhairavyai sudhādevyai vauṣaṭ || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śvāṁ saḥ saḥ saḥ parādevī amṛtaṃ vama <2> svāhā ||
dravyasodhanaṃ ||

dhyānaṃ || 
koṭipūrṇendubhāṃ devīṃ rudrāṅgārūḍhaśāṃkarīṃ ||
sarvābharaṇabhūṣāṅgīṃ viśveśīṃ muṇḍadāmadhāṃ ||
daśahastamaheśānīṃ pañcavaktrāṃ kirīṭinīṃ |
khaḍgaṃ śūlāṃkuśau dānaṃ kapālaṃ hṛdayārpitāṃ ||
khaṭvāṃgaṃ pāśamuṇḍaikamabhayaṃ kalasaṃdadhāṃ |
trinetraṃ pratirāsyeti kṛṣṇalohita dakṣiṇe ||
vāme cāmara śvetantu pūrṇendu sadṛśaṃ smitaṃ |
sarvāsāpūraṇīndātṝṃ yasmiṃ bhakti kṛte sati ||
nidhāyāryārghapātreti ṣaḍaṃgenaṃ tu pūjayet ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ || ṣaḍaṅga ||
khphreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || khphreṁ śirase svāhā || khphreṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ kavacāya hūṁ ||

<p. 72a> khphreṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || khphreṁ astrāya phaṭ || 
āvāhanādi || yonimudrāṃ darśayet || 
tatraiva tena tarpayet || gaṇa vatuka kṣetra || 
brahmāṇyādi mūlasvāmi payyantaṃ tarpayet ||
āṁ phīṁ phāṁ mahāsṛṣṭi caṇḍalakṣmī siddheśvarī phe phaṭ || <6> || 
tena tarpaṇaṃ || punarnavākṣaryā navadhā tarpaṇaṃ ||
tato svaśirasi guruparaṃpāraṃparya nyaset ||
śrīṁ hrīṁ khphreṁ śrīkaṇṭhanātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śaṃkaranātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ anantanātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ sākhyanātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ piṅgalanātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ khagendranātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ kūrmanātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ maṅgalanātha pādukāṃ || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ meghanātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ masyendranātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ koṃkaṇāṃbā pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ piṅgalanātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śavarī ambā pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ gurunātha pādukāṃ ||

<p. 72b> hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ paramagurunātha pādukāṃ || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ parameṣṭhigurunātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ pūrvācāryanātha pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ādisiddhinātha pādukāṃ ||
evaṃ pūjayitvā mudrāpañcakaṃ darśayet ||
aiṁ yonimudrāṃ hrīṁ guhyamudrāṃ ||
śrīṁ drāvanīmudrāṃ kṣlo kṣobhinī mudrāṃ || klīṁ jvālinīmudrāṃ ||

bhūtaśuddhi || 

dhyānaṃ ||
kṣmācakramuktaṃ caturasra pītaṃ khaṇḍendu śubhraṃ varavāricakraṃ |
tejolakaṃ raktaguṇāradivyaṃ vātākhya ṣaṭkoṇavaraṃ sudhūmraṃ ||
svacchā kva tulyaṃ viyadādhi bimbaṃ bhūtāni pañcānyuditāni śāstre |
eṣāṃ maheśaṃ śitaśāntarūpaṃ cāturbhujaṃ padmaśitaṃ niviṣṭhaṃ ||
dakṣeṇahastena dadhāti śūlaṃ dānaṃ krameṇaiva tathā pareṇa |
kādyābhayaṃ vāmakare vidhatte paṃcātmamantraiḥ karadeha vaktrāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hsauṁ hsauṁ hsphreṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ aiṁ || iti bhūtaśuddhi ||

ātmapūjā || 

dhyānaṃ || 
mūladevyāstu vadaṇi nīlalohita kṛṣṇajāṃ |
<p. 73a> śvetapīta prabhaṃ jñeyaṃ divyājñā siddhidāṃ sadā || 
aṃkuśaṃ khaḍgakaṃ śūlaṃ muṇḍaṃ dānaṃ tathaiva ca |
pāśaṃ khaṭvāṃga pātre ca kalasaṃ hyabhayaṃkaraiḥ ||
dakṣai vāmaiśca dadhatīṃ nānābharanabhūṣitāṃ |
nirjarendranutā devīṃ sarvāvayavasundarī ||
īdṛśaṃ dhyānamatulamātmalakṣmīstu siddhidāṃ |
siddhilakṣmīti vikhyātāṃ bhāvayed bhairaveśvarīṃ ||
khphreṁ ātmane candanaṃ namaḥ || khphreṁ akṣataṃ namaḥ ||
khphreṁ sindūraṃ namaḥ || khphreṁ sarvajanamohanī namaḥ || 
puṣpaṃ || oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ātmane puṣpaṃ namaḥ ||
alinā bindutraye || <3> || khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani astrāya phaṭ ||
tadrūpaikarasaṃ nitvādyata svarūpiṇīṃ smṛtvā parāmṛtakarākāra mama 
visphuraṇaṃ kuru punarmalena saptadhābhimantrya astraiṇa saṃrakṣya 
kavacenāvaguṇṭhya dhenuyonimudrāṃ pradarśayet || iti 
mūlārghapātrapūjāvidhiḥ ||

<p. 73b> atha kṣetrābaliṃ paṭhet ||

oṃ namaḥ siddhimahākālikāyai || 
trailokyāyai namaste tribhuvana namite kālike viśvacaṇḍe 
vāme vāmāntarasthe tridaśavaranute naumite pādayugme ||
hraṁ sve dīghe viśarge akacaṭatapayaśe kṣaḥ prakāśāntarasthe 
muṇḍe hūṁ viśvarūpenatiparavaradeśeṣanāgottarīye || <1> ||
candrārkau karṇapūrau tara tara tarale trāhi māṃ koṭarākṣi 
jyeṣṭhe vāmetha raudre jvalitaśikhi śikhe mātṛnande sunande ||
svāhākāre viriñci praṇatajanahite vyādhisaṃdohanāśe 
kaṃkāle kālakāle kalikaluṣahare sadyavāmādya ghore || <2> ||
hūṁ vaktreṣu svarūpe mama varanirate kanda cakrodarasthe 
vyome hṛdvyomavāhe haraharaviṣame sphoṭaye pretavāho 
jambhe mohegni jihve śa śa śa śa śavare koragiryādhivāse 
vicce viśveśvarīye matha matha mamathane duḥkṛtaghnāni devi || <3> ||

<p. 74a> drāṁ drāṁ drāṁ drāviṇīye kili kili rabhase carmamuṇḍe prahāre
klīṁ ṣluṁ raṁ tatvavāhe kili kili subhage mantravidyāvagāhe ||
preṁ preṁ preṁ pretavāhe kala kala kahale pāśakaṭṭārikāgre
divyadivyādhivāse kha kha kha kha khagame ghargharārāvaghore || <4> ||
kṣrīṁ phaṭ hūṁ phaṭ svarūpe ḍa ḍa ḍa ḍa ḍamare hūṁ jayaṃtyādhivāse 
vicchiṃdhyāstrena vāme ṭha ṭha ṭha ṭha ṭhamare kṣakṣakāre subhime ||
tvāṃ vande koṭarakṣi varavaradaśane dakṣakārākṣarīye 
he he hūṃkararāve paca paca dahane muñca muñca pramarte || <5> ||
caṇḍākṣi krodharūpe dara dara parame satsurāmāṃśalole 
vīre vīrāgni vāse madhumadarabhase jvālinī jvālitāsye ||
caṇḍe ekāgrarūpe ghurighuritaghurā ghorarūpe bhayaghne 
phaṭ phaṭ phrekārarūpe kaha kaha ramaṇi pretabhasmopalipte || <7> ||
māri kroṁkārarūpe kaha kaha rasane kṛṣṇakaṃkālavīṇe

<p. 74b> kṣāṁ kṣīṁ kṣūṁ krodharūpe ha ha ha ha harase naumi caṇḍāsidhāre ||
tvāṃ vande sarvakālaṃ narapiśitamukhī sā caritrādhivāse 
he he hūṃkāranāde la la la la lane cheda pheṭkārarūpe || <8> ||
ḍāṁ ḍāṁ ḍāṁ ḍāmarīye varavara varade ghorahūṃkāravege 
nārainnādāntadāme jaya jaya padake koṭikarṇādhivāse ||
yā vīro vīravaṃdyā ṛṣigaṇaniyato yogapīṭhopapīṭhaṃtu 
tvā tvaṃ tasya nityaṃ vitaravaraśubhe kāme rūpāvatīrṇaṃ || <9> ||
nāmnā kṣetrāvalīyaṃ paṭhati śubhayaśaḥ mantrasiṃhaṃ praṇītā 
divyā divyādi vighnā prabhavamiha bhavenaiva devi prabhāvā ||

[iti śrīśrīśrīsiddhilakṣmīmate prakāśe jayadrathe vidyāpīṭhe pratyaṃgiryā 
kṣetrāvalipīṭhastavaṃ samāptaṃ] ||

hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ yā sā parāparā devī khecarī khasvarūpiṇī |
sarvabhutahite mātare hyehi parameśvarī ||
mahāmudrāsanā devi ciccandragati nirmale 
<p. 75a> sarvabhūtahite mātare hyehi parameśvarī ||
asminmaṇḍale sāṃnidhyaṃ suprasannābhava namaḥ ||
iti devī mūrtyai caitanyakalāmāvāhya mūlavidyā smaran ||
āvāhana sannidhāna saṃnirodha saṃmukhī karaṇādi 
avaguṇṭhanaṃ dhenuyonimudrāṃ vadhvā devyāgataṃ bhāvayet ||
tato sarvvajñatādi ṣaḍaṅgandevyāṃ nyastvā mantradehaṃ devyāṃ nyaset ||

tato navākṣareṇa saṃdhūpya ||
āṁ phiṁ phāṁ mahāsṛṣṭi caṇḍalakṣmī siddheśvarī phreṁ phaṭ ||
oṃ namaḥ siddhiyoginī mahāmāye || 
nivasati kanavīre sarvadā yā smaśāne 
vinati janahitāye pretarudrādhirūḍhā |
himakara himaśubhrā pañcāvaktrāmamoghā 
diśatu daśabhujā sā svayaṃ siddhilakṣmī ||
jaya jaya jagadaṃbe praṇata harihara hiraṇyagarbhapramukha suramukuṭa 
mandāramālāparimalamiladati paṭalavacālacalaṇa puṇḍarīke 
puṇḍarīkākṣa karakambuvimala mandākinī 

<p. 75b> saradindu kundārabindasaṃdoha sundarasarīraprabhe suprabhe 
jayajaya mahākāli kālanāsini samayacakramelāprakāsini 
siddhigaṇayoginī vīravidharājanani karamuni nikurumbanitaṃbinī 
kadambakinnarairevānādhyamāne kalārāvidhāne siddhilakṣmīprade 
virūpākṣa cakṣusaṃvisevānandarasadāyike tribhuvananāyike 
sphurada narṭya maṇimuktāvalī kaladhyetāsthi cakṣuśravābharaṇa jhanajhanāya 
mānatanu vallarī vahalaprabhāpaṭalapāṭalī kṛtasakaladigmaṇḍale 
gaṇḍasthale lalitaraviśaśikuṇḍale samunnatapīnakaṭhinakucakalasa 
yugalāntavālalulita naramuṇḍābalīmaṇḍite caṇḍi rudhirapānapramatta 
pretakalakolattālavetāla kacatālikāṇḍavanatāḍavā pramukhāṭaṭaḍākinī 
cakra cakramanacakita citāyacamatkāra 

<p. 76a> visphurita piśāca pracayavītkāra dhvani mukharakanavīra 
saśānādhivāsini rudraskaṃdhārūḍhe 
ṣaḍādhāra madhyārabindamandirodarā kuñcanonvita prasuptabhujaṃgā 
sanāyamāna kulakuṇḍalanī śaktiprabhā pradīpikā vidyodita suṣumnā 
savalavigamadākāśa śaśimaṇḍalāmṛtadhārādhoraṇī 
payonidhinigmanamānasairudihasairakhilasādhakairapi vibhāvite subhāvite 
mātrikācakrasaṃbhāvite mṛgāṃka kuṃkumāgurumṛgamadāṅgarāga 
parimallavāsitāvāsanimaṇḍape khaṇḍendumaṇḍitoru 
jaṭākalāpakalitavaravīroddāra kalahāra kanakakenakinavamālikā mallikā 
tatollikā madayanti kāmādhavīvividhagandhavabandhūragandhavāhavaladaruṇa 
savanācale dhyānākāra cakita trinayanācale jaya jaya jagatjananī jaya ||

<p. 76b> jaya jaya navākṣarī na vahyādhika dviśatākṣaramantramālādhi daivate 
kāli kātyāyani kāpālini nararudhiravaśāpisita paripūrṇakapālakaravāla 
triśūlakhaṭvāṅgaghaṃṭhāmuṇḍapāśāṃkuśavarābhayaśobhita daśakare 
sukare vaddhavīrāsane siddheśvarī siddhi vidyādharoragendradhyāyamānāṃ 
ghrivalaye śāmbhavāveśavaivevadevi mahādevi amākhye umākhye 
sadāpūrṇimākhya lasattārakākhye akārakṣakārodara sphuradambarākāre 
mahāvyomavāmeśvarī khecarī gocarī bhūcarī digcarī samvarī śakticakra 
kriyechā jñānarūpe guṇātīta nityāmṛte nityabhogaprade 
saṃdhyāvasānasamaya lāsyalīlāvilāse ṭaṭamahānaṭa 
jaṭājuṭāpagārimaladalaṃ kārasakalakāvya kalāpavahaladhī 
triguṇaprabandhavividhabaṃdha sundarakavitā

<p. 77a> siddhide ṛddhide buddhide jñānade mānade mokṣade 
sārade ṣoḍaśākṣarī ṣaṭbhurikasitakusumaparimalamilita 
madhuramukharapulinapalisaravipinamaṇḍalītāṇḍavitakuṇḍalī vipakṣa pakṣa 
cikṣepa pavanaparicaladuttarataraṅgabhaṅgalaṅgimāmṛgamakaranidhidīpavidyo 
taduttama caturdvāra catussāṣṭadalakamala ṣaṭkona cakra bahirvirājamāna 
smaśāna śavāśakta śivā phatkāra cakitapisācikā vikaṭa draṣṭrā 
koṭikaṭakaṭāśabdamudita vibhāvarī caravināsinī mukhavigalita pretāṅganāla 
karālākarṣaṇa kalahakolāhalā kulakolapaṃkalita kujopaviṣṭa japavyagrarocayama 
saṃyamodita parāmūrtipratyaṃgire navākṣari savari sahasrākṣari 
śrīkaṇṭhavaśiṣṭhaviśvāmitravallabhe

<p. 77b> uvāsukī krodhamuni mīnanātha jayadratha jāvāli jamadagni jamanadula 
cānakyālakācārya vimalabodhavicitrānanda devaprabhṛti bhavādi 
trividhaguruparampāstuti mudita hṛdayeti sadaye vividhavidyādharī kiṃnarī 
gāndharvī cāpsarā ṛṣisutāneka nṛpatikakasya bhāgīyamāna samayacakracarite 
sucarite madhumādhavīpānamukha siddhisiddhāṅganāsaṅgamāśakta sarasvatī 
catu samāṃgasaṃśaktarogaparimalavahala kucakalasalulitavipaṃcikāpravaṃcita 
pañcārāgasamākarṇa lokeśvara vaikuṇṭhabhujayugalā 
śleṣapurakamulitorasthalavilasadigirānandolusitavṛndārikā 
vṛndakarālabaindakulitavālavyajane pavanādhūtajāṭaraṭavīmiladamanda 
nispandamānamājambabindasaṃdoha sundarānaśca kaśca ūmā phanindra 
kusumamāle jayajananisakalamālāviśāla |

<p. 78a> durvāradāridra dāvānaladāho taptadehasādhakasaṃjīvanoṣadhī 
tanumañjarī maṃjuke karuṇāmṛtataraṅgīnī 
uttuṅgadhārākaṭākṣapānairananyagatimacetanamakiṃcanamanyajana 
vacanāparamasadāyamanāthamidānīṃ sambakadambavanavāsinī māmavalokaya 
prasīda parameśvarī paramakaruṇike mahābhairavarūpadhāriṇi 
tridaśavaraṇamite ||

oṃ namaḥ sarvasiddhiyoginī cakravartite namaḥ siddhimātṛkānandite 
sarvāpadāmbhodhi sadārike vinatajanavighnihārike kāntāragahana 
duḥkhānavakaṃdāyike cauravyāghra duṣṭabhayadārike dūrvāraduhṛdaya 
durnayadugāṭavī vikaṭasaṃkaṭapaṭiṭavīrasaṃtāpapaṭalavipāṭiṭe paṭupaṭaha 
mṛdaṅgaḍamaruḍāmara ḍiṃḍimā hṛṣṭavividhavādochavādambarai samararipu

<p. 78b> samanabhavanamāne mahāmāṃsamṛgamadā gurupūrakarpūra 
pravaradhūpapriye mahātailabhavanamaṇiprakāśita vidyodita vasati maṇḍape 
caṇḍī caṇḍikā pāṭapuṃḍarīka bhava puṇḍarīkākṣa 
sahasrākṣapramukhāmaranikara 
vividhavinayabadhvāṃjalipuṭavigalitakusumamālāvilulitā gudale 
sakalamantramātapraṇatajanavatsale prasīdamadanāturāṃ tribhuvana yuvati varge 
durgeti dalani kulanāyike nikhilaripupramathanī nararudhiravasāmāṃsamiśritā 
savapānapramatye paśupaṭalabandhavidhaṃsinī bhagavati bhavārādhakānāmapi 
sādhakānāṃ mahābhāvanā samudite bhāvakānāmabhimatavibhūti prade 
sarvamanobhilikhitasantānataruvalllalī parakṛtyāni kṛntani kṛtāntakuntotyātani

<p. 79a> mamāparādhaṃ kṣamasva kṣamasva śaktināthohamekākī 
parijanaparihīna tvadīya caraṇaśaraṇāgata hatvāt manaravatamabhivādayāmi 
nanu cintayāmi prasādayāmi siddhāmba pravallatarārātībhayabhenusthānarāti 
mama chindi bhindi maṇḍalāgregrenagrahagaṇanamite prasīda prasīda kṣamasva 
kṣamasvaparādhaṃ śive ||

[iti siddhilakṣmī trikhaṇḍadaṇḍakaṃ stotraṃ parisamāptaḥ] ||

śrīsiddhilakṣmī guhyakālikā tripurasundarī idaṃ āvāhiṣye āvāhayāmi ||

trideva pūjā ||
khphreṁ narāsanāya pādukāṃ || khphreṁ mayūrāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ mukhāsanāya pādukāṃ || 

kṣetrayā dhyānaṃ ||
kṣetrapālo mahādhvāṃkṣastrinetraḥ kṛṣṇabhāsaraḥ 
caturbhujo mahākāyeścāsthimālāpralambita ||
kādyaṃ ghaṇṭhāṃ dhṛtaṃ vāme triśūlaṃ daṇḍadakṣiṇe |
<p. 79b> śaktayastādṛśā sarvāḥ krīḍāmānaṃ vicintayet ||

khphreṁ thhsrauṁ prastaradvīpa dambhakī devī mahādhvāṃkṣa kṣetrapālāya 
pādukāṃ || baliḥ ||

baṭukayā dhyānaṃ ||
raktāmbaradharaṃ devaṃ raktavarṇacaturbhujaṃ |
ekāsyaṃ raktanetrañca piṅgabhrupiṅgakeśakaṃ ||
daṇḍaśūla tathā kartikapālaṃ karaśobhitaṃ |
vyālayajñopavītañca vighni vicchedakārakaṃ ||
jvaladrasmi samākīrṇaṃ mayūrāsanasaṃsthitaṃ |
tārakāsurahantā ca vaṭukākhyaṃ namāmyahaṃ ||
khphreṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ kulaputravaṭukanāthāya pādukāṃ || baliḥ ||

gaṇayā dhyānaṃ ||
gajavaktraika dantañca śvetavarṇañcaturbhujaṃ |
daṇḍaparaśupātrañca dantaṃ sarpopavitakaṃ ||
nāgābharaṇaśobhāḍhyaṃ tuṇḍilaṃ hrasvamūrtikaṃ |
mūṣāsanaṃ ganādhyakhyaṃ siddhidañca namostute ||
kphreṁ gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaḥ glauṁ kulagaṇeśvarāya pādukāṃ || baliḥ ||

<p. 80a> āvāhanādi || tarjadaṇḍagajamudrāṃ darśayet ||

devyāsanapūjā ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ ādhāraśaktaye namaḥ || khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ anantāsanāya namaḥ || 
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kandāsanāya namaḥ || khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ nārāsanāya namaḥ ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ patrāsanāya namaḥ || khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ padmāsanāya namaḥ ||
khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ keśarāsanāya namaḥ || khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ karṇikāsanāya namaḥ 
|| dharmāye namaḥ || jñānāya namaḥ || rājñāya namaḥ || aiśvaryāya namaḥ || 
adharmāya namaḥ || ajñānāya namaḥ || avairājñāya namaḥ || anaiśvaryāya 
namaḥ || ratnavedikāpīṭhāya namaḥ || laṁ oḍiyānapīṭhāya namaḥ ||
vaṁ jālaṃdharapīṭhāya namaḥ || raṁ pūrṇagiripīṭhāya namaḥ ||
yaṁ kāmarūpapīṭhāya namaḥ || khphreṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ rudrapretāsanāya namaḥ ||

<p. 80b> hsauṁ mahāpretāsanāya namaḥ ||

atha dhyānaṃ ||
khphreṁ mahātejomayī lakṣmī rasmikoṭyāyutaprabhā |
pañcavaktrā daśabhūjā tripañcanayanairyutā || <1> ||
śvetavarṇā mahādevi mahāpretoparisthitā |
mātṛkāṣṭaka madhye tu siddhiyogini pūjitā || <2> ||
dāritāsyā lelihānā jvalāpluṣṭaṃ kṛtaṃ jagat |
ucchvāsocchvāsayogena cālayatkulaparvatān || <3> ||
kvacidvīṣye kvacinkupe kvacitsaṃharate valāt |
kvacitsṛje kvacitpālyat svatantrecchā pravartate || <4> ||
gonāsā bharaṇairyuktā uragendra vibhūṣitā |
pāśāṃkuśadharā devī varadābhayapāṇinī || <5> ||
savyahastairddhṛtaṃ khaḍgaṃ trailokyakṣobhakārakaṃ |
vāme khaṭvāṅgamatyugraṃ dakṣiṇe śūlamuttamaṃ || <6> ||
aparaṃ kandharaṃ raudraṃ kṣatajā sa ca pūritaṃ |
savyahaste sa keśaṃ vai muṇḍaṃ śośitasādrakaṃ || <7> ||
vāme tu kalasaṃ divyaṃ mahāratnapradīpakaṃ |
<p. 81a> eṣā pratyaṃgira devī tantrarājopadeśaga || <8> ||
eṣā sāneka bhedena divyaṃ vyāpya vyavasthitā |
pratyaṅgirā mahādevī siddhilakṣmīrjayapradā || <9> ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

triyāñjali ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ || pādukāṃ pūjayāmi || <3> || baliḥ ||
gāyatri || khphreṁ siddhilakṣmyai vidmahe navatyadhika dhīmahi tanno lakṣmīḥ 
pracodayāt || baliḥ ||

atha mālāmantra ||
oṃ namaḥ sarvasiddhiyogibhyo namaḥ sarvasiddhimātṛbhyo namo nityoditānanda 
nanditāyai sakalakulacakranāyikāyai bhagavatyai caṇḍakālinyai tadyathā oṃ hrīṁ 
hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ oṃ paramahaṃsini nirvāṇamārgade devī 
viṣamopaplavapraśamani sakaladuritāṣṭa kleśadalani sarvāpadāmbhodhitarani 
sakalaśatrupramathani devi āgaccha <2> hasa <2> valga <2> nararudhirāntravasābhakṣaṇi 
mama svaśatrūn 

<p. 81b> marda marda khāhi <2> triśūlena bhindi <2> chindi <2> khaḍgana tāḍaya <2> chedaya 
<2> tāvadyāvan mama sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> paramakāruṇike bhagavati 
mahābhairavarūpadhāriṇī tridaśavaranamite sakalamantramātaḥ 
praṇatajanavatsale devī mahākāli kālanāśani hūṁ <3> 
praśīdamadanāturāṃkurāṃ kuru <2> surāsurakanyakāṃ hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ phaṭ <3> 
svāhā || thvatenaṃ baliḥ || iti mālāmantra ||

ṣaḍaṅga || khphreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || khphreṁ śirase svāhā || 
khphreṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ || khphreṁ kavacāya hūṃ || khphreṁ tratrayāya vaṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ astrāya phaṭ || 

atha śrī <3> siddhilakṣmī sahasrākṣarī vidyānaṣṭajanaṃ || 
oṃ hrīṁ mahācaṇḍayogeśvari jvalitamukhi jvālājihvādarī bhīme 
mahābhīmabhīṣaṇi laṃbodari viśvāntaki kālagrāsani kālanisūdani hrā <4> sini 
mahābhairavī mahāśmaśānabhīmavāsini hūṁ caṇḍamukhi 

<p. 82a> mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī hrīṁ rkṣrīṁ rvrīṁ phaṭ <5> mahāharjabharuṭṭi 
mahārāvini haṃsani grāhini māriṇi mohini hūṁ jāḥ <2> khāhi <2> vidrāvini <2> jāhi <2> 
rkṣrīṁ mahābhairavotsaṃgavāsini mahāmāṃsāśininuda <2> truta <2> he <2> mahākāli 
thrāṁ dhrāṁ hrīṁ page daṇḍadhāriṇi khārvāri mahānauli brahmaṇi māheśvari 
kaumāri vaiṣṇavī vārāhi yāmye caṇḍamukhi āgneyī vāruṇi vāyuvye 
kolamukhi khphreṁ mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī mahākāpālini bhairaveśvarī 
caṇḍaśvari mahābharutthi mahā <2> kṛtāntabhakṣaṇi sarvayoginī 
hṛdayānandakarī jvālājvalitavigrahaṃ hrūṁ <3> rkṣrīṁ <3> phaṭ <5> mahānarānta 
carmāvanarddhe mahaphaṭkārarāvini hana <2> hūṁ ḍamukhi jvālanani kaṃbugrīve 
vyālakṛtakuṇḍale mahābhīma mahābhīmāṅgade mahābhīma krodhamukhe 
jvalitaśiroruhavaktre mahācaṇḍacāmuṇḍe mahācaṇḍāli kirātochuṣmadhāriṇī

<p. 82b> hasa <2> nṛtya <2> mahātrailokyatrāsanakari mahārudhiravasā sṛkabhojini piba <2> 
vama <2> ghāṭaya <2> he <2> hā <2> muñca <2> khalva <2> sphoṭa <2> garja <2> ghūrṇa <2> 
mahāmadonyādini kanvavī śmaśānavāsini mahābhairavāsani hasa <2> 
pañcavadane daśadordaṇḍa sarvāyudhadhāriṇi mahādāmarī 
triśūlakhaṭvāṅgāsi muṇḍapāśāṃkuśakalapātravarābhaya śobhitavṛhabhuja 
mahāvyālabhūṣita śarīre anekavaktre vyomāśanivyomaśariravāsini 
mahāpratāsani mahādraṣṭrākarāle jvālāsya vaktre karaṃkamukhi gṛdhrarodhini 
hṛdayāmburuhavāriṇi sarvabhūtamati hana <2> rphrīṁ <2> hūṁ phaṭ <5> 
mahākapālāsanaṃ sthite hūṁ pha he <5> dinakarasahasravapuṣe hūṁ phaṭ 
candrakoṭyaṃ śunirmali hūṁ phaṭ mahāpralayānaravapuṣe hūṁ phaṭ turu hūṁ 
phaṭ prasphura <2> rhrūṁ <3> rphraṁ phaṭ mahāmantrarājeśvari phaṭ phaṭ meghamāle 

<p. 83a> māhāmāye hūṁ phaṭ māheśvari vidyutkoṭī kṣe hūṁ phaṭ 
kṣapayaduritāma hūṁ phaṭ bhīme ehyehi hrūṁ hrūṁ phaṭ <3> hrīṁ mahācaṇḍa 
yogeśvarī hūṁ phaṭ mahābhasmoddharitaśarīta śarīrāṃge 
trailokyā ḍāmarīśvarī mahānarakapālāntrapūrita kṣatajāsava priye 
trailokyagrāsaghasmari mahīṣāsanī kumbhārāṃgopaviṣṭaśarīre aghoreśvarī 
tvaṃ nīlavarohe mahāghora draṣṭrākarālavadane hayagajarāsabhāśani 
mahāpiśitāsani matte hana <2> hūṁ caṇḍamukhi sarvayogeśvarī mahāmāyā 
ghorarūpini hrīṁ mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī ṭhrīṁ dhrāṁ thrīṁ 
phaṭ ṣoḍaśakalāntavāsini hakārārddhārdhacāriṇi viśvanilaya viśvagrāsaṃ 
kaṭyasmari ḍasmari ḍaravāḍyapriye kālasaṃkarṣaṇi sarvavidyānilaye amoghe 
aparājite savvamātṛmukhe mahānandajanani amṛtānandaśrave nitye 
nityabhogapriye hrīṁ kroṁ nrjmhrīṁ 

<p. 83b> rvkṣrīṁ rvrūṁdra phaṭ svāhā || thvatenaṃ baliḥ || 
[iti śrīśrīśrīsiddhilakṣmīsaharākṣarīvidyā samāptaḥ] ||

atha śrīśrīśrīlakṣmī ayutākṣarīvidyā na pūjayet ||
oṃ namaḥ siddhilakṣmyaiḥ || oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ || oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ||
oṃ tatsat || oṃ tatsat || oṃ tatsat || 
oṃ asya śrīsiddhilakṣmyayutākṣaramālāmantrasya 
bharadvāja(-)ṛṣirmadhyāpratiṣṭhā supratiṣṭhā gāyatryuṣṇiganuṣṭuvvṛhatī 
paṃkti tṛṣṭubjagatyati śarkayati śarkarī prakṛtyatkṛtayaśchandāṃsi 
śrīsiddhilakṣmīrdevatā phreṁ bījaṃ khphreṁ śaktiḥ kroṁ krīlakaṃ bhukti mukti 
siddhyarthe jape viniyogaḥ || 
eṁ oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ bhagavati caṇḍakāpālini siddhilakṣmi pratyaṅgire kṣoṁ kroṁ 
klīṁ śrīṁ strīṁ raktamukhi ghorāṭṭahāsini bhīmanādini praṇatārtihāriṇi āṁ krīṁ 
hauṁ kṣauṁ glauṁ śmasānavāsini himakiraṇa śubhraśarīre bhaktajanatāriṇi

<p. 84a> phreṁ khphreṁ hsphreṁ hskhphreṁ hsauṁḥ paramasadāśiva sāmarasya cāriṇi 
kātyāyani kāpālini mahāyogini kundacandrādhikadhavala mahārudrarūpa 
śavādhirūḍhe kroṁ kṣroṁ glūṁ glauṁ vlūṁ sakalasurāsura kinnaramano'nurañjani 
daityadānavadarpabhañjani pañcavaktradhāriṇi naramuṇḍamālāhāriṇi 
caturvargaphaladāyini carcarī karatālikā gāyini hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hreṁ hroṁ caṇḍa 
caṇḍātitaramahāvikaṭa ghorarāve trividhamahātatvavidyāprakāśini 
caturdaśabhuvanasantrāsakārakamahāhāsini trīṁ thrīṁ hrīṁ dhrāṁ nrīṁ 
trailokyābhayaśauṇḍabhujadaṇḍadaśakamaṇḍite paramaiśvaryakaraṇabhūte 
bhūteśvara vāmalocane locanatrayavirājite phreṁ phreṁ khphreṁ hsphreṁ hskhphreṁ 
himakundadhavalakalevare'pi mahānīlanīradaprabhe pratyaṅgirā 
śaktitatvāvatāre pracaṇḍacaṇḍini mahābhayānake pralambalambini 

<p. 84b> carcarī karatālikā samayasantrāsita tribhuvanenānājanmopacita 
pāpasaṃcayakāraṇa mahānarakārṇavatāriṇi 
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ rājyalakṣmī vijayalakṣmī mahālakṣmī dhanalakṣmī 
siddhilakṣmī jaya <2> jīva <2> kaha <2> sphura <2> sakalaśatrupramardini mahāmāye hrīṁ 
hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ koṭibrahmāṇḍakavalini mahārāve hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ 
paraṃsivasāmarasya mayī mahābhīme hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ 
mahāśmaśānasañcāriṇi mahābhāge hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ 
mahādāridryaduḥkhadalini mahāhāse hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ kaivalyarūpa 
svapadaprakāsini mahāghore hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ caturvargaphaladāyini 
mahācaṇḍe hrīṁ hūṁ pheṁ phat mahājaṭābhārabhāsure mahāgrāse hrīṁ hūṁ 
phreṁ phat. sakalakulākulacakranāyike mahādaye hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ 
śuddhasatvaguṇamayaśarīre 

<p. 85a> mahāvidye hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ saṃsāravaṃdhavimocane kalātīta hrīṁ hūṁ 
phreṁ phaṭ pañcakālānala kṛtā srāse mahāprakāśe hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ 
mahādordaṇḍamaṇḍalamaṇḍite rudrāvāse hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ 
caturdaśabhuvanatrāṇaprabhe mahābale hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ jvaladagnimukha 
ghorākāre mahāvrate hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ divijanujapramardini mahākalpe hrīṁ hūṁ 
phreṁ phaṭ satyayugaprakaṭitaprabhāve mahānartaki hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ 
rudrapayyaṅkaśayini samaravijayini parabrahmalayini oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ 
paraśivasahacārini naramuṇḍamālābhariṇi manorathasiddhikāriṇi oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ 
namaḥ śaṃkhakarpūra gokṣīraviśade himaśubhradīrghaniśitā bhugūrade 
brahmaviṣṇuśivādi devā vidita pade oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ 
sakalajaganmaṅgalapradāyini vividhasakalaiśvaryādhāyini 

<p. 85b> śivākāra nijavallabhāṅgaśāyini oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ 
navakoṭimantramayavigrahe kṛtasakaladaityavigrahe vistārikātsabhaktānugrahe oṃ 
kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ candrasūryāgnilocana saṃsārabaṃdhamocane 
śikhilāgamaprarocane oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ mahāghoratarakāntāravihitavāse 
tribhuvanabhayajanakadāruṇahāse paraśivasāmarasya savilāse oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ 
vedavedāntā prasiddhānubhāve samadhyāsita mahādāve 
santrāsadāyakamahābhimarāve oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ 
utpattisthāpanasaṃhārakalpanādakṣasamunmūlita vipakṣaprakalpita 
bhaktajanarakṣe oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ anatidīrghakharvapīvari pralayakālajāladhīvari 
mahāśmaśānaśavacelacīvali oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ vyāghra carmāmbarā vṛtakaṭi 
mahāpralayakālanaṭi saptārṇavaikatāsamarabhaṭi

<p. 86a> oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ jaya <2> mahāyogeśvarī yogasambhave yogagamye 
yogātīte yogarūpe chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahājñāneśvarī 
jñānasaṃbhave jñānagamye jñānātīte jñānarūpe chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā 
jaya jaya mahāmantreśvari mantrasambhave mantragamye mantrātīte mantrarūpe 
chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahāsiddhīśvari siddhisaṃbhave siddhigamye 
siddhyatīte siddhirūpe chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahāsarveśvarī 
sarvasambhāve sarvagamye sarvātīte sarvarūpe chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya 
mahādharmeśvari dharmasaṃbhave dharmagamye dhammātīte dharmarūpe chrīṁ 
klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahākāmeśvarī kāmasambhave kāmagagamye 
kāmātīte kāmarūpe chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahāmokṣeśvari 
mokṣasaṃbhave mokṣagamye mokṣātīte mokṣarūpe chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya 

<p. 86b> jaya mahānirvāṇeśvarī nirvāṇaśaṃbhave nirvaṇagamye nirvāṇatīte 
nirvāṇarūpe chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahākailyeśvarī kaivalyaśambhave 
kaivalyagamye kaivalyātīte kaivalyarūpe chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ 
phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya <2> jīva <2> triśūnili mahābalini jagatkavalini hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ 
svāhā oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁḥ jaya jaya jīva jīvavaguṇātīta 
paramasadāśivamohini apavargarasadohini śurddhasatvaguṇacaitanyānandarohiṇi 
hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva 
mahānāgarājabhūṣita daśabhujadaṇḍe caṇḍacaṇḍātitarakaravālavinikṛtu 
sakaladaityadānavaśarīrakhaṇḍe nirantarākṛṣṭakaṭhoravāṇakodaṇḍe hūṁ phaṭ 
namaḥ svāhā oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva 
manāviṣayivāgagocare 

<p. 87a> triguṇasarvakalevare vyāghracarmāmbare hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā oṃ hrīṁ 
hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva pracalatarajaṭābhārabhāsure himakunda 
candraghanasākambu medūre jarā janmamṛtyusaṃsārapāśabhidūre hūṁ phaṭ 
namaḥ svāhā oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva guhyāti 
paramaguhya parāparaśivaśakti tatvagūḍhe svānandānubhava 
svaprakāśapadarūḍhe sāmarasya vilāsaparyaṅka samūḍhe hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ 
svāhā || 
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva prakṛtipuruṣātīta 
niḥśreyasasākṣini trilokī rakṣiṇi daityadānavabhakṣiṇi hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā 
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva nikhilakaulamatacakrapravartini 
samastadaityadānavarākṣasabhayakartini mahāmārī 
paracakradurbhikṣamahonpātasādhvasanivartini 

<p. 87b> hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva 
vividhadivyāstrasaṃdhānapāraṅgameṣaḍāmnāya 
mantramayapañjaravihaṅgame samastaśarīrabhūṣaṇī kṛtāṣṭabhujaṅgame hūṁ 
phaṭ namaḥ svāhā oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva 
prapañcātīta niṣkalaturīyākāre akhaṇḍānanda paramānmabodhāmṛtadhāre 
nigamāgamatatvasāre hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya 
jaya jīva jīva mahākhecarī prabhṛti siddhyaṣṭaka pradāyini kṣīrodārṇavodbhūta 
sudhādevi viśeṣarasapāyini trilokī jaṭharotpannasatvamānvabandhanakāri māyini 
hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva 
brahmaviṣṇuśivārādhanīya caraṇakamale nṛmuṇḍābali bhūṣita gate 
nikhilasurāsurā sahya mahābale hūṁ phaṭ 

<p. 88a> namaḥ svāhā jaya jaya satyayuge pratyaṃgire jaya jaya tretāyuge 
siddhilakṣmi jaya jaya dvāparayuge rājyalakṣmi jaya jaya kaliyuge 
caṇḍakāpālini oṃ aiṁ āṁ hsauṁḥ sauṁ bhagavati prasīda <2> jvala <2> prajvala <2> sphura <2> 
prasphura <2> caṭa <2> pracaṭa <2> gāya <2> hasa <2> nṛtya <2> kaha <2> kili <2> kici <2> tvara <2> dhāva <2> 
hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ vyomakeśi vidyutkeśi piṅgakeśi phaṭ svāhā hūṁ phreṁ 
kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ bhagamālini bhagaprade bhagapriye phaṭ svāhā hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ 
hrīṁ madanonmādiṇi śavamāṃsakhādini brahmasaṃvādini phaṭ svāhā hūṁ 
phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ nalakapālamālābharaṇe saṃsārasāgarataraṇe 
tribhuvanavanditacaraṇe phaṭ svāhā hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ vamadagnimukhi 
mahāśaṃkhasamākule valābhayakare svāhā hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ koṭi <2> phreṁ 
ruparivṛte karatālikātrāsika tripiṣṭapa mahāsamvartakālīna nṛtyaprasārita

<p. 88b> pādāghātaparivartite saptadvīpe phaṭ svāhā hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ 
caraṇavimyāsāvanamrīkṛtakamaṭhaśe bhoge adhyāsitasamastabhūtāntaḥkaraṇe 
nigamāgametihāsapurāṇāgocaratatva phaṭ svāhā hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ 
bhaktajanahṛdayasantāpanivāriṇi duḥkhatrayābhibhūtajaṅgamājaṅgama 
sakalasatvatāriṇi devādideva hṛdayārabindaprakāśanaika mārtaṇḍamaṇḍale 
phaṭ svāhā oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ chrīṁ śrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ hūṁ hauṁ hoṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ phreṁ khphreṁ 
sakaladaityadānavāsurayakṣarākṣasabhūtapretapiśācakuṣmāṇḍaḍākini 
śākinīskaṃdavināyakaghonaka kṣetrapālabetāla brahmarākṣasagandharva 
guhyakasarpanāgagrahanakṣatrabhūtonmāda trividhotpāta 
caurāgnivanyāsvāpadaya yuddhavajropanāśani meghavidyutpāta varṣe 
viṣopaviṣakṛtyābhivāracharakapaṭadubbhikṣa 
nagarabhaṃgadeśopadravastambhanamohanavaśīkaṇa 

<p. 89a> dveṣāccāṭanāveśanadanadīsamudrāvartakāntāra vāhyādahanyā 
kṛmikīṭapaṭaṃga sthalajajaraja śūkapadadvipada 
catuṣpadaṣaṭvadāṣṭapadānekapadaghorāndhakāra mahāmārī 
vālagrahahiṃsaka sarvasvāpahāri māyāvidurjanākṣa devi dasyuvañcaka 
divācara rātriñcara saṃdhyācara śṛṅgirakhidaṃṣṭridavolkādi 
vividhopaddravetyā māṃ rakṣa <2> pāhi <2> pālaya <2> dhāraya <2> trāya <2> gopaya <2> 
samuddhara <2> abhayaṃ kuru <2> prasīda <2> amukaṃ paya <2> śatrūnmajahi <2> unmūlaya 
<2> chindhi <2> bhindi <2> māraya <2> nāśaya <2> hana <2> uccāṭaya <2> stambhaya <2> matha <2> 
vidhvaṃsaya <2> truta <2> śoṣaya <2> vidrāvaya <2> trāsaya <2> mohaya <2> vibhrāmaya <2> 
sphoṭaya <2> jambhaya <2> hara <2> vikṣobhaya <2> mardaya <2> mada <2> turu <2> hili <2> kici <2> daha <2> 
bhakṣaya <2> kṛntaya <2> sañcūrṇaye <2> piṃṣa <2> coraya <2> bhañja <2> 

<p. 89b> bhasmī kuru <2> ākarṣaya <2> pātaya <2> kampaya <2> uddhe <2> jaya <2> āveśaye <2> 
unmādaya <2> bhāyaya <2> lunīhi <2> āskandaya <2> muñca <2> piva <2> jāraya <2> sthāpaya <2> 
svakapāle vlauṁ bhagavati glauṁ mahāpracaṇḍini kṣauṁ vidāriṇi kṣrīṁ 
muṇḍamālini kṣrūṁ mahāgrāse rhrīṁ pārvati rhrūṁ mahābhūtini rkṣrīṁ 
bhujaṅga kiṃkiṇīke rkṣrūṁ pātālavāsini navabījāntaścāriṇi kokāmukhi hūṁ 
raktatuṇḍi hūṁ rudrādhāre hūṁ ṛkṣakarṇi hūṁ jālandharī hūṁ vidyuddhāse hūṁ 
candrabhāle hūṁ śavari kirāti hūṁ kuṇapāśani hūṁ kṣīrodārṇava priye hūṁ 
sāmarasya lolupe hūṁ kailāsasañcāriṇi hūṁ bhaktakalpalatike hūṁ manoratha prade 
hūṁ siddhyaṣṭakavidhāyini hūṁ rājyeśvarya dāyini hūṁ rājarājeśvarī hūṁ 
vidyutkaṭākṣe hūṁ sudhāsamudramagne hūṁ manidhari vajriṇi hūṁ mahāḍāmari 
hūṁ bhaktisevāpravaṇe hūṁ caturvargaphalaprade 

<p. 90a> hūṁ arddhate mukti dehi svāhā 
oṃ agocare siddhidāpaye svāhā 
oṃ turīyātīte svapade darśaye svāhā 
oṃ cidānadarūpe jñānamayi dhehi svāhā 
oṃ nādabindusvarūpe yogaprakaṭaya svāhā 
oṃ caitanyamayākāre sarvajñatāṃ prakalpaya svāhā
oṃ mantramayavigrahe śivaśaktisāmarasya vibhāvaya svāhā 
oṃ jñānadīpakalike ajñānatimiramapanaya svāhā 
oṃ śabdabrahmamayi sarvavidyāṃ marcavasthāpaya svāhā 
