phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ nama iti kaliyuge tadetat parvanigamāgamavedibhirabhyastaṃ 
mumukṣare tadabhyasmanna punarbhavāya gāyatrīvānvahamadhyetavyāsayaṃ 
sarvanigamāgamamāto khphreṁ siddhilakṣmyai vidmahe kārikāyai dhīmahi tannaḥ 
saṃkarṣaṇī pracodayāt ||
pañcaviṃsatyakṣarā vā eṣā gāyatrī pañcaviṃśati tatvānyati krāmeti eṣā 
vānavākṣī sahacarītāmadhīte brahmavidivabrahmāpnoti oṃ caṇḍakāpālinyai 
vidmahe kālasaṃkarṣaṇyai dhīmahi tannaḥ siddhilakṣmīḥ pracodayāt ||
unatriṃśadakṣarā vā eṣā yutākṣarī gāyatrī etāmadhītya 

<p. 88b> brahmasāyujyatāmāpnoti hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ chrīṁ hsauṁḥ krīṁ kroṁ phreṁ strīṁ 
śrīṁ phroṁ juṁ vlauṁ vrīṁ svāhā eṣā vā navākṣarī samānā eṣā vā vyadhītā 
tadeva phalaṃ gamayati ṣoḍaśāro mantraḥ ṣoḍaśakalā āsādayati ṣoḍaśāpi 
bhogān prayacchati avigrahā saumyāpi mahogrā aiṁ hīkāmuṣmika 
sukhasiddhividhāyinī oṃ aiṁ āṁ sarvavidyāpradātrī śrīṁ hrīṁ phreṁ chrīṁ khphreṁ 
pracurataradharapradā klīṁ strīṁ hūṁ hrīṁ kroṁ vlu(-)aiṁ kṣauṁ strīṁ patra 
gṛhasaukhyārogyāyuḥkāriṇī rchrīṁ njauṁ glūṁ hauṁ khroṁ hsauṁḥ sauṁḥ saravijaya 
śatrunāśa rājyapradā kṣchrīṁ kluṁ glīṁ rykṣrīṁ vlauṁ rogotpāta sarpaśatrumārīti 
bhayanāśinī oṃ oṃ oṃ hsaḥ śauṁ kaivalyamokṣavidhāyinī aiṁ aiṁ hauṁ hauṁ 
yamaniyama tapoyogajñānavairāgyabhāvayitrī hskṣmlvryūṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ 
sarvakārya sarvamanoratha sarvasiddhividhāyinī khphreṁ khphrīṁ khphruṁ khphraiṁ 
khphrauṁ bhūtapretapiśācayakṣarakṣogandharvā 

<p. 99a> veśapraśamanī hskhphrāṁ hskhphrīṁ hskhphrūṁ hskhphraiṁ hskhphrauṁ 
durbhikṣa marakākāra mṛtyuparacakra bhayapramardinī khāṁ khyuṁ khyaṁ khaiṁ khaiṁ 
khauṁ avagrahajvarobhicārakalahadveṣoccāṭana prañjanī haṁ haṁ haṁ haiṁ haiṁ haiṁ  
corakāntārasthavanyaśvāpadadandaśūkapucchaviṣavileśaya 
draṃṣṭriromagaralabhīti hāriṇī kṣaṁ kṣaṁ kṣaṁ kṣaiṁ kṣaiṁ kṣaiṁ 
kapaṭivañcakadasyudhartaghātinī bhaṁ bhaṁ bhaṁ bhaiṁ bhaiṁ bhaiṁ vividhopadrava 
praśamanī oṃ aiṁ phreṁ hrīṁ hūṁ chrīṁ strīṁ hsauṁḥ namo namo bhagavatyai 
caṇḍakāpālinyai hāṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hauṁ āṁ namaḥ pratyaṅgirāyai koṭi <2> 
dordaṇḍamaṇḍitāyai mahābhīma śmaśānilayāyai 
mahārudrahṛdayaparyaṅkādhīrūḍhāyai krauṁ glauṁ phreṁ khphreṁ hsphreṁ 
hskhphreṁ rhrūṁ rkṣhrūṁ rkṣhrūṁ rkṣrmchrūṁ rjjhrkṣūṁ mahākuṇapravāhanāyai 
ajitāyai aparājitāyai alakṣitāyai amitāyai agocarāyai apatihatāyai

<p. 99b> anupatāyai anutpannāyai advaitāyai śatakoṭi caraṇanetre 
sahasravṛndamastake jvalajvala prajvara prasphura sphura sphura prasphura prasphura 
caṭa caṭa pracaṭa pracaṭa kaha kaha dhama dhama hasa hasa gāya gāya jaya jaya jīva 
jīva vyāghracarmāmbare karālarūpiṇi muṇḍamālini phreṁ phreṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kṣoṁ 
kṣoṁ kroṁ kroṁ kroṁ dharitrī dhāriṇi brahmavādinī brahmāmṛtamayi namostute 
pratyaṅgire namostute siddhilakṣmī namostute caṇḍakāpālini namostute sa 
sāmrāhyādhi daivate namostute mahāmāya arūpe bahurūpe viśvarūpe 
nānārūpe rūpātīte sakalasuradaityadānavochādini kṛtyābhicāra 
grahanakṣatradoṣapraṇāśiṇi yakṣarāsabhūtapiśācavetāla pretaḍākinī 
kūṣmāṇḍaprabhañjani

<p. 100a> gāyatri sāvitrī mahitri avitri agnibhayakṛntani vidyudaśani 
varṣasalilyāpramardini sāgaravahiḍanauvābhyāghūrṇikā pramocini 
rātryandhakārakāntāra duḥkhaughasaṅkaṭatāriṇi 
rājakulaviṣopaviṣajvarādirogapraśamani abhaye bhayahāriṇi anaghe aghanāśinī 
adīne dainyakhaṇḍini acintye cintānodini amagdhe(?) mohāpanayini ajaḍe 
jāḍyahāriṇi amāya mādāyini abandhe chedini aroge rogonmūlini anugrāhike 
janmamaraṇabhayabhedini alakṣaṇīya lakṣaṇadāyini avyakte vyaktikari 
amṛtaphalaprade satya satya pada pradātri nityanityānandakari bodhe bodhādhāyini 
manovāgagocare 

<p. 100b> manoratha pradāyini īhānabhibhūte samīhāsaṃpādayini 
pramāṇāvedya pramāṇasiddhividhāyini aguṇāvigrahā'nupāsyā 
saguṇāvayavopāsanīyā himaśaṃkhakundavarṇā pañcavadanā prativadana 
triyanā piṅgalajaṭā mukuṭabhūṣitā vyāghracarmaparidhānā 
naramuṇḍamālinī rudrahṛdayādhirūḍhā yogapaṭṭāvanaddha jānudvayā 
daśahastā triśūlakhaḍgamuṇḍāṃkuśakhaṭvāṅgakapālapāśaghaṃṭhā 
varābhayakarā acintyāmita balapārākramā 
daityadānavāsuramāṃsarudhirapriyā samaravijayasampādanakarī bhaktajana 
svargamokṣavidhāyini śmaśānavāsinī mahāghorarāvā mahāṭṭaṭṭahāsakarī 
yoginī ḍākinī cāmuṇḍā bhairavī sahacāriṇī vṛhallambamānodarī

<p. 101a> tridivabhūmaṇḍalarasātalādi caturdaśabhuvaneśvarī 
navakoṭimantramayakalevarā mahābhīṣaṇatarākāradhāriṇī 
garbhavāsa janmajarāmṛtyuhāriṇi guhyātiguhya parāpara śivaśaktisāmarasya 
samaya kulākulacakraparamatatvaguḍhā prakṛtya paraśiva nirvāṇaphaladāyinī
vikarāla dvātriṃśadantapaṃkti koṭisaṃcūrṇita koṭi brahmāṇḍā caturdvāra 
caturasra trirekhāṣṭāra dvādaśadalāṣṭa dale ṣaṭkoṇa trikoṇa bindurūpa 
gṛhamadhyavāsinī navavarṇamantrarājopāsanīyā navanavārṇaghaṭita 
kūṭamūrtidharā sarvāvāṅmaya vidyātigānādabindukalā 
kālādivyāmoghamūrtidhara trayastriṃśatkoṭiśastrāstrasaṃdhānasaṃgrahiṇī
nikhilāgama daiśikārādhanīyā

<p. 101b> mahākhecarī mudrā prakaṭayitrī mahāśaṃkhavinirmitakalābharaṇā 
madanonmādinī nikhiladuḥkhotsādini kapālamālābharaṇā koṭividyudarka 
durnirīkṣyākārā mahāmāṃsakhaṇḍakabalinī vamadagnijvālamukhamaṇḍala 
vibhūṣitā koṭi <2> pheru parivṛtā carcarī karatālikā trāsita 
tribhuvanānṛtyaprasārita karapādāghāṭanamadunnamatkamaṭhaśeṣabhogā kuru 
kulyā kuṇa pachatrā ulūkapoṣiṇī narakaṃkālakaraṅkinī raktatuṇḍī 
śvetamukhī caṇḍāti caṇḍī yamaghaṃṭhā jvālāmālinī bhuvanabhayaharī 
vetālānanāskandaghonakasavāsā kaumāravratinī kulakuṭṭanī mahāraudrī sarva 
sarvabījaprasavitrī kāleśvarī kālavañcanī mahābhairavī jagatmātā 
jagadānandadāyinī pralayānalavaktrā mṛtyuyavilāsinī

<p. 102a> kukkuṭapātalālanī vahivarhāvataṃsinī mahāḍāmarī mahāghūrṇita 
raktanetrā ṛddhivṛddhi śānti svasti tustikarī devadevaśvarī sarvaśubhavighātinī 
sarvāśu bhayaṅkarī rhkṣmlvryūṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ rhkṣmlvryūṁ 
śkṣmlvryīṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ rhkṣmlvryūṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ 
phreṁ kroṁ namaḥ hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ chrīṁ hsauṁḥ krīṁ kroṁ phreṁ strīṁ śrīṁ phroṁ jūṁ vlauṁ 
vrīṁ svāhā nama navārṇa navākṣara ghoḍaśākṣaramantrayo pāsana priyā aiṁ 
haloki kapālalaukiṃkādi caturvargahasādhanī mahāmāyā saumyāgrarūpā 
prativyakti svasvamanoratha pūraṇī hsgkṣmlvlūṁ patyaṅgire devi tubhyaṃ namaḥ 
phaṭ svāhā pratyaṅgire devī tubhyannamaḥ phaṭ svāhā pratyaṅgire devi 
tubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ svāhā ||

[iti śrīkālānalamantre siddhilakṣmyayutākṣaramālāmantraḥ samāptaḥ] ||

<p. 102b> tato phalgukhaṇḍaṃ gṛhītvā ||
guruparaṃparādi gaṇavaṭukādi sāṅga bhagavatyantaṃ svasvamantreṇa 
tarpayāmi iti śrīpādukāṃ tena tarpayet || mūla devīntu <108> || <54> || <27> || 

navākṣareṇa yathāśaktyā tarpaṇaṃ || 
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ || āgataṃ svāgataṃ ||

tataḥ prathamaṃ pādyaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai śrīsiddhilakṣmī ambāyai sāṅgāyai saparivārāyai 
sāyudhāyai idaṃ bhagavatyai pādyaṃ namaḥ ||

tato argha ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai śrīsiddhilakṣmī aṃbāyai sāṅgāyai saparivārāyai 
sayudhāyai idamarghaṃ bhagavatyai namaḥ ||

tato ācamanaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṅgāyai saparivārāyai sāyudhāyai idamācanīmayakaṃ 
bhagavatyai namaḥ ||

tataḥ snānaṃ ||
aiṁ kṣīreṇa snāpayadbhaktyā deveśī bhaktavatsalāṃ |
bhuktvā tu medinī paścādindraloke mahīyate ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṃgāyai saparivārāyai sāyudhāyai idaṃ kṣīrasnānaṃ 
bhagavatyai namaḥ ||

dadhisnānaṃ ||
snāpayadvidhinā devīndadhnā bhairava vallabhāṃ |
rājatena vimānena śivaloke mahīyate ||

<p. 103a> hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṅgāyai saparivārāyai sāyudhāyai bhagavatyai 
dadhisnānaṃ namaḥ ||

ghṛtamadhuśarkalā ||
ghṛtaṃ ca madhusaṃmiśraṃ śarkarābhiḥ samanvitaṃ |
yaḥ snāpayeti deveśaṃ labhate viputaṃ phalaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṃgāyai saparivārāyai sāyudhāyai 
ghṛtaśarkarāsnānaṃ bhagavatyai namaḥ ||

suddhodaka snānaṃ ||
suddhodakena devīntu snāpya bhaktyā samanvitaḥ |
sarvajvalavinimukto mahārogāt pramucyate ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṅgāyai saparivārāyai sāyudhāyai bhagavatyai 
jalasnānaṃ namaḥ ||

ali ||
surāśakti śivo māṃsaṃ tatsaṃmelanamuttamaṃ |
ṛddhi siddhi vrataṃ puṇya alisnānaṃ dadāmyahaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṃgāyai sagaṇaparivārāyai sāyudhāyai bhagavatyai 
alisnānaṃ namaḥ ||

tatra mūlavidyāmuccaret || tatoṅga proṃcchanaṃ || tataścandanaḥ ||
śrīkhaṇḍa kuṃkumaiyuktaṃ karpuraṃ mṛganābhijaṃ |
vilepanārthaṃ deveśi gṛhāṇātmānulepanaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai 

<p. 103b> sāṃgāyai sagaṇaparivārāyai sāyudhāyai bhagavatyai 
candanānulepanaṃ namaḥ ||

sindūraṃ ||
vīreśvarī mahāvīra vīrabhasmasamanvitaṃ |
trailokyākarṣaṇaṃ devi siṃdūrāruṇamuttamaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṃgāyai sagaṇaparivārāyai sāyudhāyai siṃdūraṃ 
bhagavatyai namaḥ ||

vastraṃ vastraṃ paritraṃ paramaṃ sukhasaubhāgyadāyakaṃ |
kāryāsikaṃ jagatmātarvastraṃ gṛhna namostute ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṃgāyai sagaṇaparivārāyai sāyudhāyai vastraṃ 
bhagavatyai namaḥ ||

yajñopavītaṃ ||
yajñopavītaṃ deveśi brahmagraṃthisamanvitaṃ |
gṛhāna navatantuñca brahmaṇā nirmitaṃ purā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai yajñopavitaṃ namaḥ ||

dṛṣṭi ||
svargamartyakapātāla caturdaśa pradarśakaṃ |
divyacakṣuḥ phalāptyarthaṃ dṛṣṭikaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṃgāyai dṛṣṭikaṃ namaḥ ||

karṇapatākā || 
paṃcadhvajā ||
karṇārthayugalaṃ devī patākāpañcavarṇakaṃ |
pañcasiddhi phalāptyarthaṃ gṛhānadhvajamuttamaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṅgāyai karṇapatākā dhvajaṃ namaḥ ||
durvākṣatapuṣpaṃ ||

<p. 104a> durvākṣata sugandhāni lakṣmī tejo jayapradaṃ |
siddhidaṃ ṛddhide mātargṛhāna jagadaṃbike ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṃgāyai durvākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

mālāpuṣpaṃ ||
nānāpuṣpasugaṃdhāni mālāḍhya vividhāni ca |
devadeveśi gṛhnalaṃ mayā bhaktyā niveditaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṃgāyai sagaṇaparivārāyai sāyudhāyai mālāpuṣpaṃ 
namaḥ ||

tato mūlasvāmini || ugrakrama || gāyatryā daśadhā saṃpūjya ||
khphreṁ siddhilakṣmyai vidmahe navaityadhika dhīmahi tanno lakṣmīḥ pracodayāt || 
<10> ||

mūlena triyāñjalyā pūjayet ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ||
tato devyāgre baliṃ sthāpayet || parivārebhyo pṛthak pṛthak ||

tato baliṃ praticipiṭamāṣa phalgumāṃsaṃ surādikaṃ dātavyaṃ ||
tato mūlasvāmini parivāra pūjārthaṃ ājñāṃ prārthayet ||
oṃ sacinmaya pare devī parāmṛta calu priye |
anujñāṃ dehi surabhe parivārārcanā hi me ||
iti prārthayitvā parivārapūjā ||

hetukādipūjā || 

dhyānaṃ ||
pītavarṇañcaturbāhu khaḍgaśūlavidhāriṇaṃ |
<p. 104b> kapālamuṇḍahastañca hetukāya namostute ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ hetuka kṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
raktavarṇa ṛtubāhuṃ khaḍgapheṭaka dhāriṇaṃ |
khaṭvāṅgaḍamaruhastaṃ mudrākapāla dhāriṇaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ tripurāntaka kṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
kṛṣṇavarṇañcaturbhujaṃ ḍamarukhaṭvāṅgadhāriṇaṃ |
kapālaśūlahastaṃ ca muṇḍamālāvibhūṣitaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ agnivetāla kṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
dhūmravarṇamaṣṭabāhuṃ ḍamarukhaṭvāṅgadhāriṇaṃ |
pāśāṅkuśadharaṃ devaṃ triśūlaghaṇṭhadhāriṇaṃ ||
kapālañca varaṃ devaṃ naramālāñca dhāriṇaṃ |
hāḍālaṃkāra rasarpañca kṣetrapālaṃ namostute ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ agnijihvā kṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śuklavarṇañcaturbhujaṃ kapālamuṇḍadhāriṇaṃ |
parśupāśadharaṃ devaṃ kṣetrapāla namostute ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ kaṃkāla kṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||
hūṁ kalālakṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
dhūmravarṇaṃ caturbāhuṃ kapālakhaḍgadhāriṇaṃ |
gajacarmadharaṃ deva kṣetrapālaṃ namostute ||

<p. 105> hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ kapālakṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
kālavarṇaṃ caturbhujaṃ muṇḍakhaḍgañca dhāriṇaṃ |
kapālaṃ ḍavaśu hastaṃ kṣatrapālaṃ namāmyahaṃ ||
aṣṭakṣetraṃ mahādevi draṃṣṭrā karālavadanaṃ |
pretāsanaṃ mahādevaṃ muṇḍābharaṇabhūṣitaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ ekapāda kṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
triśūlaṃ ḍamaruñcaiva kapālaṃ nāgarājakaṃ |
karairdadhānaṃ prabhajeddhāṭakaṃ nīravarṇakaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ hāṭakakṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
acalaṃ meghaśaṃkāśaṃ bhajehaṃkarapaṃkajaiḥ |
duṃdubhiṃ śūlapāśau ca pātraṃ suragaṇottamaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ acarakṣetrapālāya namaḥ ||
thvatenaṃ bali || iti hetukādi ||

tato dhāmādi ṣaṭdūtīpūjā ||

dhyānaṃ ||
ekāsyā dvibhujāḥ sarvā dhāmādyāḥ kṛṣṇavigrahāḥ |
churikāḥ khaḍgadhāriṇyo dhyātavyā hi trilocanāḥ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ḍhāṃ dhāmā aṃbā pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ dhāmavatī aṃbā pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ dhāṁ dhāmnī aṃbā pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ vāṁ vedhānamaṇḍalā aṃbā pādukāṃ ||

<p. 105b> hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ rāṁ raviprabhā aṃbā pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ viṃ virājantī ambā pādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ bali ||

tataḥ kākatuṇḍādi ||

dhyānaṃ ||
kākāsyāṃ kṛṣṇavarṇāṅgī pretāsana gatāṃ parāṃ |
ḍamaruṃ mukuraṃ kādyaṃ varaṃ cādadhatīṃ bhaje ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ mahākamalacaṇḍinī raudramukhe hrīṁ hrīṁ hrīṁ kāṁ 
śrīkākamukhī śrīpādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śrīcaṇḍavaktrā kilanīlavarṇā pretāsanā vedabhujā pracaṇḍā |
kartṛntathā darpaṇamadvitīyaṃ varaṃ dadhānā huḍukaṃ suramyaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ cīṁ śrīcaṇḍamukhī śrīpādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
ṭāṃkārī raktavarṇāṃgī pretagāñca mudrā bhaje |
vibhrāṇāṃ ḍamaruṃ muṇḍaṃ varakādyaṃ karāmbujaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ṭūṁ śrīṭāṃkārī pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
pretādhirūḍhāṃ surarājavaṃdyā manoharā dhūsaravarṇasaṃyutā |
varaṃ triśūlaṃ ḍamaruṃ ca darpaṇaṃ sadā dadhānā vimalā ca tāpinī ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ tṛṁ śrītāpinī pādukāṃ ||

dhyāna ||
yāvakīṃ pāvakaprakhyāṃ sandadhānāṃ kalāmbujaiḥ |
pretasvā ḍamaruṃ ghaṇṭhāṃ varaṃkādya karāṃ bhaje ||

<p. 106a> hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ptṛ śrīpāvakī pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
yamaghaṇṭhā pretasaṃsthā tamālavanamerakā ||
dadhatīvarakhaṭvāṅga ḍamaruṃ darpaṇa tathā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ yaiḥ yamaghaṇṭhā śrīpādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
pretasthāṃ ca śivādūtīṃ vande lohitavigrahāṃ |
ḍamaruṃ varadaṃ muṇḍaṃ kādyamādadhatī karaiḥ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śauṁ śivādūti pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
karairdadhānāṃ ḍamarūṃ gaḍāṃvaraṃ sudarpaṇaṃ pītakalevarāṃ śivāṃ |
vande sadā vārijapatralocanāṃ kṣayaṃkarī pretavarāsanāmahaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ kṣaṁḥ śrīkṣayaṃkarī ambā pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
mahāghorākṣī sāsakalaripusaṃmohajananī 
sadā piṃgānaṃgātura haraparaprīti kuśalā |
varaṃ saṃkhaṃ kādyaṃ ḍamarumathahastāṃbuja
cairdadhāno pretasthā kulanibhṛtavidyā vijayate || 
khphreṁ āṁ kroṁ phreṁ mahāsiddhisamaye khphreṁ bhairavī ghorākṣī varaprade 
svāhā || pūrvādārabhya madhyāntaṃ ||

tataḥ karaṃkinyādi ||

dhyānaṃ ||
kṛṣṇā subhīṣaṇī raudrau cāsthi srakdāmaśobhitā |
<p. 106b> ekavaktrā trinetrā ca muṇḍamālā caturbhujā ||
muṇḍapadmadharā dīptā pāśāṅkuśa vidhāriṇi |
athavā khaḍgachurikā ṣaḍete dhyānamuddhṛtaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ karaṃkinī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ krodhinī ambā pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ saṃkarṣaṇī ambā śrīpādukāṃ || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ lelihānā ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ khecarī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhairavī ambā śrīpādukāṃ || 
thvatenaṃ bali ||

śaṃkhinī śivādūti ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śaṃkhinī tu śivādūtī vāmadakṣiṇasaṃsthite ||
śivādūtī parāvidyā śaṃkhinī tu nibodhame ||
śaṃśinī māyayā pūrvaṃ praṇavādi namontagā ||
dvau hastau cātra  sannaddhau śavakarṇāvalambinī ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śaṃkhinī ambā śrīpādukāṃ || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śivādūtī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
bali ||
tato hṛdādi ṣaddūtīpūjā ||

dhyānaṃ ||
kṛṣṇāṃjana nibhāṃ devīṃ nīlajīmūtasanibhāṃ |
indīvaradala śyāmāṃ nīlotpaladalaprabhāṃ ||
atasīpuṣpasaṃkāśāṃ rājāvarta samaprabhāṃ |
draṣṭrā kalālavadanāṃ dhyānāsyāṃ kṛta kuṇḍalāṃ ||
jaṭājūṭadharāṃ divyāṃ phaṇīndramukuṭasthitāṃ |

<p. 107a> mudrāṣṭaka samopetāṃ nānāratna samaṇḍitāṃ ||
kādyaṃ khaṭvāṅga nāgañca pāśaṃ vāme vyavasthitāṃ |
triśūlaṃ varadaṃ caiva cākṣasūtrañca kartarīṃ ||
ḍamaruṃ cānakaṃ caiva dakṣiṇe ca virājate |
nāgahārapralaṃbena samunnata payodharāṃ ||
trivalītaraṅgamadhyasthāṃ nitaṃvādyāṃ suśobhanāṃ |
śavayāna sthitāṃ devīṃ kṛṣṇavastraparicchadāṃ ||
evaṃ dhyātvā varārohe śṛṃgāṭapuramadhyagāṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

aiṁ <5> hskhphreṁ kālikāli hrāṁ māṃsaśonitabhojani hūṃ raktakṛṣṇamukhī devī 
hrauṁ māṃ māṃ paśyantu śatravaḥ hṛdayadūtī śrīpādukāṃ || hṛdayakālikā 
devī ||

dhyānaṃ ||
raktāruṇa mahādīptāmūrddhakeśī bhayaṃkarīṃ |
asthimālāgale vaddhāṃ karṇau cāsthi pralaṃbitau ||
trinetrāstaddhatārākṣī bhrūlatā vikṛtinanā ||
draṣṭrākarāla cātyugrā carvayantī śirottamān ||
caturbhujā mahātejā kālānalasamaprabhā |
kādyaṃ muṇḍaṃ dharā vāme triśūlaṃ kartṛ dakṣiṇe ||
kapālamālābharaṇāṃ naracarmaparichadāṃ ||

<p. 107b> kaṃkālasthāṃ mahātūgrāṃ grasantīva carācaraṃ ||
evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevīṃ pretasya pura madhyagāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> aiṁ namo bhagavatī duṣṭacāṇḍālī śatrurudhiramāṃsabhakṣaṇī 
kapālakhaṭvāṅgadhāriṇī hana <2> daha <2> vama <2> paca <2> hūṁ <3> amukaṃ māraya <2> 
grasa <2> hrāṁ hrīṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || śirasthāne duṣṭacāṇḍālī ||

dhyānaṃ ||
pañcavaktraṃ darśabhujaṃ tripañcanayanojvalaṃ |
jaṭājūṭadharaṃ divyaṃ karṇakuṇḍalamaṇḍitaṃ ||
triśūlaṃ varadaṃ pāśaṃ khaḍgacarmaṇi dakṣiṇe |
abhayaṃ darpaṇaṃ sarpaṃ bījapūraṃ mahākṣakaṃ ||
vāmena cāyudhān divyān nānālaṃkārasaṃyutaṃ |
nānābharaṇasobhāḍhyaṃ nānāratnaistu maṇḍitaṃ ||
gokṣīravarṇasaṃkāśaṃ himakuṇḍendu saṃnibhaṃ |
sarparājopavītañca ratnamālāpralaṃbitam ||
sarvāvayavasaṃpūrṇaṃ sarvalakṣaṇalakṣiṇaṃ |
evaṃ dhyātvā varārohe śivaṃ paramakāraṇaṃ ||
śikhāśvachanda deveśaṃ tat sthāpyoparipūjayet ||
aiṁ <5> aghore hrauṁ thaghore hsphreṁ ghoraghorantare hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ sarva sarve hsphreṁ 
namaste rudrarūpe hsauṁ pādukāṃ || śikhāsthāne svachanda aghore ||

<p. 108a> dhyāna ||
ekavaktrāṃ trinetrāñca īṣaṭ draṣṭrakarālinī |
jaṭājūṭadharaṃ divyāṃ kaṇaughoṇā samaṇḍitau ||
bhujāṣṭaka samopetāṃ nānābharaṇamanditāṃ |
triśūlaṃ ḍamarukaṃ sarpaṃ śaktiśca dakṣiṇe priye ||
kādyaṃ khaṭvāṃga pāśañca kartikā vāmamāśritā |
indragopakasaṃkāsāṃ pīnonnata payodharī ||
tribalā taraṅgamadhyasthāṃ nitambāḍhyāṃ suśobhanāṃ |
nīlavastrāvṛtā devīṃ kiṣkiṃdhāsanasaṃsthitāṃ ||
muṇḍamālādharāṃ divyāṃ tarjayantīṃ parāṃ śivāṃ |
evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevīṃ śṛṃgātapuramadhyagāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> hrīṁ uttoliyāsimadiyā hrīṁ savapuhaviyavaḍhiyā hrīṁ diliyāsi ulikhiyā hrīṁ 
sarvaṭuvṛṭulikhiyā pādukāṃ || iti śrībhalikākavacasthāna ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śvetanīlāṃjanābhāsā mahādīptā sutejasā |
ekavaktrāṃ trinetrāñca īṣatprahasitānanāṃ ||
divyakuṇḍalaśobhāḍhyā jaṭāmukuṭamanditāṃ |
caturbhujāṃ mahātejāṃ nānābhaṇamaṇḍitāṃ ||
pāśāṃkuśadharān devīṃ kaṃbusūtradharā priye |
<p. 108b> hāranūpurasaṃyuktaṃ pīnonnata payodharāṃ ||
tribalītaraṃgaśobhāḍhyāṃ ratnamālāvibhūṣitāṃ |
padmāsanagatāṃ devīṃ padmapīṭhoparisthitāṃ ||
śvetavastrāvṛtāṃ devī śṛṃgāṭapuramadhyagāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> guhyakubjike hūṁ phaṭ hrīṁ rakte cāmuṇḍeśvarī aiṁ he svāhā || 
raktacāmuṇḍānetra ||

dhyānaṃ ||
pañcavaktraṃ mahāraudrāṃ tripañcanayanojvarāṃ |
āraktastaddhanayanāṃ karṇo ghoṇā samaṇḍitau ||
śvetābhaṃ pūrvavaktraṃ tu raktābhañcottarānanaṃ | 
pītābhaṃ paścimaṃ devī kṛṣṇābhaṃ dakṣiṇānanaṃ ||
draṣṭrā karāla raudrañca piṃgākṣaṃ ghorarūpiṇaṃ |
śaṃkhendu tu hi nābhāsaṃ ūrddhavaktraṃ tu muktidaṃ ||
gaganāvatīti vikhyātaṃ śṛstisaṃhārakārakaṃ |
śreṣṭhānāmaṃ tu pūrveṇa vāmavaktraṃ tu cottaraṃ ||
vatvīti paścimaṃ vaktraṃ raudrā dakṣiṇa saṃsthitaṃ |
aṣṭatriṃśatkalāpetā vaktrasthā ca virājite ||
siddhā suddhā prabhā dīptā kāmadā pañcamī smṛtā |
ūrddhavaktre tu deveśi kalāpaṃcaivasṛṣṭidā ||
siddhidā karṣaṇī raudrā saumyā bhīmā susiddhidā |
bhogadā yogadā devī kalācauṣṭau prakīrtitā ||

<p. 109a> jyeṣṭhāvaktre varārohe virājantī ca tatragā |
sūkṣmāsūkṣmavatī raktā atiraktā ca padmajā ||
suprabhā vimalāvarṇā suśilā tapanā tathā |
bhrāmaṇī śoṣaṇī caiva kriyā caiva trayodaśī ||
vāmavaktre kalādevī dīpyamānā sutejasā |
bhuvanā veginī līlā kṛṣṇā caiva caturthikā ||
vatvīvaktre kalādevi jñātavyāśca prayatnataḥ |
krurā ca krodhanī krodhā tamāmūrcchākṣapāparā ||
mṛtyughorā varārohe raudrā vaktre kalāṣṭakaṃ |
aṣṭatriṃśatkalāyuktā dhyātā kālī susiddhidā ||
dvipañcakabhujopetā nānālaṃkāramaṇḍitā |
triśūlañca gadāpāśaṃ aṃkuśaṃ khaḍgamuttamaṃ ||
dakṣiṇena varārohe astraṃ kālānalaprabhaṃ |
kādyaṃ kheṭaka śaktī ca muṇḍaṃ muśaladhāriṇī ||
vāmamārgāyudhāndivyāndīptānarasamaprabhāṃ |
āpādalaṃbinī divyā kādyamālā sugranthitāṃ ||
jyotsnā kiraṇasaṃkāśāṃ tālakādranibhāṃ śubhāṃ ||
śirakapālamālāntu lambacūcūkā śobhitāṃ ||
citrā hi kṛtamālāñca nāgarājopavītinīṃ |
<p. 109b> vṛkodarīṃ nālavarṇā aṭaśīpuṣpasaṃnibhāṃ ||
kṛṣṇavastraparīdhānāṃ siṃhapṛṣṭhasamāśritāṃ |
nānāratnakṛtāmālāṃ kaṭibaddhāvirājitāṃ ||
yantra mantra kṛtā mālāṃ kaṇṭhasthā ca virājite |
nūpurau vimalau tasyā hemapāradasaṃnibhāṃ ||
sarvāvayavasaṃpūrṇāṃ sarvābharaṇamaṇḍitāṃ |
evaṃ dhyātvā varārohe śṛṅgātapuramadhyagāṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

aiṁ <5> hskhphreṁ śkhphrīṁ hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ sarvāpadravān 
mantrayantracūrṇāprayayogādikaṃ yena kṛtaṃ kālita kariṣyanti tān sarvān hana 
<2> daha <2> daṃṣṭrākarālī hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ ṅlauṁ ṅlūṁ ślīṁ guhyakubjike pādukāṃ 
astradūtī guhyakubjike pādukāṃ || thvatenaṃ bali ||

hanu bhairavayā ||

dhyānaṃ ||
oṃ pañcavaktra mahābhīmaṃ tripañcanetrameva ca |
sūryakoṭi kalābhāsaṃ kapi vaktraṃ sutejasaṃ ||
daśabhistu kare yuktaṃ nakhalāvali tīkṣṇakaṃ | 
daṣṭrākalālavadanaṃ bhṛkuṭi kuṭile kṣaṇaṃ ||
jvalatkaśo jvalatsmaśru jvaladrūrddhatanuruhaṃ |
<p. 110a> mukhadvāre vahe jvālā trailokya dahana kṣamaṃ ||
khaḍgaṃ triśūlaṃ khaṭvāṅgaṃ pāśaṃ cākuśa parvataṃ |
drumārkṣakau tathā muṇḍaṃ muśaraṃ muṣṭikaṃ tathā ||
etāvatārayaṃtyugraṃ jvalantamāyudhottamaṃ |
pratāsano paristhantu nānāratnavibhūṣitaṃ ||
raktāmbaradharaṃ caiva raktaśragjānulepanaṃ |
jvalantaṃ dṛśyate vipraṃ sūryakoṭisamadyutiṃ ||
tasyaiva dakṣiṇaṃ vaktraṃ nārasiṃha mahābalaṃ |
atyugra teja vapuṣaṃ bhīṣaṇaṃ bhayanāyakaṃ ||
paścime gāruḍaṃ vaktraṃ vajratuṇḍamahāvaraṃ |
sarvabhūtaprasamanaṃ viṣalogavikṛntanaṃ ||
uttaraśūkaraṃ mukhaṃ varāha bhīṣaṇaṃ mukhaṃ |
kṛṣṇāñjananibhaṃ raudraṃ jvalamānamahābalaṃ ||
draṃṣṭrākalāravikṛtaṃ sarvayudhanivālaṇaṃ |
pātālaṃ siddhidā tālaṃ jvalarogavināsanaṃ ||
grahapasmāraśamanamati grahavimardanaṃ |
khecarī rūpikārāmā mātaraśca vimardanaṃ ||
urddhaṃ khalānanaṃ ghoraṃ bhīṣaṇaṃ raudrarūpiṇaṃ |
<p. 110b> kurvanti kharaṇādaśca dānavāhṛdisphoṭayana ||
tasya mantro mahādīpti rāja rājeśvarastu saḥ |
sarvasiddhikaraṃ mantraṃ sarvakāmaphalapradaṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

oṃ rhrphreṁ hūṁ bhañja <2> rhrkṣmrīṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

nāṭeśvarayā ||

dhyānaṃ ||
ekavaktraṃ trinetraṃ ca nāgakuṇḍalamaṇḍitaṃ |
jaṭājūṭa śaśi cūḍāṃ śvetavarṇaṃ sutejasaṃ ||
ṣoḍaśaiśca bhūjairyuktaṃ tāṇḍavaṃ parameśvaraṃ |
urddhabāhuṃ nṛtyarūpaṃ ḍamaruṃ triśūlameva ca ||
tridaṇḍi saravajrañca kartikā akṣamālikāṃ |
tathā vāmaṃ nṛtyarūpaṃ khaṭvāṅgapadmameva ca ||
nāgaṃ dhanuḥ tathā ghaṇṭhā kapālaṃ ca kamaṇḍaluṃ |
sahasrasūryasaṃkāśaṃ kālabhinnāṃjaṇaprabhaṃ ||
vṛṣāsana samālūḍhaṃ nṛtyagītena saṃyutaṃ |
bhairavaṃ nṛtyarūpeṇa sarvālaṃkāraśobhitaṃ ||
evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevaṃ nāṭyakāryā susiddhidaṃ ||
mānavānāṃ hitāthāya sarvaduḥkhavināśanaṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

<p. 111a> oṃ hūṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ śrīnṛtyaśvara mahābhairavāya hrīṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ 
śrīnṛtyalakṣmī śaktisahitāya pādukāṃ ||

pañcamī vārāhi ||
dhyānaṃ ||
mahāsiṃhāsanārūḍhā syāmavarṇāṅgasobhinī |
aṣṭabhujā mahāvīrā dodaṃḍe khaḍgapheṭakaṃ ||
cakraśaṃkhaśūlahastā muśaraṃ hara dhāriṇī |
varadābhayadharā devī hāḍaruṇḍā vibhūṣitā ||
muktāhāra vibhūṣāṅgī trinetraṃ mayūgākṣarī |
citājvalitamadhyasthā nirastāhaya pañcamī ||

aiṁ hrīṁ glūṁ āṁ īṁ namo bhagavatī vārttālī <2> vārāhī <2> vārāhimukhī aṃdhye 
aṃdhyani namaḥ ruṃdhya rudhini namaḥ jambhe jambhini namaḥ stambhe stambhini 
namaḥ sarvaduṣṭa praduṣṭānāṃ sarveṣāṃ sarvavākacit cakṣuśrotramukhagati 
jihvā stambhaṃ kuru <2> śīghraṃ vaśaṃ kuru <2> aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ ṭha ṭha ṭha oṃ hūṁ 
phaṭ svāhā || bali ||

paścima ||

dhyānaṃ ||
<5> nīlaṃ pañcānano nityamūrddha paryaṅkasaṃsthitaḥ |
<p. 111b> dviraṣṭavarṣadeśīyo ratnasarpyāsthi caccitaḥ ||
vahni nābhisthitāmbhoje kṛtāṃguṣṭheti bhairavaḥ |
kaṭṭārālānta vyāghrāṃ śukāṃcīkatīstu hāsyavān ||
vibhran śūlaṃ cakradhvajāṃ dānaṃ ca dakṣabāhubhiḥ 
pārijāta jāpya mālā pustakābhayakaṃ karaiḥ ||
anyadbāhudvayābhyāñca kacarmāvṛtavigrahaḥ |
devāvṛta śmaśāne ca sadaiva saṃsthitā navaḥ ||
prasaṃgādastragāmāṇā mathānahaṃ kramāddhruve |
śūlāt sarvatatvalābhaśca krāmāyākṣayo bhavet ||
dhvajāyāṃ lokagāmitvaṃ dānāt sarvajñatā bhavet |
lakṣmīlābhaḥ pārijāte mantrasiddhistu jāpyake ||
yāvat sarvajñatā pustetva bhayanirbhayatvakaḥ |
antarāyatirodhānāṃ saṃbhaved brahmacarmani ||
muktaiva lalito devo lakṣmīsthūlaḥ prasasyate |
śeṣakāryāyā deveśo yathābhimata sammacaḥ ||
pītavarṇo bhavet suṃbhe vaśye kuṃkuma saṃnibhaḥ |

<p. 112a> uccāṭe dhūmravarṇābho vidveṣe saiṃdhavachavi ||
mohane patravajñeyo maṇivat saṃsane mataḥ |
indranīlanibhaḥ sarva karmaṇaiva navaśvaraḥ ||
śitaḥ śānto mukti paṭhe śuddhasphaṭika saṃnibhaḥ |
raktagauraḥ śriya proktaḥ padmavarṇastu kṣobhake ||
cintayet paramaśānaṃ nāvakaṃ vargaśādhane |
śāntau vṛṣabhaskaṃdhasthaṃ padmārūḍhaṃntu paustike ||
uccāṭe karabhāruḍhaṃ mohane dvīpa vāhanaṃ |
meṣārūḍhaṃ jayaddevaṃ mūkamevaka carmani ||
sainya stambhena veśānaṃ kharagaṃ rasmi saṃnibhaṃ |
tīkṣṇe tīkṣṇataraṃ kāryaṃ mṛgau dhananimittaye ||
sthirarājyaṃ ca vidyāñca siṃhāsana gataṃ jayet ||
aiṁ <5> nīlojanasamaprakhyā kubjirūpā mahodarā |
ṣaḍvaktrā dvādaśabhujā sarpyāsthi ratna carcitā ||
muṇḍamālādharī raudrī draṃṣṭrākarārikā nanā |
aṣṭādaśāvvikā devī varvarorddha śirorūhā ||

<p. 112b> vyāghracarmaparidhāṇā siṃhacarmorttarīyakā |
divyābharaṇabhūṣāṃgī aṭṭahāsāsya hāsinī ||
tasyāḥ pītaṃ jalaṃ vaktramuttaraṃ śyāmasannibhaṃ |
dakṣiṇe kṛṣṇavarṇañca yatsaṃmukhaprarśitaṃ ||
urddhavaktraṃ bhaved raktamīśajaṃ sphaṭiko padaṃ |
sahasrasūryasaṃkāsamūrddhavaktraṃ parārci tat ||
caulakūpe ca vāme ca dakṣakarṇa śrutiṣyapi |
nāsāgre vilacūlī ca taleṣvapi kramātmakaṃ ||
śilācitra dālū lepaṃ gataṃ vaktraṃ vravīmyahaṃ |
jala saumya ca vāmāṅga pūrve ca dakṣakarṇege ||
parāvaktra mūḍhadeśe tanmastake parābhidhaṃ |
sarve daṃṣṭrā karālāni vaktrāṇyuktāni śaṃbhunā ||
astrāṇyasyāḥ pravakṣyāmi kubjikāyā mahānti ca |
dakṣiṇe ca prayogena vāme caiva vijānatha ||
triśūlacakravajrāṇi aṃkuśaṃ sakarakartṛke |
dakṣiṇe vāmato dadyāt nīlotpalaṃ satārakaṃ ||

<p. 113a> anyaṃ ca muṇḍa khaṭvāṅgaṃ ghaṃṭhāpustadhanustathā |
kapālaṃ vāmake proktaṃ siṃhāsanaṃ śavāśanī ||
tatvaprāptirbhavechulāccakrātmāyā kṣayo bhavet |
vajrāt sarve roganāśaścāṃkuśātkaṣaṃṇaṃ mataṃ ||
śarāchatru vināśaśca kartṛte vighnavarjana |
lakṣmīlābha utpale ca khaṭvāṅgādastasiddhaye ||
yāvatmantrārthave bhṛtvaṃ ghaṃṭhātaḥ saṃprajāyate |
yāvacchāstrārtha bodhatvaṃ pustrāccāpārthato vaśaḥ ||
kapālācca mahāsiddhirastrānāṃ ca mahāmate |
brahmāpādatale tasyā jaghane viṣṇurucyate ||
hṛdaye vasate rudra īśvarakaṃṭhamaṇḍale |
sakeśivālalātesyaḥ śivastasyāparisthitaḥ ||
caṇḍārkāgnayo netre satārā ṛkṣamaṇḍalaṃ |
svargamastavidhampadme pretasyoparikalpayet ||
svādhisthāne dharātatvaṃ toyaṃ nābhau viciṃtayet |

<p. 113b> tejo hṛdaya madhyenu vāyukaṇṭhe prakalpayet ||
ākāśantu lalāte ca teṣu sarvavyavasthitaḥ |
kulakoṭi sahasrāṇi ārūḍhāḥ kulasāsane ||
tasyāḥ piṇḍavicārastu devāṇāmapi dullabhaḥ |
anantaṃ pādatayo tasyānupulaṃ parikīrtitaṃ ||
karkoṭo mekhalā baṃdhe kaṭibaṃdhaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
taṣyakamupavītantu gare hārastu vāsuki ||
kūlikaṃ karṇayoḥ proktaṃ kūrmakuṇḍalamaṇḍitaṃ |
bhrūmadhye saṃsthitaḥ padmo mahāpadmastathaiva ca ||
bāhudaṇḍeṣu sarveṣu sahasraphaṇimaṇḍitaṃ |
taditkoṭi sahasāhaṃ jvālāmālā samākulaṃ ||
idṛk śrīkubjikā lakṣmyāmāpurṇantā vicintayet ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || triyāñjaliḥ ||
aiṁ <5> hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandaśakti bhairavānandavīrādhipataye yhkṣmlvryīṁ 

<p. 114a> śrīpaścimamūlasthāna bhaṭṭālikāya pādukāṃ || bali || 
uttala || oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ pādukāṃ || bali ||

kāli ||
dhyānaṃ ||
atiguhyā mahākālī daśavaktrā trilocanā |
kṛṣṇavarṇā mahātejā aṣṭabāhustanūdari || <1> ||
nānāvarṇamukho devī sūryo bhavātmikāṃ smaret |
vyāghracarmaparīdhānā hāḍābharaṇabhūṣitā || <2> ||
triśrurāṃkuśa vajraṃ ca muṅgalāyudhadakṣiṇaṃ |
khaṭvāṅgaṃ pāśapātrañca mṛtavāra śirastathāḥ || <3> ||
vicaranti kramarājaṃ sahasraravisaṃnibhaṃ |
asyānti kasya madhyārthaṃ ekasiddhipravartinī || <4> ||
cittakāli kulaṃ madhye jātirūpe nikevale |
nirvāṇaṃ paramaṃ vidyā bhāvātitā manaupamā ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

oṃ oṃ siddhikarālī hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ strīṁ phreṁ namaḥ svāhā pādukāṃ || <3> || bali ||

tripurayā || 
dhyānaṃ ||

<p. 114b> bālārkamaṇḍalāṃbhāsāṃ caturbāhuṃ trilocanaṃ |
pāśāṃkuśa śarāścāpaṃ dhārayantīṃ parāṃ bhajet ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ kvlhrīṁ hykdlhrīṁ yklhrīṁ brahmacakre mahodyānapīṭhe 
śrīcaryāsanāthātmake turyādaśāradhiṣṭhāyake jāgratsvapnasuṣupi 
turyātītecchājñānakriyā śāntātīta paraṃ brahmasvarūpaśakti 
śrīmahātripurasundarī devī pādukāṃ bali ||

tato siddheśvara śrīmahābhairavaṃ pūjayet ||

dhyānaṃ ||
ekāsyāṃ trilocanaṃ sakhaṇḍendu kṛtaśeṣarā |
caturhasta maheśāni dvayahasta kṛtāṃjali ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hsauṁ hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandabhairava siddheśvara 
pādukāṃ pūjayāmi || <3> || 

tato mūlasvāmini || 
rjjhīṁ mahācaṇḍa teja saṃkarṣaṇi kāli manthānehaḥ || varṇa <17> || 
trivālaṃ pūjye ||
phreṁ āṁ kroṁ phriṁ mahāsiddhisamaya khphreṁ bhairavi ghoralakṣmī varaprade svāhā 
|| varṇa <25> || tena tri <3> ||

<p. 115a> āṁ phriṁ phrāṁ mahāsṛṣṭi caṇḍalakṣmī siddheśvari pheṁ phaṭ || varṇa <17> || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ svāhā || <9> ||
khphreṁ namo bhagavatī siddhilakṣmīśvarī hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || <17> ||
tato gāyatyā daśadhā saṃpūjya || 
khphreṁ siddhilakṣmī vidmahe kālikāya dhīmahi tanno saṃkarṣaṇī pracodayāt ||
tato daśonātriśatākṣarya pañcadhā mūlasvāminīṃ pūjayet ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hsauṁ etāḥ guptataraprakaṭataro yoginyaḥ śrībhairava 
kṣetrapālagaṇavaṭukādayaḥ śmaśānavāśino sarvāśāpūlake śrīsiddhicakre 
samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ sāyudhāḥ savāhanā parivārā sopacārai pūjitā saṃtu 
hūṃ phaṭ svāhā || volatrayaṃ tena pūjayet sarvatra ||
iti parivārapūjāvidhi ||

atha cakrapūjā ||

daśadikṣu indrādi || dhyānaṃ ||
śakraścaturbhujaḥ kāyo dvibhujāya tathā sacī |
padmāṃkuśau tu kattavyau śakra dakṣiṇa hastayoḥ ||
vāmāṃ śacī pṛṣṭhagataṃ dvitīya vajrasaṃyutaṃ |
vāme śacyāḥ kare kāryā ramyā santānamañjarī ||

<p. 115b> dakṣiṇaṃ pṛṣṭhavinyastaṃ devanāthasya bhāvayet ||
aiṁ <5> lmlvryūṁ luṁ indrāya vajrahastāya surādhipataye pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
oṃ bhāvayedagnimāgneyāṃ protphullatkiṃśukadyutiṃ |
sitaśaktidharaṃ dīptiṃ srugañcita mahābhujaṃ ||
ajoparisukhāsinaṃ svāhayā sahasaṅgataṃ |
vadanaṃ sarvadevāṃ divyaratnakiriṭinaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> rmlvryūṁ ruṁ agnaye śaktihastāya tejādhipataye pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
nīlanīlada nīlābhaṃ sairibhāṅgagataṃ yamaṃ |
kāladaṇḍadharaṃ dhyāyedaruṇāyata locanaṃ ||
nijaśaktyāvirājantaṃ vāmāṅka sthitayā sadā |
dakṣiṇāśādhipaṃ dhyāyed vāme pāśavidhāriṇaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> mmlvryūṁ mūṁ yamāya daṇḍahastāye pretādhipataye pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
oṃ nīlotpaladala śyāmaṃ rākṣasaṃ raktalocanaṃ |
sūtīkṣna khaḍgavibhāṇaṃ vikaṭānanamaṇḍalaṃ ||
vāmālaṅkṛta vāmāṅgaṃ śavāṅgaśatavigrahaṃ |
dhyāyed vicitre bhūṣāḍhyaṃ nai(-)ṛtyāṃ rākṣaseśvaraṃ ||

<p. 116a> aiṁ <5> kṣmlvryūṁ kṣuṁ nai(-)ṛtyāya khaḍgahastāya rākṣasādhipataye 
pādukāṃ || 

dhyānaṃ ||
śaradabhra śaśāṅkābhaṃ varuṇaṃ makalāsanaṃ |
sphuratpāśadharaṃ śāntaṃ yādogaṇasupūjitaṃ || 
maṇikuṇḍala saṃghṛṣṭa gaṇḍamaṇḍalamaṇḍitaṃ |
svasaktyā parayāyuktaṃ dhyāyet paścima digpatiṃ ||
aiṁ <5> vmlvryūṁ vūṁ varuṇāya pāśahastāya jalādhipataye pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
vāyavyādhipatiṃ prāṇaṃ navadurvāṅkuraprabhaṃ |
varasamvaramārūḍhaṃ maṇihāra vibhūṣitaṃ ||
vāmadakṣiṇabāhubhyāṃ dadhantaṃ dhvajamaṅkuśaṃ |
nijāṅgastrī gatotsaṅgaṃ prabhajāmi prabhajanaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> ymlvryūṁ yuṁ vāyave dhvajahastāya pavanādhipataye pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
oṃ svarṇapracaya saṃkāśamekapiṃgalalocanaṃ |
kuberamāvṛtaṃ yakṣairnidhibhiśca samantataḥ ||
narayāna samākrāntaṃ śmaśrulaśaktisaṃyuktaṃ |
gadollasita dordaṇḍamuttarāśādhipaṃ yajet ||
aiṁ <5> smlvryūṁ sukuberāya gadāhastāya dhanādhipataye pādukāṃ ||

<p. 116b> dhyānaṃ ||
aiśānyamīśvaraṃ dhyāyed rajatācala suprabhaṃ |
trilocanaṃ caturbāhuṃ vṛṣāṅga śaśiśeṣaraṃ ||
triśūlamabhayaṃ pātraṃ vibhrāṇaṃ jñānamudrayā |
śivābhyarcita vāmāṃgaṃ vibhūti paribhūṣitaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> hmlvryūṁ hūṁ īśānāya triśūrahastāya bhūtādhipataye pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
oṃ śaraccandranibhaṃ dhyāyedanantaṃ kamaṭhāsanaṃ |
maṇikuṇḍalaśobhāḍhyaṃ caturdodaṇḍamaṇḍitaṃ ||
haraśaṃkhasitāṃbhojamusalaiḥ pariśobhitaṃ |
phaṇāsaptabhirācchannaṃ pātāratalavāsinaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> aṁ aṁ aṁ anantāya cakrahastāya nāgādhipataye pādukāṃ ||

dhyanaṃ ||
brahmāṇamāvṛtaṃ devyairūddhadiṅmaṇḍala sthitaṃ |
pītavarṇaṃ caturbāhuṃ catuvaktraṃ virājitaṃ ||
kamaṇḍalu varābhīti jñānamudrābhilakṣitaṃ |
haṃsāsanasamārūḍhaṃ dhyāyet koṣe yavāsasaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> oṃ oṃ oṃ brahmaṇe padmahastāya svargādhipataye pādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ bali || 
iti digpālapūjāvidhiḥ ||

<p. 117a> tato dvārapūjā || 

dhyānaṃ ||
nāthaṃ kramagaṇeśaṃ hi dhyāyechvetaṃ caturbhujaṃ |
kapālaśūlaparaśū na dadhānañcākṣa mālikāṃ ||
tāṃbūlā liṅgitakarīṃ dhyāyet parama sundarīṃ |
vallabhākhyāṃ mahādevīṃ dadhānaṃ śaktisaṃyutaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kramagaṇapatinātha śrīpādukāṃ || pūjayāmi ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kramagaṇapatinātha vallabhā ambā pādukāṃ || bali ||
okārapīṭha || 

dhyānaṃ || 
trinetraṃ kumudaprakhyaṃ pāśadaṇḍadharaṃ paraṃ |
śaktikhaḍgadharaṃ tadvanmuktaṭādi vibhuṣitaṃ ||
okārapīṭhasaṃsthoyaṃ nānārūpadharaṃ vabhau |
nānālaṅkārasaṃyuktaṃ nānāvayavaśobhitaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ okārapīṭha śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||

kaṃkālapīṭha || 
dhyānaṃ ||
kaṃkālaṃ himakundābhaṃ trinetraṃ bhaktavatsalaṃ |
khaḍgandaṇḍantathā pāśaṃ śaktiṃ vidhāriṇaṃ bhaje ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kaṅkālapīṭha śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||

paścimadvāra || saṃhāra || dhyānaṃ ||
saṃhārabhairavaṃ dhāyeddhemavarṇañcaturbhujaṃ |
ḍamaruṃ jñānamudrāñca kādyaṃ khaṭvāṅgakaṃ tathā ||
karairdadhānaṃ devañca tadvatsaṃhāriṇīṃ parāṃ |

<p. 117b> varābhayakarāṃ śyāmāṃ paścimadvārasaṃsthitāṃ || 
hrīṁ śrīṁ saṃhāra śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ sakalasaṃhāriṇī aṃbā śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||

vṛkṣasaṃketanātha || 

dhyānaṃ ||
vṛkṣe saṃketanāthoyaṃ śyāmavarṇacaturbhujaḥ ||
khaḍgapheṭadharā dvābhyāṃ dvābhyāṃ kartakapāla dhṛk ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ vṛkṣasaṃketanātha śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||
uttaradvāra || vaṭuka || dhyānaṃ ||
dhyāyad vaṭukanāthaṃ hi kramapūrvaparātparaṃ |
dvibhujaṃ raktavarṇañca kapālaṃ daṇḍadhāriṇaṃ ||
ekenāliṃgitapatiṃ tāmbūlañcāpareṇa ca |
sandadhānāṃ mahādevīṃ vaṭukāṃkaniṣeduṣīṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kramavaṭukanātha śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kramavaṭukanātha vallabhā ambā śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||
sarvasaṃhāriṇī ||

dhyānaṃ ||
sarvasaṃhāriṇīṃ kṛṣṇāṃ dadhatīñca karairbhaje |
khaḍgaṃ sujñānamudrāṃ ca khaṭvāṅgakādyameva ca ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ sarvasaṃhāriṇī ambā śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||
pūrvadvāra || yoginī || dhyānaṃ ||
devī vetālayā nāśaśadharavadanā yoginī kundavarṇā dīrghairdorbhirdadhānā 
sulalita ḍamaruṃ kartṛkāṃ kañja netrā |

<p. 118a> bhavyaṃ khaṭvāṅgapātraṃ kumudavaranustadvadastrāṇi nūnaṃ
dorbhirdevo dadhānā jagati vijayate vīra vetāla yānaḥ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ yāṁ yoginībhyaḥ pādukāṃ || bali ||

yoginī || dhyānaṃ ||
siṃhāsanagatāṃ devīṃ yoginīṃ raktavigrahāṃ |
trinetrāṃ hārabhūṣāḍhyāṃ śuddhamurṇḍāsthi mālinīṃ ||
udvahantīṃ karaiḥ pātraṃ pāśaṃ paraśumaṃkuśaṃ |
maṇimaṃjīra pādābjāṃ cintayedaṣṭavarṣiṇīṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ heṁ heṁ yoginī pādukāṃ || bali ||

kanavīraśmaśāna || dhyānaṃ ||
dhyāyeccaturbhujaṃ devaṃ raktavarṇaṃ suvigrahaṃ |
kapālaṃ śūlakhaṭvāṅgaṃ kheṭakaṃ dadhataṃ vibhuṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ mahākanavīra śmaśānātha śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||

tato vithyāgre gurukramaṃ || dhyānaṃ ||
raktavarṇaṃ dvibhujañca dakṣiṇe jāpyamālikāṃ |
vāmahastebhipātraṃ kecakī paridhāriṇaṃ ||
śireṭupaṃribhūṣañca kṛṣṇājine vinirmitaṃ |
padmāsana sthitaṃ devaṃ dakṣadaṇḍadharaṃ tathā ||
sarvatra pratimarcanti taṃ naumi vīranāthakaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ vīranātha śrīpādukāṃ || <1> ||
haritavarṇa pūrvavat sāraṃ kāraṃ ||

<p. 118b> hrīṁ śrīṁ daśakandanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <2> || 
nīlavarṇa pūrvavat sālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ krodhamuninātha śrīpādukāṃ || <3> ||
raktavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ vaśiṣṭhamuninātha śrīpādukāṃ || <4> ||
harivarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ jayadrathanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <5> ||
ete divyaughāḥ ||
kṛṣṇavarṇa pūrvat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ kaṃkāla ombā ambā pādukāṃ || <6> ||
kuṃkumavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ mātaṅgī ambā śrīpādukāṃ || <7> ||
raktavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ vārāvalī ombinī ambā śrīpādukāṃ || <8> ||
pītavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ tribhuvananandanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <9> ||
raktavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ vijayanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <10> ||
raktavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ vāmadevanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <11> ||
nīlavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ garbhānandanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <12> ||
kṛṣṇavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhadrā gaureśvaranātha śrīpādukāṃ || <13> ||

<p. 119a> kuṃkumavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ pakṣānandanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <14> ||
śveta pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ icchānandanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <15> ||
kuṃkumavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ ajavaktrānandanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <16> ||
raktavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bindanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <17> ||
raktavarṇa pūrvavat bhujālaṃkālaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bodhānandanātha śrīpādukāṃ || <18> ||
iti vīthyāgre gurukramapūjā ||

catuḥkoṇe iśānādi jambhanyādipūjā ||

dhyānaṃ ||
khaḍgabāṇaṃ prakāṇḍaṃ ḍamarukavaradaṃ pātracarmaprasiddhiṃ 
kodaṇḍaṃ maṃju ghaṇṭhaṃ hyaṃbhayasukalitaṃ binduyuktaṃ dadhānāṃ |
bhaktānāṃ siddhidātrīṃ karasarasiruhaiḥ pretagāṃ kṛṣṇavarṇāṃ 
dhyāyedbhūṣābhirāmāṃ tribhuvaṇajananīṃ jambhinīṃ viśvavaṃdyāṃ ||
khphreṁ rmyūṁ jaṃ jambhanī pādukāṃ || bali ||

dhyānaṃ ||
raktāṃ khaḍgasubāṇaṃ cāṃkuśavaraṃ pātrañca carmājvalaṃ 
kodaṇḍaṃ kilapāśa cābhayadharī bindundadhānāṃ bhaje |

<p. 119b> pretasthāṃ kalapallavaiḥ sunayanāṃ cābhīṣṭadāṃ stambhinīṃ 
bhaktānāṃ varapārijāta latikāṃ sphurjatsuroghainnutāṃ ||
khphreṁ mmyūṁ stambhanī pādukāṃ || bali ||

dhyānaṃ ||
khaḍgaṃ cakraṃ ca bāṇaṃ karajalaja ca yairmālikāṃ maṃjupātraṃ 
sphurjatpheṭakakambukārmukalulatpustāni binduṃ bhaje |
sānandaṃ sandadhānāṃ suranivahanutāṃ bhaktaduḥkhaugha hantīṃ
nīlāṃ pretādhirūḍhāṃ tribhuvana viditāṃ mohinīñcāru netrāṃ ||
khphreṁ kṣmyūṁ maṃ mohanī pādukāṃ || bali ||

dhyānaṃ || 
śūbhrāṃ khaḍgagadādharī ca dadhatīṃ vajrañca mālāṃ bhaje
pātraṃ pheṭaka śaṃkhaghaṇṭhasahitānyanyaiḥ karāṃjaiḥ parāṃ |
pustaṃ bindu samanvitaṃ hi sukhadāṃ cākarṣaṇīṃ pretagāṃ 
sānandaparipūjitāṃ suragaṇairbhaktānukaṃrpyāyutāṃ ||
khphreṁ smyūṁ āṁ ākarṣaṇī pādukāṃ || bali ||

tato'ṣṭadale brahmāṇyādyasitāṅgādi pūjā ||
pītavarṇāñcaturbāhuṃ caturvadanaśobhitāṃ |
pustakaṃ japyamālāñca varadābhayadhāriṇīṃ ||
haṃsāsanīṃ mahādevīṃ caturveda parāyaṇāṃ |
pītapuṣparatāṃ devīṃ pītagandhānulepanāṃ ||

<p. 120a> pītavarṇañcaturbāhuṃ triśūlaghaṇṭhadhāritaṃ |
kartṛkāpālahastañca śavasthaṃ muṇḍamālinaṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hsauṁ aṁ āṁ iṁ īṁ uṁ ūṁ ṛṁ ṝṁ ḷṁ ḹṁ eṁ aiṁ oṁ auṁ aṃ aḥ prayāge 
ākhyāyai maṃgalā veśyā brahmāṇī aindrā akṣaḥ aśitāṅgabhairava 
śrīpādukebhyo namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ || 
himakuṇḍendu saṃkāśāṃ triśūlamakṣadhāriṇīṃ |
kamaṇḍaluṃ dānahastāṃ vṛṣāsano namostute ||
raktavarṇa caturbāhuṃ dhvajāṃkuśaṃ ca dhāriṇaṃ |
kapālaṃ biṃduhastaṃ ca pretasthaṃ muṇḍamālinaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> kaṁ khaṁ gaṁ ghaṁ ṅaṁ varuṇā ilāyāṃ carcikā sundinī māheśvarī āgneyī 
ikṣaḥ rurubhairava śrīpādukebhyo namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
ati raktā caturbhujā śakti śūlavidhāriṇī | 
siddhipātra varādevī mayūrasanagāminī ||
kṛṣṇavarṇa mahātejaṃ daṇḍahastaṃ kapālakaṃ |
kartṛmaṇḍadharaṃ devaṃ śavasthaṃ muṇḍamālinaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> caṁ chaṁ jaṁ jhaṁ ñaṁ kolāpure ūhāyī yogāyī kevartī komārī yāmya ūkṣaḥ 
caṇḍabhairava śrīpādukebhyo namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
harirvaṇā mahādevī śaṃkhacakragadādharī |
<p. 120b> nīlotpala padmahastāṃ garuḍāsane namostute ||
dhūmravarṇaṃ caturbāhuṃ pāśāṃkuśavidhāriṇaṃ |
kapālakartṛ hastañca pretayānaṃ sadā bhaje ||
aiṁ <5> ṭaṁ ṭhaṁ ḍaṁ ḍhaṁ ṇaṁ aṭṭahāse ṛśāyī harasiddhāyai khaṭakā vaiṣṇavī    
nai(-)ṛtyaḥ ṛkṣa krodhabhairava śrīpādukebhyo namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
vārāhī ghoraraktāṅgī mīnāṃkuśa vidhāriṇī |
kartṛdaṇḍadharā devī mahiṣe parisaṃsthitā ||
śyāmavarṇaṃ caturbāhuṃ kartṛdaṇḍavidhāriṇaṃ |
kapālaṃ dhvajahastaṃ ca muṇḍā bharaṇabhūṣitaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> taṁ thaṁ daṁ dhaṁ naṁ jayantike ḹśāyī bhaṭṭāyī kaṃdhakī vārāhī 
vāruṇī ḹkṣaḥ unmattabhairava śrīpādukebhyo namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
gorocananibhā devī chatra ghaṇṭha vidhāriṇī |
mahāvajrañca varadaṃ dadhānā dignaja sthitā ||
nīlavarṇañcaturbāhuṃ ghaṇṭhāḍamarudhāriṇaṃ |
kapālabinduhastañca śavasthaṃ muṇḍamālinaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> paṁ phaṁ baṁ bhaṁ maṁ caritre airāyī kīlakīlā rajakī māhendrī vāyavya ekṣaḥ 
kapālīśabhairava śrīpādukebhyo namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
<p. 121a> draṣṭrākalāla raktāṃgī khaḍgapheṭakadhāriṇī |
kapāla kartṛhastā ca pretasthā muṇḍamālinī ||
śvetavarṇaṃ caturbāhuṃ śūlapātraṃ vidhāṇaṃ |
mudgaraṃ dadhataṃ devaṃ nāgahastaṃ susobhitaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> yaṁ raṁ laṁ vaṁ śaṁ ekāmrake ohāyī kālarātrī chipinī cāmuṇḍā kauberī 
aukṣaḥ bhīṣaṇabhairava śrīpādukebhyo namaḥ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
nīlajīmūtasaṃkāśāṃ śaṃkhaṃ cakraṃ gadāṃ varaṃ |
siṃhāsana mahādevī trinetrā candraśeṣarī ||
raktavarṇaṃ raktanetraṃ śūlapātravidhāriṇaṃ |
muṇḍamālaṃ mahādevaṃ pretāsana susaṃsthitaṃ ||
aiṁ <5> ṣaṁ saṁ haṁ kṣaṁḥ devīkoṭa ahlāyī bhīṣaṇī koṣaṭī mahālakṣmī iśānī aṃ 
kṣaḥ saṃhārabhairava śrīpādukebhyo namaḥ || thvatenaṃ bali ||
iti brahmāṇyādipūjā ||

tato dvādaśadale śivādipūjā ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śivādūtī vegavatī māyā bhadrā ca khiṃkhinī ||
viḍālī yama hihvā ca ṛkṣakarṇī ghaṃṭodarī ||
cauramātā ulūkī ca karaṃkinī tu dvādaśa |
etāḥ sarvāvarṇabhirṇāścaturbāhu vibhūṣitā ||
kapālaghaṇṭhakhaṭvāṅganaramuṇḍadharāḥ parāḥ |

<p. 121b> raktaśvetā tathā nīlā haridvarṇā tathā parāṃ ||
kuṃkumābhā supītā ca kundābhā lohita prabhā |
himābhā dhūmrasaṃkāśā dūrvābhā ghusṛna prabhā ||
dhyātavyāḥ pūjana devyāḥ sarvasiddhipradāyikāḥ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śivādevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ vegavatīdevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ māyādevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ bhadrādevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ khiṃkhinīdevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ viḍālīdevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ yamajihvādevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ṛkṣakarṇā ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ghaṃṭodarīdevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ caulamātādevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ulūkīdevī āmbā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ karaṃkinīdevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ kākinīdevī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ bali || iti dvādaśadale pūjā ||

tatastrivaṣṭapūjanaṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||

<p. 122a> karairdadhanāṃ śyāmāṃgīṃ nīlarājīvalocanāṃ |
gadādānaṃ śaṃkhacakre bhajet prathamaveṣṭagāṃ ||
hrīṁ pādukāṃ || bali ||

dhyānaṃ ||
śvetāṃ parāṃ sadāvande devīṃ dvitayaveṣṭagāṃ |
triśūlaṃ varadaṃ pātraṃ cābhītīndadhatīṃ bhaje ||
śrīpādukāṃ || bali ||

dhyānaṃ ||
raktavarṇāṃ kaṃjamukhīṃ devīṃ tṛtīyaveṣṭagāṃ |
padmaṃ sumālāṃ daṇḍañca kamaṇḍalu karāṃbhaje ||
khphreṁ pādukāṃ || bali || iti striveṣṭapūjā ||

tataḥ ṣaṭkoṇavākye ṣaḍaṅgadevatāpūjā ||
āgneyāṃ || dhyānaṃ ||
hṛddevīṃ śvetasarvāṅgī pāśāṃkuśa dharā parāṃ |
kapālaśūlāvabhayaṃ varañcā dadhatī nyaset ||
khphreṁ paramahaṃsini sarvajñatāśakti hṛdayanātha śrīpādukāṃ ||

īśāna || dhyāna ||
śirodevīṃ pītavarṇāṃ pūrvoktāyudhamaṇḍitāṃ |
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktāṃ nyasecchirasi siddhidāṃ ||
khphreṁ nirvāṇamārgade nitya tṛptitāśakti śironātha śrīpādukāṃ ||

nai(-)ṛtye || dhyānaṃ ||
śikhāyāñca śikhādevi raktāṃ pūrvāyudhairvṛtāṃ |
mīnākṣīṃ śarmadāṃ nityaṃ nyased vīrendra vanditāṃ ||

<p. 122b> khphreṁ viṣamopaplavapraśamani anādibodhaśikhānātha śrīpādukāṃ ||

vāyavye || dhyānaṃ ||
haridvarṇāṃ varmadevīṃ pūrvavacchastramaṇḍitāṃ ||
raktavastrā nyaset tanvī vīravṛndaika vanditāṃ ||
khphreṁ sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani svatantratā śakti kavacanātha śrīpādukāṃ 
||

pūrvāgneyo madhye || dhyānaṃ ||
netradevīṃ kṛṣṇavarṇāṃ proktā yudhasamanvitāṃ |
netreṣu vinyasennityāṃ sarvāvayavasundarīṃ ||
khphreṁ sarvāpadāmbhodhitarani aluptatā śakti netranātha śrīpādukāṃ ||

paścimottarāntarāle || dhyānaṃ ||
sphaṭikābhā mastradevīṃmāyudhaiḥ pūrvavaddhṛtāṃ |
aṅge pravinyasennityamabhīṣṭārthapradāyinīṃ ||
khphreṁ sakalaśatrupramathani anantanā śakti astranātha śrīpādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ bali || iti ṣaḍaṅga ||

ṣaṭkoṇe ṣaḍḍākinīpūjā || 

dhyānaṃ ||
kṛṣṇāṃjananibhā devī nīlajīmūtasaṃnibhā |
bhujāṣṭakasamopetā trenetrā ca mahābalā ||
karālavadanā ghorā iṣadraṃṣṭrogra bhīṣaṇā |
kiṭiṭi vajraracitā cāsthi mudrā ca karṇagā ||

<p. 123a> triśūlaṃ kartarīṃ khaḍgaṃ nāgarājaṃ bhayānakaṃ |
dakṣiṇena varārohe dhṛtāyudha balotkaṭā ||
abhayaṃ kheṭakaṃ pāśaṃ śaktivāme virājate |
yauvanasthā madonmattā madirānandaghūrmitā ||
nānālaṃkārasaṃpannā nānābharaṇamaṇḍitā |
viḍālavadanā devi piśitādra priyā sadā ||
viḍālapṛṣṭhamāruḍhā cāsthimālāpalaṃvitā |
ḍākinī ca samutpannā pūrvakoṇe vyavasthitā ||
aiṁ <5> ḍmlvryūṁ ḍākinī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
rākinī raktavarṇā ca rudhirāruṇarepita |
uluka vadanā devī bhujāṣṭakasamanvitā ||
mukuṭena vicitreṇa karṇakuṃḍalamaṇḍitā |
kādyaṃ kambu triśūlañca abhayaṃ vāmamāśritā ||
vajraṃ dandaṃ tathā pāśaṃ gadāṃ dakṣiṇa cottare |
nānābharaṇaśobhāḍhyā nānālaṃkāramaṇḍitā ||
ulūkasthā mahābhīmā rudhirāsavalampadā |
agnikoṇe gatā devī dīpyamānā mahojasā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ rmlvryūṁ rākinī ambā śrīpādukāṃ || 

dhyānaṃ || 
lākinī pītavarṇā ca kiṃcidraktāruṇa prabhā |

<p. 123b> gṛddhavaktrā mahāraudrā divyādivya niṣevitā ||
mukuṭena vicitreṇa divyakuṇḍalamaṇḍitā |
bhujāṣṭaka samāpetā divyā cākāśagāminī ||
kādyaṃ ghaṇṭhā tathā śūlaṃ khetakaṃ vāmato dhṛtā |
kartṛmuṇḍaṃ tathā khaḍgaṃ śaṃkhasūtrañca dakṣiṇe ||
nānālaṃkārasaṃpannā hemaratnavibhūṣitā |
madirānanda cetaskā īṣaghurṇitalocanā ||
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇā piśitā savalampatā |
gṛddhāsanā mahogrā ca dakṣiṇakoṇagā sthitā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ lmlvryūṁ lākinī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
kākinī kākarūpa ca kṛṣṇadhūmra samaprabhā |
kākavarṇā mahābhīmā kākarāvā bhayaṃkarā ||
bhujāṣṭakasamopetā divyakuṇḍalamaṇḍitā |
mukuṭena vicitreṇa nānālatna mayena ca ||
divyaratnaiḥ kṛtā mālā kaṇṭhasthā ca virājate |
yauvanena mahāmattā piśitā savaraṃpaṭā ||
sarvābharaṇaśobhāḍhyā sarvāvayavasaṃyutā |
dhanuḥ śaktistathā vajraṃ abhayaṃ vāmamārgagā ||

<p. 124a> iṣukādya tathā sūtraṃ kambuṃ dakṣiṇataḥ sthita |
tarjayantīṃ mahāghorā kākapṛṣṭha samāsṛtā ||
nai(-)ṛtyakoṇa māsṛtya sarvasiddhiphalapradā ||
aiṁ <5> kmlvryūṁ kākānī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ || 
sākinī dhūmravarṇābhā madyavarṇā mahābalā |
siṃhavaktrā mahānādā jihvādraṣṭrāgra bhīṣaṇā || 
mukuṭena vicitreṇa karṇakuṇḍalamaṇḍitā |
bhujāṣṭaka samopetā nānālaṃkālamaṇḍitā || 
śūlaṃ khaḍgaṃ tathā cakraṃ yaṣṭirdakṣiṇataḥ sthitā |
kādyaṃ kambuntathā sūtraṃ vajraṃ vāmodyatā priya ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃpannā sarvāvayavaśobhitā |
yauvanasthā madonmattāstaddhanetrā mahābalā ||
siṃhoparisamārūḍhā majjāsava priyā sadā |
vāruṇaṃ koṇamāśritya tarjayantī vyavasthitā ||
aiṁ <5> smlvryūṁ sāṁ sākinī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
hākinī kuṇḍavarṇābhā kiṃcitpītābha varcasā |
vyāghravaktrā mahāghorā daṃṣṭrālolāgra bhīṣaṇā ||
jṛmbhamānāgrasantīntāṃ vahulomā suvarcasā |
<p. 124b> bhujāṣṭaka samopetā nānālaṃkāramaṇḍitā ||
dhvajaṃ pāśaṃ tathā śūlaṃ mudgalaṃ dakṣiṇodyatā |
kādyakumbhastathā śaktiṃ phalasaṃ vāmamārgagā ||
vyāghrārūḍhā mahābhāmā yauvanasthā madotkaṭā |
śukrāsava priyā nityaṃ lolupā bahurūpiṇī ||
vāyavyakoṇasaṃsthā sā vighnānyutmādayat sadā ||
aiṁ <5> hmlvryūṁ hāṁ hākinī ambā śrīpādukāṃ ||
iti ṣaḍḍākinī ||

ojāpukāpūjā trikoṇadakṣe ||

dhyānaṃ ||
nīlajīmūtasaṃkāśāṃ jalakallolalālasaṃ |
trinetrā caturbhujā devī varadā śaktipāśinī ||
pāśaṃ kambudharā devī nānāsragdāma maṇḍitā |
sarvalakṣasaṃpūrṇā sarvābharaṇabhūṣitā ||
khphreṁ jālaṃdharapīṭhāya pādukāṃ ||

trikoṇa vāme || dhyānaṃ ||
candrarūpā mahādevī vidyutkoṭi samaprabhā |
caturbhujaikavadanā trinetrā ca śivāparā ||
kuṇḍalai ratnasaṃkāśairmukuṭai ratnabhūṣitaiḥ |
śaktyaṃkuśadharā vāme dakṣiṇe kumbumaṇḍale ||
nānāratnakṛtā mālā kaṃṭhasthā ca virājate |
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇā sarvāvayavasundarā ||

<p. 125a> nānābharaṇasaṃyuktā pīnavṛtta payodharā |
trivalī taraṅgamadhyesthā romarājī vibhūṣitā ||
khphreṁ pūrṇagiripīṭhāya pādukāṃ ||

trikoṇāgre || dhyānaṃ ||
nīlotpaladalaśyāmā bimboṣṭhī cāruhāsinī |
ekavaktrā trinetrā ca dvibhuja kāmarūpiṇī ||
varadābhayahastā ca nānākeyūramaṇḍitā |
mukuṭena vicitre ca karṇaukuṇḍalabhūṣitā ||
ratnamālā sutejāḍhyā kaṇṭhasthā ca virājate |
muktāphalamayī mālā āpyadatalalaṃbitā ||
madhyakṣāmā nitaṃbāḍhyā pīnavṛtta payodharā |
sarvarakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇā īṣataprahasitānanā ||
sarvābharaṇasaṃpannā sarvāvayavasaṃyutā |
sarvasiddhipradāyitvaṃ sarvakāmaphalapradā ||
vāyutatvāsanārūḍhā vāyubheda prakāśakā ||
khphreṁ oḍiyānapīṭhāya pādukāṃ ||

trikoṇā abhyantara || dhyānaṃ ||
himakundendu dhavalā karpūrasadṛśa prabha |
caturbhujā trinetrā ca pāśadaṇḍogra pāṇaya ||

<p. 125b> śakti khaḍgadharaṃ divyaṃ mukuṭādi vibhūṣitā |
nānārūpadharā sarvā nānālaṃkāramaṇḍitā ||
sarvāvayavaśobhāḍhyā sarvalakṣaṇalakṣitā |
oḍanātha samopetā oḍeśī cakranāyikā ||
khphreṁ oḍiyānapīṭhāya pādukāṃ ||

triśaktipūjā trikoṇavāme ||
dhyānaṃ ||
dhyāyet kṣīrāddhimadhyasthāṃ vedikāṃ vajranirmitāṃ ||
tatra siṃhāsanaṃ divyaṃ jvaladvahni samaprabhaṃ ||
tatra śubhāmbujaṃ devi aṣṭapatra sakarṇikaṃ |
māttaṇḍamaṇḍalantatra pañcapretaṃ tatopari ||
viparīta ratā śaktaḥ saharatyāmṛṣadhvajaḥ |
tatpṛṣṭhasthāṃ jagatmātāṃ pratyālīḍha padāmbujāṃ ||
śaṃkha gokṣīra dhavalāṃ raktāṃ tritaya locanāṃ |
vāme svakartitaṃ śīrṣaṃ dakṣiṇe rakta kartikāṃ ||
kuṇḍalāṅgadanaupura valayādi layākṛtāṃ |
sthulamukto vṛto raskāṃ nāgayajñopavitinīṃ ||
hāḍālaṃkārasaṃyuktāṃ vicitrāṃ kṣudraghaṃṭikāṃ |
muṇḍamālāṃ gale devyā vyāghracarma kaṭisthitāṃ ||
candrakhaṇḍakabaṃdhaiśca śobhitāṃ mukuṭojvalāṃ |
svagrīvodbhūta rudhiraṃ pīyamānāṃ vicintayet ||

<p. 126a> dakṣiṇe varṇinīṃ raktāṃ devyāḥ kakṣa viniḥsṛtāṃ |
raktavarṇāṃ sottamāṃgāṃ raktanāgopavītinīṃ ||
sarvālaṃkārasaṃyuktāṃ gajacarmāmbaro vṛtāṃ |
dakṣanāḍya mahādevyāḥ pīyamānāṃ vicintayet |
dvibhujāṃ kartikādyañca trinetrāṃ masthibhūṣaṇāṃ |
devyā vāme ḍākinīñca jagatgrasamaloluḍāṃ ||
karālikulavarṇābhā trinetrāṃ ghoranandinīṃ |
naracarmaparidhānāṃ jihvālalaṇaṃ bhīṣaṇāṃ ||
kavaṃdhanāga hārāṅgī muktakeśīṃ kapālinīṃ |
vāmanāḍīṃ mahādevyāḥ pīyamānāṃ vicintayet ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

śrīṁ hrīṁ hūṁ eṁ vajravairocanīya hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || triśakti ||
agrakoṇe || dhyānaṃ ||
gambhirāñca madonmattāṃ svarṇakāntīṃ samaprabhāṃ |
caturbhujāṃ trinetrāñca kamalāsanasaṃsthitāṃ ||
dakṣiṇe mudgaraṃ pāśaṃ vāme jihvāñca vajrakaṃ |
pītāmbaradharā sārdhaṃ dṛḍhapīnapayodharāṃ ||
hemakuṇḍalabhūṣāḍhyā pītā candrārddha śeṣarāṃ |
pītabhūṣaṇa mālyāñca svarṇasihāsana sthitāṃ ||
evaṃ dhyātvā jagadhātrīṃ śatrustambhanakāriṇī ||

<p. 126b> oṃ hlīṁ vagalāmukhī sarvaduṣṭānāṃ mukhaṃ vācaṃ stambhaya jihvāṃ 
kīlaya <2> buddhi nāśaya hlīṁ oṃ svāhā || brahmāstraṃ ||

dakṣakoṇe || dhyānaṃ ||
hrīṁ taptacāmikarāvarṇāṃ nānāpuṣpopasobhitāṃ |
divyavastraparidhānāṃ mahiṣāsanagāminīṃ || <1> ||
kirīṭi kuṇḍalākāraiḥ keyūrairmaninūpuraiḥ |
ratnamālāvicitraiśca hāramālā varaṃvitaiḥ || <2> ||
aṣṭādaśabhujākrāntāṃ pīna vakṣastano ruhāṃ |
sarvālaṃkārasaṃyuktāṃ taḍitkoṭi samaprabhāṃ || <3> ||
khaḍgaṃ śarantathā cakraṃ vajrāṃkuśadharāṃ śubhāṃ |
varadaṃ ḍamarukaṃ hastaṃ śūlapātra suśobhitāṃ || <4> ||
dakṣiṇe ca kara etā yathāśobhā tathā śubhā |
pheṭakaṃ dhanuhastāñca gadāṃ ghaṃṭhāṃ suśobhitā || <5> ||
pāśaṃ ca tarjanīhastāṃ khaṭvāṅga keśapāśakaṃ |
bindumudrā tathā siṃdhū siṃhāsanoparisthitāṃ || <6> ||
adhasthitvā siraśchinne mahiṣañca mahāsuraṃ |
tagrīvānirgato daityaṃ mahābala parākramaṃ || <7> ||
bhedayitvā triśūlena vidhṛtā sā siroruhā || 

<p. 127a> evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevī sarvakāma phalapradāṃ || <8> ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍe raṇamardinī hūṁ phreṁ sadā rakṣa <2> tvāṃ 
māṃ jū saḥ mṛtyuhare namaḥ svāhā || khaḍgāstraṃ ||

madhyakṣetrapūjā ||
dhyānaṃ ||
kṛṣṇavarṇañcaturbāhuṃ ḍamarukhaṭvāṅgadhāriṇaṃ |
kapālaṃ jñānamudrāñca dhyāyet kṣetrādhipaṃ prabhuṃ ||
<5> thhsrauṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ sakalaśaṃhāravalotkaṭa kṣetrapāla śrīpādukāṃ ||

paṃcavaktra ||
rjjhrīṁ mahācaṇḍa tejasaṃkarṣaṇi kāli manthāne haḥ || varṇa <17> ||
phreṁ āṁ koṁ phiṁ mahāsiddhisamaye khphreṁ bhairavī ghoralakṣmī varaprade svāhā 
|| varṇa <25> ||
āṁ phiṁ phāṁ mahāsṛṣṭi caṇḍalakṣmī siddheśvarī phe phaṭ || varṇa <17> ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ pheṁ phaṭ phaṭ phaṭ svāhā || varṇa || <9> ||
khphreṁ namo bhagavatī siddhilakṣmīśvarī phaṭ svāhā || varṇa <17> ||
thvatenaṃ baliḥ || iti pañcavaktrapūjā ||

tataḥ śastradaśakaṃ pūjayet ||
pūrva || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ varadanātha śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi ||
āgneye || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ abhayanātha śrī (*) dukāṃ ||
yamye || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ kalasanātha śrī (*) dukāṃ ||
nai(-)ṛtya || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ khaṭvāṅganātha śrīpādukāṃ ||

<p. 127b> paścime || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ muṇḍanātha śrīpādukāṃ ||
vāyau || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ triśūlanātha śrī (*) dukāṃ ||
saumye || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ aṃkuśanātha śrīpādukāṃ ||
īśāne || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ khaḍganātha śrīpādukāṃ ||
ūrddha || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ kapālanātha śrīpādukāṃ ||
adhaḥ || hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ pāśanātha śrīpādukāṃ || iti śastradaśakaṃ pūjā ||

aiṁ <5> hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandaśakti bhairavānandavīrādhipataye śkṣmlvryīṁ 
pādukāṃ || <3> || baliḥ || 

aghora || dhyānaṃ ||
pañcavaktraṃ mahātejaṃ tripañcanayanojvalaṃ |
daśabāhuṃ mahābhīmaṃ nānāsragdāma maṇḍitaṃ ||
nānābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ hāranūpuramaṇḍitaṃ |
jaṭājūṭadharaṃ divyaṃ candrārddhakṛtaśekharaṃ ||
gokṣīradhavalaṃ divyaṃ phenābhaṃ śuklavarcasaṃ |
pūrvavaktre dṛśaṃ dhyāyen mahādīptikaraṃ priye ||
dāḍimī kusumākāraṃ bandhukapuṣpasanvitaṃ |
taruṇādityasaṃkāśaṃ vāmavaktraṃ vicintayet ||
pītābhaṃ pītasaṃkāsaṃ kuṃkumābhaṃ sarocanaṃ |
mahādīptikaraṃ divyaṃ paścime daṃtu sundari ||
draṣṭrākarāla raudrañca kiñcidraktāyate kṣaṇaṃ |
nīlotpala nibhaṃ śyāmaṃ nīlāṃjana samaprabhaṃ ||

<p. 128a> maṇisarpa kṛtā ṭopa piṅgakeśaṃ subhīṣaṇaṃ |
aghoramiti vikhyātaṃ dhyātaṃ sarvārthasiddhidaṃ ||
īśānamūrddhavaktrantu sṛṣṭirūpaṃ parāparaṃ |
himakundandusaṃkāśaṃ śuddhasphaṭika nirmalaṃ ||
āpāyantaṃ jagatsarvaṃ candrāṃśunikareṇa tu |
varṣantaṃ sumahoghena dhārā pīyūṣasaṃnibhaṃ ||
īśāne dhyāyamānastu aṇimādi guṇān labhet |
triśūlaṃ kartarī khaḍgaṃ nāgarājākṣasūtrakaṃ ||
dakṣiṇena varārohe virājantyāyudhāni ca |
kapālaṃ ḍamaruṃ śaktiṃ pāśāṃkuśadharaṃ priye ||
vāme taṃ āyudhā divyā dīpyamānā suśobhane |
sarparājaṃ kṛtaṃ skandhe vaḍamālena sundari ||
kaṇṭhe viścika hāraṃ vai karṇo dyotta samaṇḍitau |
mahāpadmāsanāsīnāṃ kaṭimekhalamaṇḍilaṃ ||
kṣudraghaṇṭhika śobhāḍhyaṃ ratnamālā vibhūṣitaṃ |
pādau nūpurasaṃyuktau muktamālā svalaṃkṛtau ||
anantāsanamāsīnaṃ taptahātaka sannibhaṃ |
saptakoṭistu mantrāṇāṃ anantāsanasaṃsthitaṃ ||
tārā hima nibhaṃ divyaṃ śaśāṅkamiva sobhitaṃ |
evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevī svacchandaṃ cakramadhyataḥ ||

<p. 128b> iti dhyānaṃ ||

aiṁ <5> aghore hrāṁ thaghoreṁ hrīṁ ghoraghorantare hrūṁ phe sarvata sarva sarve hraiṁ juṁ 
saḥ hrauṁ rudrarūpe hraḥ pādukāṃ || bali ||

vajra || dhyānaṃ ||
dhyātvā ca paramāṃ devīṃ vajrahastāṃ mahābalāṃ ||
varadābhayasaṃyuktāṃ pāśahastayutāṃ priye ||
raktāmbaradharāṃ devīmudayādityasaṃnibhāṃ |
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpūrṇāṃ sarvābharaṇamaṇḍitāṃ ||
vajrapadmāsanāsīnāṃ varṇahārāvalambinīṃ |
mukuṭena vicitreṇa trinetrāṃ kuṇḍalānvitāṃ ||
udayādityavarṇābhāmīṣatpahasitānanāṃ |
evaṃ dhyātvā mahākubjī devī vajra prasiddhyati ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

aiṁ <5> aiṁ vajrakubjini hsphreṁ trailokyākarṣaṇī hrīṁ kāmāṃga drāvaṇi klīṁ strīṁ 
mahākṣobhakāriṇi aiṁ sauṁ saḥ pādukāṃ || bali ||

vatiśī || dhyānaṃ ||
ṣaḍānanāṃ parāṃ devīṃ nīlajīmūta saṃnibhāṃ |
bhujairdvādaśakopetā nāgābharaṇamaṇḍitāṃ ||
kirīṭīkuṇḍalairyuktāṃ nāgayajñopavītinīṃ |
triśūlaṃ kartarī khaḍgaṃ nāgaṃ śaktiṃ ca darpaṇaṃ ||
dakṣiṇena karairdevyā dīptakālānalaprabhāṃ |

<p. 129a> khaṭvāṅgapāśamabhayaṃ mudrāṃ daṇḍaṃ kamaṇḍaluṃ ||
vāmapārśve varārohe astraṃ kālānalaprabhaṃ |
viśvamadhyagatāṃ devīṃ viśvaṃ vyāpya vyavasthitāṃ ||
jvālāmālākulaṃ dhyātvā dīpyamānāṃ mahojasāṃ |
śṛṃgāṭapuramadhyasthāṃ vaḍavānalamadhyagāṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||

aiṁ <5> namo bhagavati hsphreṁ kubjikāyai hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ ghore aghore aghorāmukhi 
chāṁ chīṁ kiṇi <2> vicce pādukāṃ || bali ||
aiṁ <5> namo bhagavati hsphreṁ kubjikāyai śrāṁ śrīṁ śrūṁ ṅa ña ṇa name 
aghorāmukhī chāṁ chīṁ kiṇi <2> vicce pādukāṃ || bali ||
aiṁ <5> bhagavati siddhe hsphrāṁ hsphrīṁ hsphrūṁ kubjike śrāṁ śrīṁ śrūṁ khage ai 
ghore aghore aghorāmukhi kini <2> vicce pādukāṃ || bali ||

triyāṃjali <3> ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ pādukāṃ || bali || 
mūlaṣaḍaṅgaṇapūjā || khphreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || khphreṁ śirase svāhā ||
khphreṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ || khphreṁ kavacāya hūṃ || khphreṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ astrāya phaṭ || gāyatrī || khphreṁ siddhilakṣmī vidmahe navatyadhīka 
dhimahi tanno lakṣmīḥ pracodayāt ||

<p. 129b> bali || āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||
yonimudrāṃ pradarśayet || tarpaṇaṃ ||
namaḥ śrīnāthāya namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya namaḥ śrīkujeśanāthāya namo 
namaḥ ||

tato balyārcanaṃ ||
candanākṣata siṃdūrādinā pratibaliṃ pūjayitvā 
pātrasthā viśeṣārghodake nāmikāṃguṣṭhayā ||
khphreṁ mahārudrāsanāya namaḥ || 
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hraiṁ hrauṁ hraḥ mahābhairavāsanāya namaḥ ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hrāṁ mahārudrāsanāya mama sarvavighnānnāśaya <2> mama 
sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ yathāśakti baliṃ 
gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

tato siddheśvarayā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ mahāpretāsanāya mama sarvavighnānnāśaya <2> mama 
sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ yathāśakti baliṃ 
gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
navākṣaraṇa tridhāsaṃpūjyaḥ ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ||
oṃ siddhilakṣmī vidmahe navatyadhīka mahi tanno lakṣmīḥ pracodayāt ||
tena daśadhāsaṃpūjya || āvaraṇānāṃ bali pradānaṃ ||

<p. 130a> kramagaṇapatināthādi pūjā krameṇa bali pradānaṃ ||
pātrastha dravyena || vāmāṃguṣṭhamadhyayogena ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ vmlvryūṁ kulaputravaṭukanātha mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> 
sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> imāṃ sarvopacāra baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ <2> phaṭ svāhā 
||
anāmikāṃguṣṭhayogeṇa ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ gmlvryūṁ kramagaṇapatinātha svavallabhā sahita sarvajanaṃmeva 
samānaya <2> sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> sarvopacāraiḥ saha baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kṣmlvryūṁ hūṁ svasthānakṣetrapāla mahābhairava mama 
sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> sarvopacāra baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ kṛtāntāsana mahābalotkaṭa kṣetrapālāya vallabhā sahitāya 
imāṃ sarvopacāra sahita baliṃ gṛhna <2> mama sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> siddhi 
dehi rakṣa <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

anāmikāṃguṣṭhayogena ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ smlvryūṁ saḥ sarvebhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hskhphrīṁ śrīsiddhicāmuṇḍī baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> aṁ kaṁ caṁ ṭaṁ taṁ paṁ yaṁ saṁ hetukādi aṣṭakṣetrapālāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||

<p. 130b> aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ aṁ āṁ iṁ īṁ uṁ ūṁ ṛṁ ṝṁ ḷṁ ḹṁ eṁ aiṁ oṁ auṁ aṃ aḥ amlvryūṁ 
prayāgakṣetra asitāṅgabhairava āṃ ā kṣā ī kāmarūpapīṭha sarvamaṅgalā 
veśyāyai brahmāṇī devī mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> sakalamanorathān 
sādhaya <2> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kaṁ khaṁ gaṁ ghaṁ ṅaṁ kmlvryūṁ vārāṇasyā ī rurubhairava i lā ī 
vasakī sauṇḍinī māheśvarī devī mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> 
sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ 
phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ caṁ chaṁ jaṁ jhaṁ ñaṁ cmlvryūṁ kolāpurakṣetra caṇḍabhairava ūhāyaike 
vartinī yogapīṭha kaumārī devī mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> sakalamanorathān 
sādhaya <2> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ ṭaṁ ṭhaṁ ḍaṁ ḍhaṁ ṇaṁ ṭmlvryūṁ aṭṭahāsakṣetra ṛṃ ṛkṣa 
krodhabhairava ṛ sā ī ha ra siddhāyai khaṭṭakai vaiṣṇavī devī mama sarvavighān 
nāśaya <2> sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> 

<p. 131a> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ taṁ thaṁ daṁ dhaṁ naṁ tmlvryūṁ urjanīkṣatre ḷ unmattabhairava ḹ ṣā ī 
ihāyī bhaṭṭakī kaṃdakī vārāhī devī mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> 
sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ 
phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ paṁ phaṁ baṁ bhaṁ maṁ pmlvryūṁ caritrakṣetre ekapādabhairava aiṁ śā ī 
indrāṇī jālaṃdhara kilaki rajakī indrāṇī devī mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> 
sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ 
phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ yaṁ raṁ laṁ vaṁ ymlvryūṁ ekāmrake o bhīṣaṇabhairava oḍiyāna 
kālarātrichippiṇi cāmuṇḍā devī mama sarvavighnān <2> nāśaya <2> 
sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ 
phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ śaṁ ṣaṁ saṁ haṁ kṣaṁ śmlvryaṁ devīkoṭa aṃ saṃhārabhairava aḥ 
ākhyāyai bhīṣaṇī mātaṅgī mahālakṣmī devī mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> 

<p. 131b> sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> imāṃ alipalala odanapūjāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> 
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ dhāṁ dhāmāmbāyai mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> sakalamanorathān 
sādhaya <2> baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ dhāṃ dhāmavatī mama sarvavighnānnāśaya <2> sakalamanorathān 
sādhaya <2> baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ dhāṃ dhāmnā mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> sakalamanorathān 
sādhaya <2> baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ vāṁ vedhyānamaṇḍalā mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> 
sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ rāṁ raviprabhā mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> sakalamanorathān 
sādhaya <2> baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ vaṁ virājantī mama sarvavighnān nāśaya <2> sakalamanorathān 
sādhaya <2> baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ ḍmlvryūṁ ḍākinyai baliṃ gṛhna <2> sarvavighnāṃ nāśaya <2> 
manorathān sādhaya <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ rmlvryūṁ rākinyai baliṃ gṛhna <2> sarvavighnāṃ nāśaya <2> 
manorathān sādhaya <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

<p. 132a> aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ lmlvryūṁ lākinyai baliṃ gṛhna <2> sarvavighnāṃ nāśaya <2> 
manorathān sādhaya <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ kmlvryūṁ kākinyai baliṃ gṛhna <2> <2> sarvavighnāṃ nāśaya <2> 
manorathān sādhaya <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ smlvryūṁ sākinyai baliṃ gṛhna <2> sarvavighnāṃ nāśaya <2> 
manorathān sādhaya <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || 
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hmlvryūṁ hākinyai baliṃ gṛhna <2> sarvavighnāṃ nāśaya <2> 
manorathān sādhaya <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śivādevī ambā baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ bhadrādevī ambā baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || 
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ khiṃkhinīdevī ambā baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ viḍālīdevī ambā baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ yamajihvādevī ambā baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ṛkṣakarṇīdevī ambā baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ghaṭodarīdevī ambā baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ulūkīdevī ambā baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ karaṃkiṇīdevī ambā baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

<p. 132b> aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ mahākamalacaṇḍinī raudramukhī hrāṁ hrīṁ hroṁ kāṃ 
śrīkākamukhī śrīdevī imāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ cāṁ caṇḍamukhī śrīdevī imāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ ṭūṁ ṭākālī śrīdevī imāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā 
||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ tṛṁ śrītāpiṇī śrīdevī imāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ pṛṁ śrīpāvakī śrīdevī imāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ yaiḥ yamaghaṇṭhā śrīdevī imāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ sau śivādūtī śrīdevī imāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ kṣaḥ śrījayaṃkarīdevī baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ krodhinīdevī baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || 
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ sakarṣaṇīdevī baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ lelihānādevī baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ khecalīdevī baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

<p. 133a> aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ bhairavīdevī baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ sarvabuddhiprade varṇinīye sarvasiddhiprade ḍākinīye vajravairocanīye 
baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

oṃ hrīṁ bagalāmukhī sarvaduṣṭānāṃ mukhaṃ vācaṃ staṃbhaya <2> baliṃ gṛhna 
<2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ rājaprade hsphreṁ ugracaṇḍe mama śatru nāśaya <2> baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śaṃkhinīdevī baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ śivādūtidevī baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ sarvajñatādi hṛdayaśaktibhyaḥ ṣaḍaṅgebhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> 
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ varadanātha abhayanātha kalasanātha khaṭvāṅganātha 
maṇḍanātha triśūlanātha aṃkuśanātha kapāranātha pāśanāthebhyo svāhā 
daśakebhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ paṃcatatvātmaka pretāya hūṁ <3> phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hsauṁ hrāṁ hmkṣmlvryūṁ ānaṃdabhairavarūpāya 
sidheśvarāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
rjjhrīṁ mahācaṇḍa tejasaṃkarṣaṇī kālī manthāneha baliṃ gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ 
svāhā ||

<p. 133b> aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hsauṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hraiṁ 
hrauṁ haḥ mahārudrāsanāya mama vighnāṃ nāśaya <2> sakalamanorathān 
sādhaya <2> imāṃ baliṃ gṛhna <2> siddhiṃ dehi hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> etebhyo guptatarayoginībhyaḥ prakaṭatalebhyaḥ sarvaśmaśānavāśinebhyaḥ 
sarvamudrebhyaḥ savāhanebhyaḥ saparivārebhyo nūnāti ṛktebhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> 
mama sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> kṣamasva kṣamasva kṣāṁ hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||

baliviya mantrathaṇḍilijavalālithupāṭabalisa hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ devīputra 
vaṭukanātha kapilajaṭābhārabhāsura trinetrajvālāmukha sarvavighnān nāsaya <2> 
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
vaṭukanātha vallabhāmbāsahitāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
iti vaṭuka bali ||

thaṇḍiliyā khavalālithupaṭabalisa ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ thhsrauṁ kṣuṁ ihaiva sthānādhipataye svavallabhāmbā sahitāya 
svāhā || iti kṣetrabali ||

thaṇḍiliyākhavalāhṅathupāṭabalisa ||

<p. 134a> oṃ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ oṃ gaṁ gaṇapataye svavallabhāmbā sahitāya baliṃ 
gṛhna <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || iti gaṇapati bali ||

thaṇḍiliyājavalāhṅathupāṭabalisa ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ sarvayognibhyaḥ sarvapīṭhebhyaḥ sarvakṣetrapālebhya hūṁ hūṁ 
phaṭ svāhā || iti yoginībali ||

thaṇḍilihṅavanedathupāṭabalisa || samayavidyā ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ candrayogeśvarī candrapīṭhavyomakālī mātaṅgī bhīmakāli 
kāmarūpinī siddhikālī pūrṇagiri candrakālī jālaṃdhari caṇḍakālī oḍiyāna 
raktakālī sarvasamayalābhaṃ kuru <2> susiddha suprasara <2> he saḥ kha <3> hi li hrīṁ 
hrūṁ vāhi <2> kāhi <2> khāhi <2> khe hūṁ lāṁ khāṁ lāṁ khāṁ chāṁ hūṁ hāṁ vāṁ hrīṁ 
śrīṁ hūṁ sauṁ hreṁ haṁ hūṁ hūṁ hreṁ ||

[iti śrīsiddhilakṣmīsamayavidyā samāptaṃ] ||

khphreṁ śivā bhagavati caiva māyābhadrā tathaiva ca |
kiṃkinī vimalā caiva yamajihvā tvakarṣaṇī ||
ghaṃṭodarī cauramātā kiṅkinī kākinī tathā |
sarvavighnivināśāya sarvaśatrunivāraṇaṃ ||
siddhilakṣmī ca me nityaṃ sarvāsā paripūritaṃ |

<p. 134b> trayodaśa melāpaka śrīsiddhilakṣmībhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||

mālāmantranaṃ baliviya ||
oṃ namaḥ sarvasiddhi yoginībhyo namaḥ sarvasiddhi mātṛbhyo namo nityoditānanda 
nanditāyai sakalakulacakranāyikāyai bhagavatyai caṇḍakāpālinyai tadyathā oṃ 
hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ oṃ paramahaṃsini nirvāṇamārgade devī 
viṣamopaplavapraśamani sakaladuritāriṣṭa kleśadalani sarvāpadāmbhodhitarani 
sakalaśatrupramathani devi āgaccha <2> hasa <2> valga <2> nararudhirāntravasābhakṣaṇi 
mama svaśatrun marda marda khāhi <2> triśūlena bhindi <2> chindi <2> khaḍgena tāḍaya 
<2> chedaya <2> tāvadyāvan mama sakalamanorathān sādhaya <2> paramakāruṇike 
bhagavati mahābhairavarūpadhāriṇī tridaśavaranamite sakalamantramātaḥ 
praṇatajanavatsale devī mahākāli kālanāśani hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ praśīda 
madanātulāṃ kurāṃ kuru <2> surāsurakanyakāṃ hrīṁ śrīṁ hūṁ phaṭ phaṭ phaṭ 
svāhā ||

<p. 135a> āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||
padmaliṅgaśakti nārā ca mahāṃkuśa yoni ṣaṭmudrāṃ pradarśayet ||
tarpaṇaṃ ||
namaḥ śrīnāthāya namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya namaḥ śrīkujeśanāthāya namo 
namaḥ || 

[iti śrīśrīśrīsiddhilakṣmīdeguli samāptaḥ] ||

atha śrīśrīśrīguhyakālideguliyāya ||
pūjanathaṇḍilisa || bali thaṇḍiliyājavalāhṅathupāṭabalisa || 
tritatvenācamya ||
phreṁ ātmatatvāya svāhā || phreṁ vidyātatvāya svāhā || phreṁ śivatatvāya 
svāhā ||
nyāsa || svāhā astrāya phaṭ || <4> || 
karaśodhanaṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ kaniṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || siddhikarālī anāmikābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ madhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ || strīṁ phreṁ tarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ ||
namaḥ aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || svāhā astrāya karatalapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ 
|| karanyāsaḥ ||
oṃ phreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || siddhikarālī śirase svāhā ||
hrāṁ chrīṁ hūṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || strīṁ phreṁ kavacā huṃ ||
namaḥ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || svāhā astrāya phaṭ || 
ityaṅganyāsaḥ ||

arghapātrapūjā ||
arghapātrāsanāya pādukāṃ ||

<p. 135b> oṃ phreṁ siddhikarālī hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ strīṁ phreṁ namaḥ svāhā || <3> ||
ṣaḍaṃga ||
oṃ phreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || siddhikarālī śirase svāhā ||
hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || strīṁ phreṁ kavacāya huṃ ||
namaḥ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || svāhā astrāya phaṭ ||
oṃ phreṁ hskṣmlvryūṁ siddhikarālīśvarāye namaḥ ||
āvāhya ākarṣaṇī mudrayā avaguṃṭhanaṃ ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || dhenu yonimudrāṃ darśaye ||
gāyatrī || oṃ phreṁ mahāmantrāya vidmahe kārasaṃkarṣaṇī dhīmahi tannaḥ śakti 
pracodayāt ||

ātmapūjā ||
oṃ phreṁ candanaṃ pādukāṃ || oṃ phreṁ akṣata pādukāṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ siṃdūra pādukāṃ || oṃ phreṁ mohanī pādukāṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ puṣpa pādukāṃ || 
bindutriya <3> || khphreṁ oṃ phreṁ pūrṇacaṇḍamayai namaḥ ||

āsanaṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ saptamuṇḍāsanāya namaḥ || 
oṃ phreṁ phreṁ phreṁ mahāśivāsanāya namaḥ ||
dhyānaṃ ||
atiguhyā mahākālī daśavaktrā trilocanā |
kṛṣṇavarṇā mahātejā aṣṭabāhustanūdari ||
nānāvarṇamukhī devī sūryabhāvātmikān smaret |

<p. 136a> vyāghracarmaparīdhānā hāḍābharaṇabhūṣitā ||
triśūlāṃkuśavajraṃ ca mudgarāyudha dakṣiṇaṃ |
khaṭvāṅa pāśa pātrañca mṛtavāra śirastathā ||
vicarantī kramarājaṃ sahasraravi sannibhaṃ |
aṣṭānti kasya madhyārthamekasiddhipravartinī ||
citkālī kulamadhyasthā jyotirūpe nikevare |
nirvāṇaṃ paramaṃ vidyā bhāvātītā manaupamā ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

triyāñjali || 
oṃ phreṁ siddhikarālī hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ strīṁ phreṁ namaḥ svāhā pādukāṃ || bali ||

atha bhogavidyā ||
oṃ namo mahāmāye hūṁ phreṁ trailokyatrāte chrīṁ chrīṁ siddhi <2> hrīṁ <2> dhāraya <2> 
putra dhanadhānya ratnasuvarṇa hiranyadārā kutumba mahānidhi ṛddhi dadīca 
mahāgaurī smṛtī mahāmedhāyaśostrarājya saubhājña sarvadīpa 
samastakarmakarī siddhicāmuṇḍe pūraya <2> hrīṁ sarvamanorathāṃ 
sarvasampadāṃ varṣa <2> varṣāpaya <2> pātaya <2> mahānidhi dada <2> aṣṭauśvaryan 
dada <2> putradhana āyu saubhāgyaṃ nidhānyaṃ dhānyaṃ hiranyaṃ dada <2> satata 
evaṃ 

<p. 136b> sarvāsiddhiṃ kuru <2> dhana <2> hrīṁ <2> strīṁ <2> phreṁ ratnamaya varṣa <2> sarvān 
yakṣān ādeśaya <2> ājñāpaya <2> śriyaṃ rājyaṃ dada <2> avighnaṃ kuru <2> namo 
mahāya yakṣarājya hrīṁ <3> chrīṁ <3> strīṁ <3> mahādhana dada mama sarvadhanaṃ 
prayacha <2> siddhigaurī hūṁ <2> namaḥ svāhā || iti bhogavidyā ||

gāyatrī ||
phreṁ kāpālinyai vidmahe siddhikarālī dhīmahi tanno guhyā pracodayāt || bali ||
oṃ phreṁ siddhi hsphreṁ hskhphreṁ khphreṁ karālī khphreṁ hskhphreṁ hsphreṁ phreṁ oṃ 
svāhā || <3> || bali || ṣaḍaṅga ||
oṃ phreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || siddhikarālī śirase svāhā ||
hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || strīṁ phreṁ kavacāya huṃ ||
namaḥ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || svāhā astrāya phaṭ ||

parivālapūjā || śoṇitārṇave ||
oṃ hūṁ kṣīṁ klīṁ phreṁ phreṁ phreṁ śoṇitārṇava pādukāṃ || bali ||
oṃ phreṁ indrādi daśalokapāla pādukāṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ kṣetravatuka yoginī gaṇapatinātha pādukāṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ śrīkaṇṭhanāthādyaṣṭa kalāmbādyaṣṭa guruṃ paṃkti śrīpādukāṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ jayāvahādyaṣṭa śmaśāna pādukāṃ ||

<p. 137a> oṃ phreṁ oghādi ṣoḍaśakālī pādukāṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ sṛṣṭyādi dvādaśakāli pādukāṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ brahmavatyādyaṣṭakālī pādukāṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ asitāṅgādyaṣṭabhairava pādukāṃ ||
oṃ phreṁ raktādi navakāli pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī sṛṣṭikālikāmbā pādukāṃ ||
hskhphreṁ mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī sthitikālikāmbā pādukāṃ ||
śkhphreṁ mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī saṃhārakālikāmbā pādukāṃ ||
hrīṁ mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī sthitikālikāmbā pādukāṃ ||
khphreṁ mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī bhāsākālikāmbā pādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ bali ||

āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yoni guhyamudrāṃ darśayet ||
bindutrayaṃ <3> || namaḥ śrīnāthāya namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya namaḥ 
śrīkujeśanāthāya namo namaḥ || [iti śrīguhyakālideguli samāptaḥ] ||

atha tripurasundarīdeguliyāya ||
thaṇḍilisapūjana || thaṇḍilihṅavanakhavalāpāṭabalisaḥ ||
 tritatvena ācamanaṃ ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ ātmatatvāya svāhā || 
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ vidyātatvāya svāhā ||

<p. 137b> aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ śivatatvāya svāhā ||
nyāsaḥ || sauṁḥ astrāya phaṭ || <4> ||
karaśodhanaṃ ||
aiṁ aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || klīṁ tarjanībhyāṃ namaḥ ||
sauṁḥ madhyamābhyāṃ namaḥ || aiṁ anāmikābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
klīṁ kaniṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || sauṁ karatalapṛṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ ||
iti karaṃ nyāsa ||

aiṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || klīṁ śirase svāhā || sauṁḥ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ ||
aiṁ kavacāya hūṁ || klīṁ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || sauṁḥ astrāya phaṭ ||
iti aṅganyāsa ||

arghapātrapūjā ||
arghapātrāsanāya namaḥ || aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ pādukāṃ || <3> ||
ṣaḍaṅga || aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ śirase svāhā ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ śikhāyai vaṣaṭ || aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ kavacāya hūṃ ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ netratrayāya vauṣaṭ || aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ astrāya phaṭ ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||
ātmapūjā ||
aiṁ candanaṃ pādukāṃ || klīṁ akṣataṃ pādukāṃ || sauṁ sindūraṃ pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ mohanī pādukāṃ || klīṁ sauṁ ātmapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || bindunahāya ||

<p. 138a> aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ pādukāṃ || <3> ||

tato devyāsanapūjā ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ raktapadmāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ pañcapretāsanaya pādukāṃ ||
dhyānaṃ ||
bālārka maṇḍalābhāsāṃ caturbāhu trilocanāṃ |
pāśāṃkuśaśarāṃścāpaṃ dhārayantīmbhajāmyahaṃ ||
iti dhyānaṃ ||
triyāṃjali ||
