nirvāṇachāya || tvākamahābali ||
aiṁ <5> kṣāṁ kṣīṁ kṣūṁ kṣaḥ kṣetrapālāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> śrīṁ hrīṁ kulaputravaṭukanāthāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaḥ glauṁ kulagaṇeśvarāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> hūṁ mahākanavīraśmaśānādhipataye baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> hskhphrīṁ śrīsiddhicāmuṇḍeśvarī baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ ākāśacāriṇī savargebhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ sarvebhyo bhūtebhyo piśācebhyaḥ iṣṭadevatābhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||
tarpaṇaṃ ||
namaḥ śrīnāthāya || namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya || namaḥ śrīkujeśanāthāya 
