<p. 144b> [iti ugracaṇḍa ugracaṇḍīdeguli samāpta] ||

thaṇḍilihṅavanekhavalāpāṭa tripurasundarīyā balisa ||
ṅā sukalākāyāvabaliviya ||
aiṁ <5> brahman brahmāṇḍakhaṇḍaṃ piva rudhira sadā siṃdhu siṃdhu pravaddhā
nānuṣṇokṛṣṇa rakṣa paśupiśita patat parvato purajāge |
vajre nidrāntakārā kurukanagiritā tāṇḍavo tiṣṭha śaṃbho 
devīcakraṃ cikīrṣuḥ svayamiti vatavovanditājñā punātu ||
aiṁ <5> ūrddhaṃ brahmāṇḍato vā divi gagaṇatale bhūtale niṣkale vā
pātāle vānale vā śalilapavanayoryatra kutra sthito vā |
kṣetro pīṭhopapīṭhādiṣu ca kṛtapadā puṣpadhūpādi kena 
prītādevyaḥ sa dānaḥ śubha balividhinā pāṃtu vīrendravaṃdyāḥ ||
sāddhyasiddhāśca sarve alipiśita 

<p. 145a> baliṃ pūjāṃ gṛhna <2> mama śāntikāmaṃ kuru <2> hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || 
śānti baliḥ ||

triyāñjali <3> ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ raktapadmāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ klhlhmkhlklyvdlhrīṁ brahmacakre mahodyānapīṭhe 
śrīcaryānāthātmake turyādaśādhiṣṭhāyake jāgrasvapna suṣupti 
turyātītecchājñānakriyā śāntātīta paraṃbrahmasvarūpa 
śrīmahātripurasundarīdevī pādukāṃ || 
ṣaḍaṅgaḥ ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ hṛdayāya namaḥ || aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ śirase svāhā ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ || aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ kavacāya hūṁ ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ astrāya phaṭ || bali ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||
nirvāṇachāya ||

<p. 145b> tvākamahābaliḥ ||
aiṁ <5> kṣāṁ kṣīṁ kṣūṁ kṣaḥ kṣetrapālāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> śrīṁ hrīṁ kulaputravaṭukanāthāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaḥ glauṁ śrīkulagaṇeśvarāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> hūṁ mahākanavīraśmaśānādhipataye baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> hskhphrīṁ śrīsiddhicāmuṇḍeśvarī baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ ākāśacāriṇī savargebhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ sarvebhyo bhūtebhyo piśācebhyaḥ iṣṭadevatābhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||

tarpaṇaṃ ||
namaḥ śrīnāthāya || namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya || namaḥ śrīkujeśanāthāya 
namo namaḥ ||
[iti tripurasundarīdeguli samāpta] ||

thaṇḍilihṅavanejavalāpāṭaguhyakālikāyā balisa ||
ṅā sukalākāyāva baliviya ||
oṃ namo mahāmāye hūṁ phreṁ trailokyatrāte

<p. 146a> chrīṁ chrīṁ siddhi <2> hrīṁ <2> dhāraya <2> putradhanadhānya ratnasuvarṇa 
hiraṇyadārā kutumbamahānidhi ṛddhi dadīca mahāgaurī smṛtī 
mahāmedhāyaśostrarājya saubhājña sarvadīpe samastakarmakarī 
siddhicāmuṇḍe pūraya <2> hrīṁ sarvamanorathān sarvasampadāṃ varṣa <2> 
varṣāpadya <2> pātaya <2> mahānidhi dada <2> aṣṭauśvaryan dada putradhana 
āyusaubhāgyaṃ nidhānyaṃ dhānyaṃ hiraṇyaṃ dada <2> satata evaṃ 
sarvasiddhiṃ kuru <2> dhara <2> hrīṁ <2> strīṁ phreṁ ratnamaya varṣa <2> sarvān yakṣān 
ādeśaya <2> ājñāpaya <2> śriyaṃ rājyaṃ dada <2> avighnaṃ kuru <2> namo 
mahāmāye yakṣarājyaṃ hrīṁ hrīṁ hrīṁ chrīṁ chrīṁ chrīṁ strīṁ strīṁ strīṁ 
mahādhanaṃ dada mama sarvadhanaṃ prayaccha <2> siddhigaurī hūṁ <2> namaḥ 
svāhā || bhogavidyā ||

triyāñjali || <3> ||
oṃ phreṁ śivāsanāya pādukāṃ || oṃ phreṁ siddhikarālī hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ strīṁ phreṁ 
namaḥ svāhā pādukāṃ ||
ṣaḍaṅgaḥ ||
oṃ phreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || siddhikarālī śirase svāhā ||

<p. 146b> hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ || strīṁ phreṁ kavacāya hūṁ ||
namaḥ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || svāhā astrāya phaṭ || bali || 
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yoni guhyamudrāṃ darśayet ||
nirvāṇachāya ||
tvākamahābali ||
aiṁ <5> kṣāṁ kṣīṁ kṣūṁ kṣaḥ kṣetrapālāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> śrīṁ hrīṁ kulaputravaṭukanāthāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaḥ glauṁ śrīkulagaṇeśvarāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> hūṁ mahākanavīraśmaśānādhipataye baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> hskhphrīṁ śrīsiddhicāmuṇḍeśvarī baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ ākāśacāriṇī savargebhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ sarvebhyo bhūtebhyo piśācebhyaḥ iṣṭadevatābhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yoniguhyamudrāṃ pradarśayet ||

tarpaṇaṃ ||
namaḥ śrīnāthāya || namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya || namaḥ śrīkujeśanāthāya 
namo namaḥ ||

<p. 147a> [iti guhyakālideguli samāptaṃ] ||

thaṇḍilihṅavanedathupāṭamūlabalisa ||
ṅā sukalākāyāva baliviya ||
aiṁ <5> ajaraścāpakumbhaśca iḍācārastathaiva ca |
indramūrtiśca ulkāsya uṣmāṇḍa ṛpusūdanaḥ ||
ṛmukta ḷptakāyaśca ḹ lāpā daivadraṃṣṭakaḥ |
airāvataśca oghāmba auṣadhīśastathāpare ||
antako arthabāhuśca kamaraśca kharānanaḥ |
gomukhaścaiva ghaṇṭhālo ṅa ṇa naścaṇḍadhārakaḥ ||
chaṭātopo jaṭālākhyo jhaṃkāraśca bhaṭeśvaraḥ |
ṭaṃkapāṇistathā cānyeṣṭhāṇubandhaśca ḍāmaraḥ ||
dṛḍhakarṇorṇatīkāntastaḍidbhāstha virastathā |
dantulodhanadaścaiva nāgakarṇaḥ pracaṇḍavān ||
phetkāro vīrasiṃhaśca bhṛkuṭī megha bhāsuraḥ |
yugānto rauravaścaiva lambauṣṭho vatsarastathā ||
śukatuṇḍaḥ ṣaḍālāsyaḥ sunāso huhukastathā |
kṣayantakastu pañcāśat kṣetrapālā udāhṛtāḥ ||
pañcāśadvastumuddhāre sthānasthā kṣetrapālakāḥ |

<p. 147b> śeṣāvarṇavihīnāntu kṣetrapālaścaturdaśa ||
ekaliṅge ca hūṃkāraṃ śmaśāne ca bhayāvahaṃ |
mahālakṣmī vane ghore jvālāmukho vaset sadā ||
ekavṛkṣa vaṭe vātha viḍālavadano vaset |
ghaṇṭhārāvo guhāvāse padmakhaṇḍe jalāmbaraḥ ||
saṅgame bhūridhāraughaḥ parvato merutastathā |
nirjhara śravaṇi pravāho nidhāne maṇibhadrakaḥ ||
rasakṣetre dhanādhyakṣo yajñavāṭeṣu kroṣṭukaḥ |
araṇye śavalaṃ vidyādudyāne madhukaraḥ smṛtaḥ ||
catuḥṣaṣṭhi mahāvīryāḥ pālayitvā sthitā jagat |
tatra kṣetra sadākālaṃ balipūjāṃ nivedayet ||
catvārastatra bhūpālā dvijādyā gṛhnate baliṃ |
bhūkhagataru pakṣi ca svācāli bali kāṃkṣiṇaḥ ||
nityādhikāra catvāraḥ kravyādā itare janāḥ |
varvarāḥ piṅgakeśāśca piṅgabhrūpiṅgalocanāḥ ||
daṃṣṭrākarāla atyugrāḥ kapālā bharaṇojvalāḥ |
kāsmīracandra śrīkhaṇḍairmṛgāli mīna phalguṣaiḥ ||

<p. 148a> puṣpairvastraistathā chatrairdīpairdhūpaiśca guggulaiḥ |
bhāvitātmabhirādyaiśca kramapūjā parāyaṇaiḥ ||
ghaṇṭāvādyaiśca gītādyaistarpitā kāmadā sadā ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ amukāya avatara <2> kṣetrapāla kapilajaṭābhāra bhāsura trinetra 
jvālāmukha gandhapuṣpaṃ balipūjāṃ gṛhna <2> bhairavarūpeṇa turu <2> muru <2> kha 
<2> la <2> phreṁ phreṁ phaṭ mahāḍāmarādhipataye svāhā ||
mantreṇānena sarveṣāṃ vidhivadvalidānataḥ |
na durbhikṣaṃ bhavet tatra nopasargādikaṃ bhayaṃ ||
nityaṃ pramudito rājā sarveṣāṃ vallabho bhavet |
ipsitān labhate kāmān saṃgrāme ca sadā jayaḥ ||
iti ajarādikṣetrabaliḥ ||

aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hsauṁḥ oṃ kavarṇekaṃ kāmarūpaṃ puravipulagatā 
jārapīṭhaṃ jayantyā ṣaṭkoṇe madhyapīṭhaṃ tripathagatiyutā devī 
śṛṅgāṭakārā |
ācāryaiḥ siddhisaṃghai tadanukulagatā ṣaṣṭhayoginyavṛndai 
ryuktohaṃ pañcakādye ḍaralaka sahajā devadevīṃ namāmi ||

<p. 148b> yā bhūdivyāntarikṣe daśadiśibhuvane saptapātālamūle
kṣetre pīṭhopapīṭhe viṣama catupaṭhe melake vā śmaśāne |
siṃdhyaitīraikavṛkṣa udadhi śubhataṭe dhūmrakārāvatāre 
kolaryāṃ pūrṇagiryāmatha ca purabale oḍḍiyāne pradhāne ||
jālākhye yogamukhye kulapatinagare kāmarūpe svarūpe 
ujjenyāmaṭṭahāse paṭupaṭaharavelāḍadeśe |
śrīśaile pālijāṭe paśupatinilaya hemabiṃdhyācaleṣu 
śrīmokāvāḍadeśe marutapathagirau ḍākinī sākinīnāṃ ||
kāsmīre cāndradeśe draviḍamalayake brahmavākye kurūte 
strīrājye hakvaḍoke urasivirajake siddhakṣetre uhāre |
eruḍyāṃ pārijāte himagiriśikhare kāñcideśe prayāge 
saurāṣṭre madhyadeśe bhṛgupuranagare kośare kāmbuke vā ||
karṇāṭe koṅkaṇe vā magadhapuravare karṇakubjaikaliṅge
vachome haṃsavāhe himarajapaṭale ḍoṅgare ḍoṅgarākhye 

<p. 149a> agnau he mātṛcakre munigaṇanilaye ḍohale candradeśe |
vā saure puṣparākhye girigahiraguhe cākule siṃhanāde ||
vaṅgākhye bhīmanāde śivapuranagare bhadrakūle jayākhye
śrīvidyākhyaikachatrapravaragiritaṭe yakṣakuṃbhe ca laṃkāṃ |
vārāṇasyāṃ viśāle tripatha munipathe śuddhakūle ca mārge 
mlecchānte mlecchamāle malayagiriguhā brahmadeśe pure vā ||
bhadrāṅge mūlasthāne prakṛtipuralaye siṃhakarṇe śaśāṅke 
triśotre vyomamadhye suravaraśayane gahvarākhye sthaleṣu |
yoginyā maṇḍajāñca vividhabudhanutā mātarastā ca sarvāstuṣṭhāḥ 
siddhā susiddhā vividhabudhanutā divyasiddhiṃ dadantu ||
khaḍgambā mantrasiddhiṃ puravaraviśanaṃ khegatiṃ rocanāmbā śatrū 
stambhaṃ ripūṇāṃ balipalita jayaṃ stambhanaṃ sarvavidyā |
dīrghāyuṣyaṃ kavitvaṃ nidhirasaguṭikāṃ pādukāṃ kāmasiddhiṃ 

<p. 149b> sarvāṇyetā dadantu alipiśitaratā bhairaveṇānuraktāḥ ||
duṣṭaścaurāri mārigrahagaṇagale vajrapāte raṇe vā
rājadvāre jalaughe vighaṭayatu bhayaṃ dhyāyitaścarmamuṇḍā |
vauṁ chauṁ phreṁ kārayantī ha ha ha ha ha hasitaiścarvayantī pibantī
nṛtyantī mantramātā kili kilita kiliḥ kaulabhāṣāṅgirantīṃ ||
sā śuṣkā kāmarūpāya laravapaṭa hā hā ha hūṃkāranādā 
uciṣṭhā nīlakaṇṭhā amara suhṛdayābindu mūrdhni prasastā ||
phreṁ phreṁ phretkārayantī ru ru rudhiravaśākhādyamānā saroṣā
jihvāgraṃ lālayantī la la la la la latā drāvayantī pibantī |
kṛṣṇā kāmākhyadūtī amaraguṇanutā bindunādāntalīnā
śaktante siddhidā mā paramapadagatā vaddhitāraṅgamaṅgā ||
prāgalbhā lokapālā gasapavanayutā pārthivenānuyuktā 
ṣaṣṭhasthā binduyuktā kulakamalalatātāriṇī kuṇḍalākhyā || vikhyā

<p. 150a> rudraśakti sa ca diśatu śivaṃ bhīṣaṇī bhadrakālī
kāṁ kīiṁ kūṁ kāmarūpā akulakulagatā dveṣiṇāṃ bhakṣayantī |
sāmeśrī kubjikākhyā vitaratu paramaṃ vāmadivyaṃ tvamoghaṃ 
cāmuṇḍā kaulamārgā kulakramasamaye kaulinī koṅkaṇākhyā ||
ākhyātā vāmamārge prakaṭitanilayā mālinī bindu dehā
oṃkāre maṇḍale vā akulakulamayā yogicakre praviṣṭhā |
śrīnāthotsaṅganāmā pravaramunigaṇe carcitā bhīmamūrtiḥ
sā devī lokamātā śivasakalamukhā pītṛ śrīnāthacakre ||
śrīkaṇṭhābhyarcyamānā caturyuga sahitā madhyaliṅgembikākhyā 
pīṭhasthā pūrayantī cakacakitakalā kaulamārgoditābhā |
nāmnā śrīkubjikākhyā tripathagatiyutā tryakṣarā triprakārā 
tāṃ devīṃ naumi bhaktyā prakaṭitanilayāṃ pañcakādyanta bhinnā ||
kālī kaṃkālarūpā kalitatalaravā bhīṣaṇī bhakṣayantī 
sāmeśrī kubjikāmbā prakaṭayatu mahājñāna divyaughamoghaṃ <5> ||

<p. 150b> hrīṁ glūṁ hrīṁ slūṁ hrīṁ plūṁ hrīṁ mlūṁ hrīṁ nlūṁ hsauṁ hsphreṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ 
aiṁ ṛddhiṃ dehi siddhiṃ dehi jñānaṃ dehi āyurdehi dhanaṃ dehi dhānyaṃ dehi 
lakṣmīn dehi imāṃ mahābaliṃ gṛhna <2> amṛtāvaḍhya svāhā || [iti mahābali 
samāptaṃ] ||

triyāñjali <3> ||
khphreṁ mahāpretāsanāya pādukāṃ || 
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ śrīsiddhilakṣmidevyai pādukāṃ 
pūjayāmi ||
ṣaḍaṅga || 
khphreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || khphreṁ śirase svāhā || khphreṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ kavacāya hūṁ || khphreṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || khphreṁ astrāya phaṭ ||
āvāhanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||
nirvāṇachāya || tvākamahābali ||
aiṁ <5> kṣāṁ kṣīṁ kṣūṁ kṣaḥ kṣetrapālāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> śrīṁ hrīṁ kulaputravaṭukanāthāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaḥ glauṁ śrīkulagaṇeśvarāya baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> hūṁ mahākanavīraśmaśānādhipataye baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||

<p. 151a> aiṁ <5> hskhphrīṁ śrīsiddhicāmuṇḍeśvarī baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ ākāśacāriṇī savargebhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> svāhā ||
aiṁ sarvebhyo bhūtebhyaḥ piśācebhyaḥ sarvebhyaḥ iṣṭadevatābhyo baliṃ gṛhna <2> 
svāhā || iti tvākamahābaliḥ ||

āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||

tarpaṇaṃ ||
namaḥ śrīnāthāya || namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya || namaḥ śrīkujeśanāthāya 
namo namaḥ ||

atha vīraghaṭapūjā ||
gurunamaskāraṃ ||
aiṁ <5> akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ |
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ ||
gururbrahmā gururviṣṇurgurudeva maheśvaraḥ |
gurudeva jagatsarvaṃ tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ ||
aiṁ <5> paramagurubhyo namaḥ || parameṣṭhī gurubhyo namaḥ || 
paramācāryagurubhyo namaḥ ||

nyāsaḥ ||
aiṁ hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ prasphura <2> hṛdayāya namaḥ ||
<5> ghora <2> taratanurūpa śirase svāhā ||

<p. 151b> <5> caṭa <2> pracaṭa <2> śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
<5> kaha <2> vama <2> kavacāya hūṃ ||
<5> dama <2> ghāṭaya <2> netratrayāya vaṣaṭ ||
<5> vighātaya <2> vighni <2> hūṁ <3> phaṭ astrāya phaṭ ||
iti ṣaḍaṅganyāsaḥ ||

āsanaṃ ||
ādhāraśaktaye pādukāṃ || anantāsanāya pādukāṃ || 
kandāsanāya pādukāṃ || nālāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
patrāsanāya pādukāṃ || keśalāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
karṇikāsanāya pādukāṃ || padmāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
siṃhāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
trideva ||
narāsanāya pādukāṃ || mayūrāsanāya pādukāṃ || 
mūṣāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> thhsrauṁ prastaradvīpa mahādhvāṃkṣa kṣetrapālāya pādukāṃ ||
<5> śrīṁ hrīṁ kulaputravaṭukanāthāya pādukāṃ ||
<5> gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaḥ glauṁ śrīkulagaṇeśvarāya pādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ baliṃ ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||
tarjanī daṇḍagajamudrāṃ darśayet ||

<p. 152a> brahmāṇyādi ||
haṃsāsanāya pādukāṃ || vṛṣāsanāya pādukāṃ || 
mayūrāsanāya pādukāṃ || garuḍāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
mahiṣāsanāya pādukāṃ || gajāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
pretāsanāya pādukāṃ || siṃhāsanāya pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> aṁ brahmāṇī devī pādukāṃ || <5> kaṁ māheśvarīdevī pādukāṃ ||
<5> caṁ kaumārīdevī pādukāṃ || <5> ṭaṁ vaiṣṇavīdevī pādukāṃ 
<5> taṁ vārāhīdevī pādukāṃ || paṁ indrāṇīdevī pādukāṃ ||
<5> yaṁ cāmuṇḍādevī pādukāṃ || <5> śaṁ mahālakṣmīdevī pādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ bali ||

aśitāṅgādi ||
hrāṁ aśitāṅgabhairavāya pādukāṃ || hrāṁ rurubhairavāya pādukāṃ ||
hrāṁ caṇḍabhairavāya pādukāṃ || hrāṁ krodhabhairavāya pādukāṃ ||
hrāṁ unmattabhairavāya pādukāṃ || hrāṁ kapālīśabhairavāya pādukāṃ ||
hrāṁ bhīṣaṇabhairavāya pādukāṃ || hrāṁ śaṃhārabhairavāya pādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ baliḥ ||

<p. 152b> atha dhyānaṃ ||
surāsurau madhyamāna kṣīrābdhau sāgare pure |
tatrotpannā mahādevī divyakanyā manorame ||
lākṣārasa nibhādevī padmarāga samaprabhā |
aṣṭādaśabhūjā devī ratnālaṃkāramaṇḍitā ||
saumyarūpadharā devī trinetrā navayauvanā |
khaḍgaṃ triśūlaṃ vajrañca diṇḍimaṃ muśaraṃ tathā ||
gadāṃ padmaṃ varaṃ pātraṃ dakṣiṇe ca virājitaṃ |
pheṭakāmaṃkuśaṃ ghaṇṭāṃ muṇḍa khaṭvāṅga kumbhayoḥ ||
nīlotpalā bhayaṃ bindu vāmahaste vidhāriṇī |
divyaratnakṛtā ṭopā hemābharaṇabhūṣitā ||
śvetapadmāsanāsīnā vaddhapadmāsanasthitā |
evaṃ dhyātvā mahādevī vāruṇī divyarūpiṇī ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

aghora || aiṁ <5> aghore hrāṁ thaghore hrīṁ ghoraghorantare hrūṁ phreṁ sarvataḥ sarva 
sarve hreṁ jūṃ saḥ hroṁ rudrarūpe hraḥ pādukāṃ ||

vajra || aiṁ <5> aiṁ vajrakubjinī hsphreṁ trailokyāṃ karṣaṇī hrīṁ kāmāṅga drāvanī 
klīṁ strīṁ mahākṣobhakāriṇī aiṁ soṁ saḥ śrīpādukāṃ ||

<p. 153a> vatīśī trayaṃ <3> || aiṁ <5> namo bhagavati hsphreṁ kubjikāyai hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ 
ghore aghore aghorāmukhī chāṁ chīṁ kiṇi <2> vicce pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> bhagavatī siddhe hsphrāṁ hsphrīṁ hsphrūṁ kubjike śrāṁ śrīṁ śrūṁ khage aiṁ 
ghore aghorāmukhī kiṇi <2> vicce pādukāṃ || 

thvatenaṃ baliṃ ||
triyāñjaliḥ ||
aiṁ <5> hskṣmlvryūṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ kulakumbhamūrtaye pādukāṃ ||
ṣaḍaṅgaḥ || 
hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ prasphura <2> hṛdayāya namaḥ ||
ghora <2> taratanurūpa śirase svāhā || caṭa <2> pracaṭa <2> śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
kaha <2> vama <2> kavacāya hūṁ || dama <2> ghāṭaya <2> netratrayāya vaṣaṭ ||
vighāṭaya <2> vighni <2> hūṁ <3> phaṭ astrāya phaṭ ||
aghorāstra ||
aiṁ <5> hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hraḥ prasphura <2> ghora <2> taratanu <2> rūpacaṭa <2> pracaṭa <2> kaha <2> 
vama <2> dama <2> ghātaya <2> vighātaya <2> vighni <2> hūṁ hūṁ hūṁ phaṭ kroṁ 
śrīmahākaumārikā vicce pādukāṃ ||
thvatenaṃ bali ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

<p. 153b> dhenu yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||

mahāpātrapūjā ||
aiṁkārāsanāya pādukāṃ ||

dhyānaṃ ||
padmapretādhirūḍhāṃ sphaṭikaṇi nibhāṃ pañcavaktrāṃ trinetrāṃ 
trailokyaṃ mohayantīṃ bhujadaśakayutāṃ divyavastrāvṛtāṅgīṃ |
vāme kāpālaśūlaṃ ghaṭavarada mahāpāśamuṇḍaṃ vahanti
ghaṇṭāṃ khaṭvāṅga khaḍgā bhayaśṛṇi sahitā siddhilakṣmī namāmi ||
iti dhyānapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||

aghorāstreṇapūjā ||
aiṁ <5> hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hraḥ prasphura <2> ghora <2> taratanu <2> rūpacaṭa <2> pracaṭa <2> kaha <2> 
vama <2> dama <2> ghātaya <2> vighāṭaya <2> vighni hūṁ <3> phaṭ kroṁ śrīmahākaumārikā 
vicce pādukāṃ ||
aiṁ <5> hrīṁ <2> glūṁ hrīṁ <2> slūṁ hrīṁ <2> mlūṁ hrīṁ <2> nlūṁ hrīṁ <2> paramāmṛtapātrāya 
pādukāṃ || <3> ||

mūlavidyā || triyāñjali <3> ||

<p. 154a> oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ śrīmahāpātrabhaṭṭārakāya 
pādukāṃ ||

ṣaḍaṅga ||
hrāṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || hrīṁ śirase svāhā || hrūṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
hreṁ kavacāya hūṁ || hroṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || hraḥ astrāya phaṭ ||
thvatenaṃ baliḥ ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ ||
yoni dhenumudrāṃ darśayet ||

jāpa ||
thrauṁ svāhā || <10> || śrīṁ hrīṁ svāhā ||<10> || glūṁ svāhā <10> || yāṁ svāhā <10> || 
hskṣmlvryūṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ svāhā <10> || oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ 
svāhā <10> ||

stotra ||
piṅgākṣī raktakeśaṃ kiṇi kini savaraṃ kiṅkinī mālajālaṃ 
daṃṣṭrāsyaṃ krūrabhāvaṃ sakalabhayaharaṃ pātrahastaṃ ca nādaṃ |
suvyaktaṃ siṃhanādaṃ ra ra ra ra ravaraṃ varvaraṃ vyomatatvaṃ
bhūtapretādināthaṃ grahagaṇasahitaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ namāmi ||
raktāmbaraṃ jvalitapiṅgajaṭākalāpaṃ
jvālāvalī dadhati daṇḍadhara pracaṇḍaṃ | 

<p. 154b> sūryodayā kanaka kāñcana śṛṅgagauraṃ 
gaurīsutaṃ vaṭukanāthamahaṃ namāmi ||
hantārṣākhoda duḥkhaṃ samitabhavabhavaṃ sarvavighnāntakāya
gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaiṁ ṣaḍaṅge gagaṇagatigate siddhi sarvārthadāya |
oṃ glūṁ mudrāgajākhya gasapavanagate ākhuyānaika daṃṣṭe 
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ gāṁ gaṇeśo dviradamukhagaṇo vighnināthe namaste ||
icchājñānīkriyā sāsuravaranamitā sā śriyāmaṅgalākhyā 
sā gaurī sā ca durgā bhagavati śubhadā mātṛkāścarmamuṇḍā |
sā brahmā sā ca viṣṇu grahagaṇasakalā bhairavī kṣetrapālo
sānekānekarūpā vividhagurudayā yoginī tvāṃ namāmi ||
lākṣārasa nibhā devī siṃdūrāruṇaśobhitā |
aṣṭādaśabhujā kīrṇā śastrālaṃkārabhūṣitā ||
kṣīrodamathanodbhūtā alidravya yathāpure |
saṃsāramohanī devī sṛṣṭisthiti ca kāriṇī ||

<p. 155a> devadevyā sṛyaṃtokṣaṃ ripuhaṃkārabhaṃjanī |
bhayaṃ chitvā śriyaṃ datvā pātu kādambarīśvarī ||
varṇāntoyaṃ harataragata kālabhū vāyusaṃsthaṃ
svānusvāra tribhuvanagata tumburu suprasiddha |
etanmantraṃ likhitvāpi vṛddhaṃ na pātuje agareṇa nāgaraṃ prayāntu ||
akhaṇḍakalasānāthaṃ kareṇa parśudhāriṇī |
svachandaṃ sphuraṇī mantra nidhe hi kularūpiṇī ||
atra gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpa yajñopavita arcane 
pūjāvidhānaṃ tatsarvaṃ paripūrṇamastu ||
iti vīramahāpātrapūjā ||

cipita māṣomiṣa matsya khaṇḍayuktaṃ samayaṃ pratibaliṃ dadyāt ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣata puṣpaṃ namaḥ ||
yoni khecarī guhyamudrāṃ pradarśayet ||

tarpaṇaṃ ||
namaḥ śrīnāthāya || namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya || namaḥ śrīkujeśanāthāya 
namo namaḥ ||

ghaṇṭhāpūjā ||
oṃ hrīṁ śrīṁ oṃ hūṁ jagadhvanimantramāta svāhā ||
dhūpadīpasaṃthāya ||

tato dhūpa ||
phaṭ iti mantreṇa dhūpabhāṇḍaṃ siṃcitvā sājyagurgulu dhūpa vāsādikaṃ ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ vanaspati rasotpannaṃ gandhāḍhyaṃ gandhamuttamaṃ |
āghreyaṃ sarvadevānāṃ dhūpoyaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||
divyagandhasamāyuktaḥ sarvadeva priyoruhaḥ |
āghreyaḥ sarvadevānāṃ dhūpoyaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||
dhūpāhāreṣu bhagavan viśvarūpi maheśvarī |
dhūpenānena deveśa prīyatāṃ parameśvarī ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṅgāyai saparivārāyai savāhanāyai sāyudhāyai eṣa 
dhūpo bhagavatyai namaḥ ||

tato dīpaṃ ||
dīpabhāṇḍaṃ hūṃ phaṭ iti saṃśodhya || 
suprakāśo mahātejaḥ sarvatra timirāpahaṃ |
savāhyābhyantaraṃ jyoti dīpoyaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||
ārātrikaṃ || samastacakre || hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṅgāyai eṣa dīpo namaḥ ||
devyā vāme svadakṣiṇabhāge mohani sādhanayāya ||
salaisa sabindunahāya || <3> || 
mohanī pātrayāduvane trikoṇa pañcapiṇḍaṃ vilikhya ||

<p. 156a> hsraiṁ śklhrīṁ hsauṁ dīpoparisthāpayet ||
khphreṁ siddhilakṣmī vidmahe kālikāyai dhīmahī tannaḥ śaṃkarṣaṇī pracodayāt 
||
candanādiyāya || pūjanaṃ ||
aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ tripurāyai sarvamantrāsanāyai namaḥ ||
aiṁ <5> śkṣmlvryīṁ śrī oṣadhīkramabhaṭṭārikāyai pādukāṃ || <3> || bali || 
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ nama pādukāṃ || bali ||
ṣaḍaṅga || 
khphreṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || khphreṁ śirase svāhā || khphreṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ ||
khphreṁ kavacāya hūṃ || khphreṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || khphreṁ astrāya phaṭ ||
āvāhanasthāpanacandanākṣatapuṣpaṃ namaḥ || yonimudrāṃ darśayet ||

tato naivedyaṃ ||
yathā vibhavapakvānna pāyasādi madhuradravyāni || hūṁ phaṭ ||
arghapatra jalena saṃśiṃcya || vauṣaṭ || avalokya || hūṁ avaguṇṭhya || 
namaḥ pūjayet ||
yāṁ yāṁ yāṁ yāṁ rāṁ rāṁ rāṁ rāṁ lāṁ lāṁ lāṁ lāṁ vāṁ vāṁ vāṁ vāṁ ||
etadbījacatuṣkeṇa 

<p. 156b> naivedyaṃ saṃśodhya dhenumudrayā amṛtīkṛtya 
navākṣareṇa vāratrayābhimantrya sāmagrī saṃdīpya ||
annaṃ caturvidhaṃ caiva rasaiḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ samanvitaṃ |
mayā niveditaṃ tubhyaṃ gṛhyatāṃ parameśvari ||
annaṃ mahārasaṃ divyaṃ rasaiḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ samanvitaṃ |
mayā niveditaṃ bhaktyā gṛhāṇa parameśvarī ||
naivedyaṃ gṛhyatāṃ devi bhakti me acalā kuru |
apamṛtyuharaṃ devi paratre ca parāgati ||
hrīṁ śrīṁ bhagavatyai sāṅgāyātyādi idaṃ naivedyaṃ namaḥ ||
naivedyānte punarācamanīyakaṃ bhagavatyai sāṃgāyai namaḥ ||

tatra phalādi || 
kadalībījapūrañca nāraṃgaḍādimaṃ tathā |
mayā niveditaṃ tubhyaṃ gṛhāṇa parameśvarī ||

tatastāmbūlaṃ ||
pūgīphalaṃ nāgadalaṃ karpūrādi samāyutaṃ |
elālavaṃgasaṃyuktaṃ tāmbūlaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ ||
parṇaṃ nirmala hemapatra sadṛśaṃ muktā sudhā pūritaṃ 
jātīpatra lavaṅga pūgasakalaiḥ karpūra pūrānvitaṃ |

p <157a> tāmbūlaṃ viniveditaṃ purahara prāṇesi tubhyaṃ mayā 
vaktrāhlādakaraṃ gṛhāṇavaradāṃ śrīsiddhilakṣmīnnamaḥ ||

japa || lāhātana tridevayā ||
thrauṁ svāhā <10> || śrīṁ hrīṁ svāhā <10> || glūṁ svāhā <10> ||
mālāpūjā ||
tato dhūpabhāṇḍe punarguggulādikaṃ datvā ||
khphreṁ saṃdhūpya japamāli hūṁ phaṭ śodhanaṃ ||
khphreṁ saṃdhūpya ||
candana siṃdūra puṣpākṣatena saṃpūjya ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ khphreṁ māṃ māre <2> mahāmāyai prasīda <2> mama siddhiṃ kuru <2> 
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā ||
aiṁ <5> aṁ āṁ iṁ īṁ uṁ ūṁ ṛṁ ṝṁ ḷṁ ḹṁ eṁ aiṁ oṁ auṁ aṃ aḥ ||
kaṁ khaṁ gaṁ ghaṁ ṅaṁ caṁ chaṁ jaṁ jhaṁ ñaṁ ṭaṁ ṭhaṁ ḍaṁ ḍhaṁ ṇaṁ taṁ thaṁ daṁ dhaṁ naṁ paṁ 
phaṁ baṁ bhaṁ maṁ yaṁ raṁ laṁ vaṁ śaṁ ṣaṁ saṁ haṁ kṣaḥ ||
kṣaṁ haṁ saṁ ṣaṁ śaṁ vaṁ laṁ raṁ yaṁ maṁ bhaṁ baṁ phaṁ paṁ naṁ dhaṁ daṁ thaṁ taṁ ṇaṁ ḍhaṁ ḍaṁ 
ṭhaṁ ṭaṁ ñaṁ jhaṁ jaṁ chaṁ caṁ ṅaṁ ghaṁ gaṁ khaṁ kaṁ ||
aḥ aṃ auṁ oṁ aiṁ eṁ ḹṁ ḷṁ ṝṁ ṛṁ ūṁ uṁ īṁ iṁ āṁ aṁ || lomavimomena smaret || <3> ||

<p. 157b> mālāsa bindutraya <3> || candanādiyāya ||
aiṁ <5> ḍmlvryūṁ hrīṁ akṣamālāyāṃ pādukāṃ || 
oṃ mālamāle mahāmāle sarvaśaktisvarūpiṇi |
caturvarga tvayi nyastaṃ tasmāt tvaṃ siddhidā bhava ||
iti mālāpūjā ||

paścimayā || hskṣmlvryūṁ śkṣmlvryīṁ svāhā <54> ||
tumbeśvarīyā || hskṣmlvryūṁ svāhā <54> ||

śikhāyā || 
hsphrāṁ hsphrīṁ hsphrūṁ śikhāsvachanda mahābhairavāya svāhā <54> ||
mahākālayā || oṃ hūṁ maṁ mahākālāya svāhā <54> ||
ugracaṇḍāyā || hsphreṁ svāhā <54> || ugracaṇḍīyā || hskhphreṁ svāhā <54> ||
siddhilakṣmīyā || oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ svāhā || <108> || kāliyā || oṃ 
phreṁ siddhikarāli hrīṁ chrīṁ hūṁ strīṁ phreṁ namaḥ svāhā <54> ||
tripurayā || aiṁ klīṁ sauṁḥ svāhā <54> || nirvāṇayāphakva ||
guhyātiguhya goptrī tvaṃ gṛhāṇā smatkṛtaṃ japaṃ |
siddhirbhavatu me yena tvatprasādā tvayi sthitaṃ ||

<p. 158a> etat paṭhitvā tanmanteṇākṣatapuṣpayuktaṃ devyā dakṣiṇahaste 
samarpaṇaṃ || idaṃ japaṃ gṛhāṇa svāhā ||
stotrayāya || maṇḍaladayake ||
kevo <5> votaya pañcapraṇavana || ghaṇṭāvādanaṃ || aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hsauṁḥ ||
akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ |
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīgurave namaḥ ||

śrīmahābhairavāya || śrīdevyuvāca ||
śrīsamvartāmaṇḍalānte kramapadanihitānanda śakti subhīmā 
sṛṣṭa nyāya catuṣkaṃ akulakulagataṃ pañcakañcānyaṣaṭkaṃ |
catvāraḥ pañcakonyaṃ punarapi caturaṃ ṣoḍaśājñābhiṣekaṃ 
devyāṣṭau mūrtimadhye hasakhaphala kalābindu puṣpākhyamudrā ||

vṛrddhaṃ kaumārabālaṃ paramaśivakalā vakradevī kramānyā 
śrīnāthaṃ cakrapūryāṃ navanavakaritaṃ yugmabhede tu sāraṃ |
kṛtatvaṃ siddhāvatāraṃ prathamakaliyuge koṃkane svādhikāraṃ 
teṣāṃ vai putraśiṣyāṃ navapuruṣamadateṣu madhyediraṣṭau ||

<p. 158b> santānaṃ gotrapiṇḍaṃ kulakramasakalaṃ ṣoḍaśāntā kramāntaṃ 
ādaurddhamaṇḍalādyai paribhima vimalaṃ pūjya sadbhāvavṛndaṃ ||
ādhāvasthā tu śāntaṃ kulakramasakalaṃ maṇḍalasthānapūrvaṃ 
saṃskāraṃ tṛkṣameka paśujanabhayakṛdbindu siddhi śivāgnau ||
madhye viśrāmabhūmiḥ prabhāvamanubhayaṃ pratyayaṃ svādhikāraṃ 
saṃsṛṣṭaṃ yena tasmai namati guruvaraṃ bhairavaṃ śrīkujeśaṃ ||
aiṁ yā sā śaktiḥ bhagākhyā tripathagatiyutā dakṣarātri prakārā
aiṁ tasyāḥ śrī odiyāne parakala sahitaṃ madhyasaṃsthaṃ sudīptaṃ |
hrīṁ tachrīṁ jālaṃdharākhya prakaṭitanilaye dakṣiṇe caiva koṇe 
śrīvāme śrīpūrṇagiripīṭhe paśujanabhayakṛt pūjitaṃ yena viśvaṃ ||
hsphreṁ tasyāgre kāmarūpaṃ madanakaliyutaṃ sarvasiddhālayāñca
hsauṁ trikoṇānte samastaṃ paramaśivakalālaṃ kṛtaṃ yogabiṃduṃ ||

<p. 159a> kṣmauṁ tanmadhye divyaliṅgaṃ paramaśivakalaṃ bindurūpaṃ kharūpaṃ
klīṁ nityānandasvarūpaṃ taduparimathanaṃ ṣaṭprakāre vibhinnaṃ ||
glūṁ vidyābhogāpagamya manubhayavimalaṃ tisrapīṭhe lalāṭe
aiṁ evaṃ vyāptaṃ samastaṃ sthitilayajananī rudraśaktistribhedā ||
aiṁ tatrasthā devadevī akulakulamayānanda dhātrī svadantrā
oṃ gurvājñābindubhūtā paśubhayaharaṇī siddhi devyaugharūpā ||
hsauṁ nityaṃ klinnā suraktā bhagamuditapadānandadātri prasiddhā 
kṣmauṁ kurvanti yatra kāmāmikṣabhi varatanuṃ śrīkubjikākhyāṃ namāmi ||
aiṁ santānaṃ merumārgeṇa anvayaṃ tatra devatā |
nirgamaḥ pīṭhi oṃkāre siddhānvaya prakirtitāḥ ||
tūṣṇi bhūtī guhāvāsī vṛkṣaścaiva kadambakaṃ |
śaṃketa sevitaṃ proktaṃ ambā ca guhavāsinī ||
gṛhaścaiva puraṃ proktaṃ bhedo manthānabhairavaḥ ||
gotra amarikādevī vāmamārge prakalpayet ||

<p. 159b> anvayaṃ pratyayaścāramadhikārastrikoṅkane |
janma brahmaśilāsthāne sthiti śrīkāmarūpake ||
kīrtiñciñcini vṛkṣe tu siddhiścaiva tu sāgare |
tuṣṭohaṃ tasya deveśi yo jānāti kulākramaṃ ||
ṣoḍaśādhāra bhedena nyāsaṃ kuśaṃ kramantathā |
pūjitaṃ siddhidaṃ bhadre suśiṣyāya nivedayet ||
oṃ namo'stute mahāmāye śūkṣmadehe parāpare |
ekākinī viśvadhāmne nādākhye bindumālini ||
adehārasamutpanne acale viśvadhāriṇi |
mahākuṇḍali nityaṃ haṃsamadhye vyavasthite ||
somasūryāgnimadhyasthe vyomavyāpī parāpare |
oṃkāravigrahāvasthe hakārārddhārddhadhāriṇī ||
vālāgra śatadhā śūkṣme anante cākṣaye vyaye |
hakārārddha kalādhāre padmakiṃjalka māśrite ||
sakalākhye mahāmāye varade lokapūjite |
ekaika nāḍimadhyasthe marmamekaika bhedinī ||

<p. 160a> aṣṭatriṃśatkalādevī bhedini brahmarandhrake |
vidyullatā nibhādevī bhujaṅga kuṭilākṛtiḥ ||
brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ |
ete pañcamahāpretā pādamūle vyavasthitā ||
trailokyajananī devī namaste śaktirūpiṇī |
iḍāpiṅgalamadhyasthe mṛṇālataṃturūpiṇī ||
bindumadhye gatā devī kuṭile cārddhacaṇḍike |
tuṣārakanikābhāse dvādaśāntāvalambinī ||
umākhye hṛdgate gaurī dvādaśādityavarcase |
śūnye śūnyantarāvasthe haṃsākhye prāṇadhāriṇī ||
lambākhye paramādevī dakṣiṇottaragāminī |
nāsāgre tu samuttīrṇe madhyasūtrapravāhinī ||
hṛllekhe paramānande tālamūrddhni vyavasthite |
nādaghaṇṭhika saṃghṛṣṭe guṇāṣṭaka samanvite ||
sthūle śūkṣme tva saṃkrūddhe dharmādharmapuṭadvaye |
kāryakāraṇa kartṛtve triśūnya nādavigrahe ||

<p. 160b> parāparapare śuddhe caitanye sāśvate dhruve |
sarvavarṇadharī devī guhyatatveti viśrute ||
śaktimūle mahāvyūhe bindubījasamanvite |
aśarīre mahābhāge saṃsārārṇavatāraṇī ||
jayā ca vijayā caiva jayantī ca parājitā |
tumburu bījamadhyasthe namaste pāpamocanī ||
bandhamokṣakarī devī ṣoḍaśānte vyavasthite |
bhramaṇī śaktiśūlena mahāvyūhasamanvite ||
brahmaṇī bhrāmaṇī gaurī māyā yaṃtra pravāhinī |
svacchandabhairavī devī krodha unmattabhairavī ||
pañcāśadvarṇarūpasthā tvayā rudrā prakīrtitā |
amṛtākhye ruruścaṇḍe namaste jñānabhairavī ||
daṃṣṭrotkaṭe vidyujjihve tārakākṣī bhayānane |
namāmi devadeveśi aghore ghoravikrame |
jvālāmukhī vegavatī umādevī sarasvatī |
yoginī ca śrīyādevī gaurī lakṣmī sarasvatī |

<p. 161a> haṃsa svarorddhage devī gomukhī śaktimālinī |
kroṣṭukī subhagādevī durgā kātyāyanī tathā ||
nityaṃ klinnā samākhyātā raktā caikākṣarā parā |
brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā ||
vārāhī caiva māhendrī cāmuṇḍā tvaṃ bhayānanā |
yogeśī tvaṃ hi deveśi kulāṣṭaka vibhūṣite ||
aṣṭāṣṭaka dharīdevī lakṣmīḥ śrībahurūpinī |
aindrī caiva tu āgneyī yāmyā nair(-)ṛtya vāruṇī ||
vāyuvyāṃ caiva kauverī īśānyāñca mudāhṛtāḥ |
prayāgā varuṇā kolā aṭṭahāsā jayantikā ||
caritrai kāmrakaṃ caiva devīkoṭaṃ tu cāṣṭakaṃ |
tathā kālī umādevī devadūtī namostute ||
bhadrakālī mahādevī carmamuṇḍā bhayāvahe |
mahocchukṣme mahāśānte namaste śaktirūpiṇī ||
bhurbhūvasveti svāhānte dayānāthaṃ kuruṣva me |
jñānārthito mahāmāye etadicchāmi vedituṃ ||

<p. 161b> yastvidaṃ paṭhyate stotraṃ trisaṃdhyāñcaiva mānavaḥ |
prāpnoti cintitān kāmāṃ strīṇāṃ bhavati vallabhaḥ ||
[iti śivaśakti samarasatve mahāmāyā stotraṃ samāptaṃ] ||

piṅgākṣī raktakeśaṃ kiṇi kini savaraṃ kiṅkinī mālajālaṃ 
daṃṣṭrāsyaṃ krūrabhāvaṃ sakalabhayaharaṃ pātrahastañca nādaṃ |
suvyaktaṃ siṃhanādaṃ ra ra ra ra ravaraṃ varvaraṃ vyomatatvaṃ 
bhūtapretādināthaṃ grahagaṇasahitaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ namāmi ||
raktāmbaraṃ jvalitapiṅgajaṭākalāpaṃ 
jvālāvalī dadhati daṇḍadhara pracaṇḍaṃ |
sūryodayā kanaka kāñcana śṛṅgagauraṃ
gaurīsutaṃ vaṭukanāthamahaṃ namāmi ||
hantārṣyakhodaduḥkhaṃ samitabhavabhayaṃ sarvavighnāntakāyaṃ
gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaiṁ ṣaḍaṅge gagaṇagatigate siddhi sarvārthadāya |
oṃ glūṁ mudrā gajākhya gasapavanagate ākhuyānaika draṃṣṭe 
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ gāṁ gaṇeśo dviradamukhagaṇo vighnināthe namaste ||

<p. 162a> brahmāṇīyā ||
brahmāṇīṃ haṃsayānāṃ drutakanakanibhāṃmabddhivaktrāṃ trinetrāṃ
hastāgre brahmakurcāṃ kalasamapi lasaddaṇḍamabjākṣamālāṃ |
vibhrāṇāṃ cāruveṣāmatha harihaya dikpatramūle jayettāṃ
gaṃdhādyaiḥ karvurāṃgīmvahativara jaṭājūṭabhāraṃ namāmi || <1> ||

māheśvarīyā ||
māheśīntāṃ kapāloḍḍamaru ḍamarukābhīti śūloruṭaṃkāṃ
vibhrāṇāṃ bāhudaṇḍairniviḍa himanibhāmagni dikpatramūle |
netrairudbhāsasānāṃ tribhiraruṇa jaṭākoṭi varddhendu khaṇḍāṃ 
gaṃdhādyaiḥ pūjayedyāvṛṣabhamuḍugatā nityamāruhyayāti || <2> ||

kaumāriyā ||
kaumāri yauvanāḍhyāṃ suruciravadanāṃ kuṃkumābhāṃmuśobhāṃ 
śaktiṃ pāśāṃkuśe yā vahati nijakarai dakṣiṇe cābhayañca |
hālālolāṃ viśālāṃ lasanayanayugāmarcayed gandhapuṣpaiḥ
sarvālaṃkālayuktāṃ śikhiniyama diśāpatra mūle niṣarṇāṃ || <3> ||

<p. 162b> vaiṣṇavīyā ||
rakṣo dikpatramūle sajala jaladhara śyāmalāṅgīṃ sukeśīṃ
ghaṇṭhāṃ kambuṃ kapālaṃ rathacaraṇamatho vibhratī bāhudaṇḍaiḥ |
āsīnāṃ vaiṇateye maṇimayamukuṭodbhāsitāṃ vaiṣṇavīntāṃ 
gandhādyairarcayadyā madhumadamuditā nityamālola tṛptiṃ || <4> ||

vārāhīyā ||
vārāhīṃ kheṭakāspudbhaṭamuśalahalāṃ vibhratīṃ yoḍivaktrāṃ 
pāścātre patramūle maṇimaya vilasat kuṇḍalodghṛṣṭagaṃḍāṃ |
yā śaśvadviśvapūjyā giriśikharakharābhīmakole niṣaṇḍāṃ 
gaṃdhādyairarcayettāṃ suruciradaśanāṃ dhūmadhumrāṅgakāntiṃ || <5> || 

indrāṇīyā ||
indrāṇīṃ candrabimba pratimaṇijamukhīmindranīlābhavarṇāṃ 
karṇāntodbhrāntanetrāṃ maṇimayamukuṭāṃ vāyudikpatra mūle |
cāpaṃ kaṃbūṃ triśūlaṃ śaramapi dadhatīṃ hastapadmaiścaturbhi
svaimātaṅgai niṣaṇḍāṃsuravaravinutāmarcayennityamattāṃ || <6> ||

<p. 163a> cāmuṇḍāyā ||
cāmuṇḍā caṇḍahāsodbhaṭa vikaṭaradābhinnavaktrāṃ trinetrāṃ 
khaḍgaṃ śūlaṃ kapālaṃ nijakarakamalairvibhratīṃ kheṭakañca |
nirmāṃsā raktanetrāṃ tribhuvanabhayadāṃ saumya dikpatramūle
kālaṃ kaṃkālabhūṣāṃ pitṛvananilayāmarcayedūrddhakeśīṃ || <7> ||

mahālakṣmīyā ||
paścādāścaryarūpāṃ suruciravadanāṃ śuddhajāmbunadābhāṃ
hastābjai rakṣasūtrā bhayakamalalasanmātuluṃgaṃ phalāni |
vibhrāṇāmarcayentāṃ tribhuvaṇa jalaḍādyarcitāṃ lakṣaṇāḍhyāṃ 
lakṣmīmuttuṅgapīnastanabharaṇamitā mīśa dikpatramūle || <8> ||

thvate brahmāṇyādi ||
aśitāṅgādi ||
namo sitāṅgo rurucaṇḍasaṃjñakaḥ 
krodhīśa munmattakapālabhairavaḥ |
palāśamadhye tvatha bhīṣaṇākhyaḥ 
saṃhārasaṃjñaṃ praṇamāmi bhairavān ||

hetukādiyā ||
yo hetuko yastripurāntakaśca yo vahnivetālahutāśa jihvaḥ |

<p. 163b> kālaṃ kapālañca tathaika pādau 
bhīmākṛtiryaḥkhalu bhīmarūpaṃ ||

ugracaṇḍāyā ||
mahiṣaghne mahāmāye caṇḍamuṇḍavināśine |
raktabījahare devi ugracaṇḍiṃ namāmyahaṃ ||

bagalāyā ||
vādīmūkatiraṃkatiḥ kṣitipatirvaiśvānaraḥ śrītati
krodhī sāmyati durjana sujanati kṣiprā dhvagaḥ khaṃjati |
garvī kharvati sarvavirjaḍayati tvadyaṃtranā yantritaṃ 
śrīnitye bagalāmukhi pratidinaṃ kalyāṇi tubhyaṃ namaḥ || 

triśaktiyā ||
raktāśuṣkātikṛṣṇā tripathagatiyutāstriṇidevyā trimātrā
svāṃ stutvā ye palabdhāpi vadha padagatā triṇi vargā prasiddhā |
tāruṇyā bālavṛddhā bhavati bhavatarā triṇikālaprabodhā
vetāmātā sugarbhā jayatu jaya pradā nityapūjā śivāṅgā ||

hanubhairavayā ||
namāmi parameśānaṃ rudraṃ bhairavarūpiṇaṃ |
trailokyarakṣaṇaṃ devaṃ ḍāmarādhipatiṃ prabhuṃ ||

<p. 164a> nāṭeśvarayā ||
pāṇibhyāṃ paritaprapīḍyanala sanniścotpaniścātpa ca 
brahmāṇḍaṃ sakalaṃ pacelimalasat proccairphalobhaṃ muhuḥ |
pāyaṃ pāyamapāyatastrijaṭo munmattavantairasai 
rnṛtyastāṇḍavaḍamvareṇa vidhinā pāyān mahābhairavaḥ ||

pañcamī vārāhīyā ||
namostute mahāmāye vārāhi nāmadhāriṇī |
kolāsyāṃ ca mahāraudrī vajratuṇḍadharāyani ||

siddheśvarayā ||
ekāsyā trilocanasyā khandendu kṛtaśeṣarā |
caturhastā maheśāni dvayahastakṛtāñjalī ||
pretāsano pariṣṭhantu raktavarṇā mahojjvalā |
koṭipūrṇendubhā devī jvalanmāna sutejasā ||

chinnamastāyā ||
nābhau śubhrārabindaṃ tadupari vimalaṃ maṇḍalaṃ caṇḍaraśmeḥ
saṃsārasyaikāsāratribhuvaṇajananīṃ dharma karmodayāya |
tasminmadhye trimārge tritayatanudharāṃ chinnamastāṃ prasastāṃ

<p. 164b> tāṃ vande jñānarūpāṃ maraṇabhayaharāṃ yoginī yogamudrāṃ ||

ūkāro nṛtyapādau hasakṣamaravujovodaraścāgniliṅga 
vāyuvyāṃ ghrāñjinākaśasisakala śirobindunādordhayuktaḥ |
nirjiṅgaṅgāmbudhārā ṛjuparamakalā bhairavo mantramūrtiḥ 
pāyoddeva navātmā sakalaguruvaraṃ bhairavaṃ śrīkujeśaṃ ||

brahmāṇī kamalendu saumyavadanī māheśvarī līlayā 
kaumārī ripudarpanāśanakarī cakrāyudhā vaiṣṇavī |
vārāhī ghanaghoraghargharamukhī aindrī ca vajrāyudhā 
cāmuṇḍā gaṇanātha bhairavagaṇāḥ rakṣantu me mātṛkā ||

madhye tisrāsanasthā madamuditamukhī vajrapadmo sudīptā
brahmāṇyādyaṣṭapatre svaradigapraṇave śrīprayādi kṣetre |
yuktāstā viṃśakoṇe vasaṣaśa haṣakṣavajraśṛṃge sphurantī
sāṣṭāviṃśā tribhedā kramapadasahitā pātu dvātriṃśavarṇā ||

khaḍgaṃ vā mantrasiddhi puravaravyasanaṃ khegatirlocanaṃ vā
<p. 165a> śatrustambhaṃ ripūṇāṃ ali valita jaya stambhanaṃ sarvavidyā |
dīrghāyuṣyaṃ kavitvaṃ nidhirasaguṭikā pādukā kāmasiddhiḥ
sarvācintādadante alibali sahitā bhairaveṇānyayuktā ||

śyāmāraktā trinetrāstanabharaṇamitā mattamātaṅgagāmī
bimboṣṭhī cārunetrā pṛthutarajaghanā mekhalā ratnaśobhe |
devāṅge vastraśobhe valavalakusume varvare keśabhārā 
sāme śrīkubjikākhyā vitaratu rasājñānadivyoghamogha ||

bandhūkadyuti saṃnibhāṃ triṇayanīṃ siṃhāsanīṃ sundarīṃ 
sarveṣāmiha sarvaśatruharaṇīṃ śuklāmbarābhūṣitāṃ |
yasyāṣṭādaśapāṇi padmavimalāṃ vāṃchā phalārthapradāṃ 
tāṃ vande mahiṣāsurapramathanīṃ tumbeśvarīmambikāṃ ||

kvākāśa kva samīraṇaḥ kva dahanaḥ kvāpaḥ kva viśvambharā
kva brahmā kva janārdanaḥ kva bhujagaḥ kvendraḥ kva devāsurāḥ |

<p. 165b> kalpāntālabhaṭainataḥ pramuditaḥ śrīsiddhiyogeśvaraḥ 
krīḍānāṭakanāyako vijayate devo mahābhairavaḥ |

mahākālaṃ mahārudraṃ mahākṛṣṇāñjanaprabhuḥ |
sthūlarūpaṃ mahākāyaṃ kartikāpāladhāriṇaṃ ||
khaḍgapheṭakadharaṃ devaṃ trinetraṃ jvalana prabhaṃ |
namastestu mahākālaṃ śatrusaṃhāranāśanaṃ ||
mārkaṇḍeyo vipadupahatānugrahāyāvatāraṃ
cakre yasya pracūrṇitakaro brahmaṇi brahmakalpaḥ |
daityachedapramudita śirastotra garbhaprabhāvā
soyaṃ devyā bhavatu bhavatā śrīyasya caṇḍikāyāḥ ||

yā devī madhukaiṭabhapramathanī yā caṇḍamuṇḍāśanī 
yāmādyā mahiṣāsurakṣayakarī yā raktabījāśrayā |
yā sā śumbhaniśumbha daityadalani yā devadevāśriyā
sā devī mama rakṣa dakṣiṇabhujaiścaṇḍi jayo rakṣatu ||

utphullāmbuja karṇikoparigatā śrīsiddhilakṣmī lakṣmīparā
<p. 166a> karpūrasphaṭikendu kundadhavalā niḥśeṣapāśopahā |
saṃsārārṇavaduḥkhapaṅkajahari niṣkaṃpano sarvadā 
śrīmatpañcamukhāmbujā daśabhujā preta sthitā pātu vaḥ ||

āsāpūriṇī pāpahāriṇi jagadduḥkhaugha vidhvaṃsinī
kleśottāriṇi vairimāriṇi jagat saṃsāramohāntakīḥ |
śreyaskāraṇi kāraṇe suravaraḥ prāṇārti saṃcāriṇe 
tvāṃ sadyo suradā abhimaravaradā śrīsiddhilakṣmīṃ namaḥ ||

yā sāntakāgnikuharo sthiti bhāsvarūpā 
somārka vahni tripathodara madhyasaṃsthā |
cicceta cittaviṣayākṣabalīnabhāvā
sṛṣṭisthiti pralayakāraṇa tatvarūpā ||

jñānātmikā sakalabhāvavibhāgabhinnā 
ānandanandita sadā paramārthalīnāḥ |
nāḍīkalā kalitavigraha mantrarūpā
saptādaśākṣaragatā khalu chidravarṇā ||

<p. 166b> vidyāśatākṣara gatā kulakarma caṇḍā
trailokyaraṃpatavarā kulasaṃga siddhā |
ekāhyaneka gati cakra varaprapūjyā 
satsaṃgasiddhivara bhairavapūjitāyā ||

kālī kalā kalita kālakalormi cāhā 
śrīcakra cakranilayā navabheda bhinnā |
pūrṇā śaśāṃkakalitā kulabhānurūpā 
vijñānasiddhivara vahni kulaprasiddhā ||

ālabdha khecarapadā paramapracaṇḍā
cakrakramena gaditamantamahārthavelā |
satsaṅga yoganiratā kulasiddhidātri 
svābhāvabhāvikī parāṃ praṇamāmi kālīṃ ||

aindrasyaiva śarāsanasya dadhatī madhye lalāṭe prabhāṃ
sauṁ klīṁ kāntimanusta gaurī vaśīrasyāstanvatī sarvataḥ |
eṣāsau tripurāhṛti dyuti rivoṣṇāṃśo sadāha sthitā 
chindyādva sahasā balitripuraghaṃ jyotirmayī vāṅmayī ||

māyākuṇḍalanī kriyā madhumatī kālī kalāmālinī
<p. 167a> mātaṅgī vijayā jayā bhagavatī devī śivā sāmbhavī |
śaktiḥ śaṃkaravallabhā trinayanī vāgvādinī bhairavī
hrīṁ kālī tripurā parāparamukhī mātā kumārītyasi ||

namaste devadeveśi siddhilakṣmī mahaujasā |
pratyaṃgirā mahādevī rājyalakṣmī namostute ||

tvamasi paramakālī siddhilakṣmīstvameva 
tvamasi paramacaṇḍī ugracaṇḍī tvameva |
tvamasi paramarājaṃ rājarājeśvarī tvaṃ
sakalanihata śatruṃ sarvasiddhiṃ dadātu ||

nānyaṃ vadāmi na ca śṛṇomi na cintayāmi 
nānyaṃ smarāmi na bhajāmi na cāśrayāmi |
muktātvadīya caraṇāṃbujamādareṇa 
māṃ pāhi bhūti kṛpayā mayi dehi siddhiṃ ||

yathā vāṇaprahārāṇāṃ kavacaṃ bhavati vāraṇaṃ |
tadvadeva vighātānāṃ śāntirbhavatu vāraṇaṃ ||

svasthāna kṣetrapālāya brahmāṇyādi aśitāṅgamahābhairava sahitāya
gaṇavaṭukayoginī kṣetrapālāya sāṅgāya sagaṇasparivārāya 
digvidik indrādi lokapālāya suprītā varadā bhavantu ||
yajamānasya mānavagotra śrīśrījayabhūpatīndramalladeva varmaṇaḥ 
śrīśrīśrīsveṣṭadevatāprītyarthaṃ pāṣāṇanirmita prāsādapratiṣṭhā 
tadupari suvarṇakalaśadhvajāvarohaṇa koṭyāhuti siddhāgni yajña 
adhivāsanakarmaṇi thaṇḍilārcana nimityārthena yajamānasya 
sagaṇasparivārāṇāṃ āyurārogyamaiśvarya janadhanalakṣmī santati 
santānavṛddhirastu yathā śāstroktaphalavaladāyano bhavantu ||

anyatra śaraṇaṃ nāsti tvameva śaraṇaṃ mama |
tasmāt kāruṇya bhāvena rakṣa rakṣa parameśvari ||
atra gandha puṣpa dhūpa dīpa yajñopavīta arcane 
pūjāvidhānantatsarvaṃ paripūrṇamastu ||

<p. 168a> tarpaṇaḥ ||
prītapretāsanasthā bhavabhayaharaṇo bhairavo mantramūrti
ścaṇḍi caṇḍāsanasthā gaṇaguruvaṭukā lokapālā phaṇīndrāḥ |
rakṣā yakṣā sutīrthāḥ pitṛgaṇasakalāḥ mātaraḥ kṣetrapālā
yoginyo yogayuktāḥ jalacara khacarā pānametat pibantu ||

pibantu devatāḥ sarve sarudrāḥ sagaṇādhipāḥ |
yoginyaḥ kṣetrapālāśca mama dehe vyavasthitāḥ || vākyaḥ ||

namaḥ śrīnāthāya || namaḥ śrīsiddhināthāya || namaḥ śrīkujeśanāthāya 
namo namaḥ ||

[iti śrīthaṇḍilārcanavidhiḥ samāptaḥ] ||

adhivāsanapūjāyāya ||
upavāsayāya || thvate [adhivāsanavidhiḥ samāptaḥ] ||




